&lt;p&gt;IMC is seeking a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Compensation Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join our global Compensation team and play a key role in supporting the firm’s continued growth across Europe. Reporting to the Head of Compensation, this role will have regional responsibility for compensation across Europe and will lead critical initiatives spanning job architecture, pay structures, benchmarking, and annual compensation processes. The role will sit within a global team and will be responsible for global strategic projects and processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a strategic partner, you will collaborate with business leaders, HR, and cross-functional teams to design and deliver compensation programs that are market-competitive, internally equitable, and aligned with IMC’s global rewards philosophy and local regulatory requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead core workstreams in the annual compensation cycle (e.g., merit, bonus, promotions), providing guidance and support to compensation planners across Europe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and maintain &lt;strong&gt;job architecture, leveling frameworks, and salary structures&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring alignment with market data and internal equity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct and lead &lt;strong&gt;pay equity analyses&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring fair and consistent pay practices across the region and driving remediation where needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and reinforce &lt;strong&gt;governance frameworks&lt;/strong&gt; for compensation decisions, partnering with Legal and HR to ensure compliance with European regulations and evolving pay transparency requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted advisor to HR Business Partners and business leaders, translating compensation data into clear insights and recommendations to inform decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and deliver &lt;strong&gt;data-driven insights, reporting, and dashboards&lt;/strong&gt; to identify trends, risks, and opportunities across the European workforce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with HR, Finance, and HRIS (Workday) teams to enhance compensation processes, tools, and analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead benchmarking analyses and survey participation to ensure competitive market positioning across multiple European markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive &lt;strong&gt;communication and change management efforts&lt;/strong&gt; related to compensation programs, including developing guidance and training materials for HR and business stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to streamline and improve compensation processes, tools, and stakeholder experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of progressive experience in compensation or total rewards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise in &lt;strong&gt;job evaluation, job architecture, and salary structure design and management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience conducting &lt;strong&gt;pay equity analyses&lt;/strong&gt; and supporting compensation governance and compliance frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing compensation across &lt;strong&gt;multiple European countries&lt;/strong&gt;, with understanding of regional regulations and market practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced analytical skills with strong proficiency in Microsoft Excel; experience building dashboards or visualisations is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to interpret complex data and translate it into clear, actionable insights for business leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering with HR, Finance, and cross-functional stakeholders in a global environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills, with the ability to influence and educate stakeholders at multiple levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead change, improve processes, and enhance how compensation programs are delivered and understood&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Workday Compensation and/or other compensation tools (e.g., PayFactors, Salary.com)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;IMC is a research-driven trading firm where quantitative modeling, machine learning, and engineering shape how modern markets are traded. A stabilizing force in markets since 1989, we provide liquidity across trading venues, delivering the best outcome in value and risk management to investors. Using our own technology and capital, we build proprietary systems and algorithms that operate across global markets. Our researchers, traders, and engineers work as a collective, combining rapid experimentation, advanced infrastructure, and real-time feedback to turn insight into execution and execution into advantage.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;IMC is one of the world’s leading trading firms, combining quantitative research, technology and trading expertise to solve complex problems at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Machine Learning becomes increasingly important within our Systematic Equities business, we are investing in frontier research that can shape the next generation of models, infrastructure and research capabilities. With access to world-class datasets, significant compute resources and a highly collaborative environment, IMC offers a unique opportunity to see cutting-edge research translated into real-world impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Principal Research Scientist to help define and accelerate our long-term machine learning research agenda. Prior finance experience is not required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is designed for an established academic researcher or research scientist who wants to remain connected to the frontier of machine learning while applying their expertise in a highly impactful environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work alongside quantitative researchers, engineers and research leadership to identify emerging research directions, evaluate new developments in machine learning, and help translate promising academic advances into practical applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rather than owning individual trading strategies, you will act as a scientific leader, mentor and advisor across the research organisation. You will also represent IMC externally through participation in leading conferences and engagement with the broader machine learning community.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the long-term machine learning research agenda within Systematic Equities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and translate advances from frontier ML research into practical opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct original research and develop proof-of-concept solutions where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise and mentor quantitative researchers on methodology, experimentation and research direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help guide future investments in research tooling, infrastructure and compute capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent IMC within the global machine learning community through conferences such as NeurIPS, ICML and ICLR.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to publication efforts where appropriate and consistent with intellectual property considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PhD in Machine Learning, Computer Science, Statistics, Mathematics, Physics or a related quantitative discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding academic credentials and a strong publication record in leading research venues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable interest in Financial Markets is required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Current or recent experience in a faculty-equivalent academic or research leadership role such as Assistant Professor, Associate Professor, Professor, Group Leader, Principal Investigator, Senior Postdoctoral Researcher, or Senior Research Scientist.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in modern machine learning and strong awareness of emerging research trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience influencing research direction, mentoring researchers, or leading research initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong programming skills and experience with modern machine learning frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills and the ability to collaborate across disciplines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We Offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to influence the future of machine learning at one of the world’s leading trading firms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to exceptional datasets, infrastructure and large-scale compute resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continued engagement with the academic community through conferences, collaborations and publication opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative environment where research can move rapidly from idea to impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation that reflects both scientific excellence and commercial impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;IMC is a research-driven trading firm where quantitative modeling, machine learning, and engineering shape how modern markets are traded. A stabilizing force in markets since 1989, we provide liquidity across trading venues, delivering the best outcome in value and risk management to investors. Using our own technology and capital, we build proprietary systems and algorithms that operate across global markets. Our researchers, traders, and engineers work as a collective, combining rapid experimentation, advanced infrastructure, and real-time feedback to turn insight into execution and execution into advantage.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p class=&quot;_13fp8yk6c dzswju0 dzswju2&quot;&gt;As a Machine Learning Engineer, you will play a pivotal role in building systems that drive the training and deployment of large-scale ML models across our global operations. You&#39;ll collaborate with leading researchers, hardware experts, and software engineers to build robust solutions that maximize the potential of GPU acceleration, distributed computing, and the latest open-source tools. Your work will influence our trading strategies by accelerating experimentation cycles that foster continuous innovation and refinement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;_13fp8yk6c dzswju0 dzswju2&quot;&gt;This is a unique opportunity to solve problems at the intersection of advanced machine learning and trading, where your contributions will shape the future of IMC’s technology and trading capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;_13fp8yk6c dzswju0 dzswju2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;_13fp8yk6c dzswju0&quot;&gt;Your Core Responsibilities:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;_13fp8yk6c dzswju0 dzswju2&quot;&gt;The opportunity to be in a brand new position in a growing team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;_13fp8yk6c dzswju0 dzswju2&quot;&gt;Develop large-scale distributed training pipelines to manage datasets and complex models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;_13fp8yk6c dzswju0 dzswju2&quot;&gt;Build and optimize low-latency inference pipelines, ensuring models deliver real-time predictions in production systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;_13fp8yk6c dzswju0 dzswju2&quot;&gt;Develop libraries to improve the performance of machine learning frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;_13fp8yk6c dzswju0 dzswju2&quot;&gt;Maximize performance in training and inference using GPU hardware and acceleration libraries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;_13fp8yk6c dzswju0 dzswju2&quot;&gt;Design scalable model frameworks capable of handling high-volume trading data and delivering real-time, high-accuracy predictions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;_13fp8yk6c dzswju0 dzswju2&quot;&gt;Collaborate with quantitative researchers to automate ML experiments, hyperparameter tuning, and model retraining&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;_13fp8yk6c dzswju0 dzswju2&quot;&gt;Partner with HPC specialists to optimize workflows, improve training speed, and reduce costs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;_13fp8yk6c dzswju0 dzswju2&quot;&gt;Evaluate and roll out third-party tools to enhance model development, training, and inference capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;_13fp8yk6c dzswju0 dzswju2&quot;&gt;Dig into the internals of open-source ML tools to extend their capabilities and improve performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;_13fp8yk6c dzswju0 dzswju2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;_13fp8yk6c dzswju0&quot;&gt;Your Skills and Experience:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;_13fp8yk6c dzswju0 dzswju2&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience in machine learning with a focus on training or inference systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;_13fp8yk6c dzswju0 dzswju2&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with real-time, low-latency ML pipelines in high-performance environments is a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;_13fp8yk6c dzswju0 dzswju2&quot;&gt;Strong engineering skills, including Python, CUDA, or C++&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;_13fp8yk6c dzswju0 dzswju2&quot;&gt;Knowledge of machine learning frameworks such as PyTorch, TensorFlow, or JAX&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;_13fp8yk6c dzswju0 dzswju2&quot;&gt;Proficiency in GPU programming for training and inference acceleration (e.g., CuDNN, TensorRT)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;_13fp8yk6c dzswju0 dzswju2&quot;&gt;Experience with distributed training for scaling ML workloads (e.g., Horovod, NCCL)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;_13fp8yk6c dzswju0 dzswju2&quot;&gt;Exposure to cloud platforms and orchestration tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;_13fp8yk6c dzswju0 dzswju2&quot;&gt;A track record of contributing to open-source projects in machine learning, data science, or distributed systems is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;IMC is a research-driven trading firm where quantitative modeling, machine learning, and engineering shape how modern markets are traded. A stabilizing force in markets since 1989, we provide liquidity across trading venues, delivering the best outcome in value and risk management to investors. Using our own technology and capital, we build proprietary systems and algorithms that operate across global markets. Our researchers, traders, and engineers work as a collective, combining rapid experimentation, advanced infrastructure, and real-time feedback to turn insight into execution and execution into advantage.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;IMC is seeking Deep Learning Researchers to join our growing team. As a Deep Learning Researcher, you will develop and apply state-of-the-art deep learning techniques at the intersection of AI and markets. You will help accelerate our efforts in areas such as modern neural network architectures and representation learning, improving our large-scale AI models that increasingly shape our trading. You will work closely with senior researchers to gain exposure to the full research lifecycle, from initial idea to production deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate has a strong foundation in modern AI and machine learning research, gained through post-graduate study or internships. Prior financial industry experience is not required. We are looking for someone who brings rigorous scientific thinking and a drive to learn, and who wants to grow alongside experienced researchers as we build a world-class deep learning capability at IMC.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Core Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and improve deep learning models to enhance trading performance across multiple asset classes, working under the guidance of senior researchers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Contribute to research in areas such as representation learning, transformers, foundation models, generative AI, reinforcement learning, and other emerging deep learning techniques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Support large-scale data curation, feature representation, and self-supervised and multimodal learning from structured and unstructured datasets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Contribute to shared training infrastructure and deployment pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Stay current with academic and industry developments in deep learning and share relevant research with the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;1145116c1eb3&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A minimum of an MSc (PhD preferred) in Machine Learning, Statistics, Deep Learning, Probabilistic Programming, or a related quantitative field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d86946f6-cee0-4951-8ebf-d6466f184f7e&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;bulletList&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;78bd751b-c85c-4a73-b7f5-9f65ae132ad2&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;5a34c4d22cb0&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Currently in your final year of study, graduating in 2027&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;e2a7bff7-8a28-4a88-95de-8bf964eed05d&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;4684215345cf&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;A minimum of an MSc (PhD preferred) in Machine Learning, Statistics, Deep Learning, Probabilistic Programming, or a related quantitative field&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;e2a7bff7-8a28-4a88-95de-8bf964eed05d&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;4684215345cf&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Demonstrated experience in deep learning research or applied machine learning. For PhD candidates, we expect a record of research contributions in your area published at leading ML venues (e.g., NeurIPS, ICML, ICLR). For Bachelor’s and Master’s candidates, research experience is required but can take other forms, e.g. thesis work, open-source contributions, or projects&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with modern deep learning architectures, such as transformers, sequence models, representation learning, self-supervised learning, and/or generative models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Solid understanding of the theoretical foundations of deep learning, optimization, statistical learning, and neural network training dynamics&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Strong programming skills in Python and hands-on experience with at least one modern deep learning framework, such as PyTorch, JAX, or TensorFlow&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Strong communication skills with the ability to explain technical ideas clearly to both technical and non-technical audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;You may submit one application per role each year.&amp;nbsp; We strongly encourage you to focus on applying to a single role that best matches your skills and interests.&amp;nbsp; Though you may apply to multiple roles, please note that each application will be evaluated based on the specific criteria established for that particular role. If you have already applied for this position during the current recruitment season and were not selected, you may reapply when the next recruitment season begins in 2027.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;f7422f8daf66&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Please note that, due to current regulations with the Immigratie en Naturalisatiedienst (IND), IMC is unable to obtain immigration sponsorship for candidates who currently have citizenship from Russia, Belarus or Iran, and attend university in one of the aforementioned countries. We greatly appreciate your understanding and hope to consider you for future opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;b6248bd508e8&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;If you have citizenship from Ukraine, you will need to confirm that you currently hold a biometric passport so that IMC can obtain the correct immigration sponsorship for you. Please confirm by emailing &lt;a ----- data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; ----- If you are currently residing or attending university outside of Russia, Belarus, or Iran, and have existing work authorisation in the Netherlands or are eligible to work without sponsorship, we encourage you to apply and inform our campus recruitment team of your situation: &lt;a ----- data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; ----- class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;IMC is a research-driven trading firm where quantitative modeling, machine learning, and engineering shape how modern markets are traded. A stabilizing force in markets since 1989, we provide liquidity across trading venues, delivering the best outcome in value and risk management to investors. Using our own technology and capital, we build proprietary systems and algorithms that operate across global markets. Our researchers, traders, and engineers work as a collective, combining rapid experimentation, advanced infrastructure, and real-time feedback to turn insight into execution and execution into advantage.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;About us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://constructorlabs.org/&quot;&gt;Constructor Labs&lt;/a&gt; is the research arm of Constructor Knowledge, based at Campus Ring 1 in Bremen, Germany. Our work is organized around three units: Knowledge Labs, Cyber Labs and Science Labs. We apply computing, software and robotics research to make scientists, teachers and students more effective, working with institutional partners that include CERN, NUS, Carnegie Mellon and Fraunhofer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our &lt;a href=&quot;https://constructorlabs.org/solutions/edtech/&quot;&gt;EdTech practice&lt;/a&gt; produces research that runs in production. AI-supported remote proctoring is in use at the Irish Aviation Authority, Princess Nourah University and Saudi Electronic University, and our course delivery platform is used by CERN, EPFL, MariaDB and Acronis. For industry clients, we build tailored BSc, MSc and PhD pipelines, L&amp;amp;D operating models, AI upskilling programmes and customer training systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Constructor Labs Solutions (CLS)&lt;/strong&gt; is our client-facing systems integrator for the education and research sector, launching in September 2026. It brings audit and consultancy, content, platform, talent and R&amp;amp;D services together under a single contract, an offer few providers make to education buyers today. Delivery is orchestrated across several Constructor organizations: CUB, Nexford, Nexademy, EBAC, Constructor Labs and Constructor Tech. Our aim is to become the go-to systems integrator for education in EMEA by 2029.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will open EMEA markets for Constructor Labs Solutions as a quota-carrying individual contributor. The role rests on an established network among universities, online education providers, EdTech vendors and corporate L&amp;amp;D and research buyers, and on your ability to convert that network into signed engagements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work with the marketing and delivery teams to build pipeline, establish the CLS brand and develop a case-study library. Supporting you are a credible research institution, named production references, an existing Constructor and Constructor Tech client base, and delivery capability across five service lines that can be combined into a single proposal.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The sales motion is consultative. Engagements typically open with a low-risk paid diagnostic (Technology Landscape Assessment, Curriculum Gap Analysis or Learning Strategy Advisory), which you then convert into a multi-line implementation or managed-service mandate. Initial engagements start at around €150–250K in lifetime value and grow from there. Sales cycles in public higher education run six to twelve months, so you will manage a long-cycle institutional funnel alongside faster corporate L&amp;amp;D deals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Reporting and scope&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to:&lt;/strong&gt; Director of Sales &amp;amp; Marketing, Constructor Labs Solutions (shared with the Constructor Labs GM during Phase 1).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Level:&lt;/strong&gt; Director, individual contributor. You will join an established sales team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Territory:&lt;/strong&gt; EMEA, with initial focus on DACH (Germany, Austria, Switzerland) and the UK and Ireland. Named accounts agreed quarterly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Segments:&lt;/strong&gt; traditional and online universities, EdTech providers and platform vendors, corporate L&amp;amp;D and corporate academies, research-intensive organizations, and publicly funded research programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Portfolio:&lt;/strong&gt; all five CLS service lines, namely Audit &amp;amp; Consultancy, Content, Platform, Talent and R&amp;amp;D Services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Day-to-day, you will work with the Audit &amp;amp; Consultancy Practice Head on scoping, with Nexademy on content propositions, with Constructor Tech on platform architecture, and with the Labs&#39; principal investigators, who join client conversations to provide subject-matter credibility. Knowing which expert belongs in which conversation is central to the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you will do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pipeline generation.&lt;/strong&gt; Around 70% of your time is spent on outbound activity: your own network, conference presence, sector associations, procurement frameworks and targeted account campaigns, supported by marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reference accounts.&lt;/strong&gt; Sign the first reference clients in EMEA and develop each one into a published case study, an active sponsor and a source of introductions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discovery and scoping.&lt;/strong&gt; Map the client&#39;s learning or research operating model and quantify the problem in their own measures: cost per course, time to accreditation, completion rates, time-to-hire, research throughput. Shape a diagnostic that leads to a defined follow-on engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conversion to implementation.&lt;/strong&gt; Own the transition from paid diagnostic to multi-line mandate, with a target of converting half of all audit engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proposals and bids.&lt;/strong&gt; Assemble proposals across the five service lines with the practice heads, price them against the finance model and qualify them against margin floors. Lead RFP and framework responses, including public-sector tenders in Germany and the UK.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder coverage.&lt;/strong&gt; Engage rectors, deans, CIOs, heads of digital learning, procurement, works councils, CLOs, HR directors and research directors. Maintain at least three engaged contacts on every opportunity above €200K.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner channel.&lt;/strong&gt; Recruit and manage regional partners, resellers, agencies and academic networks that extend reach beyond your direct coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quota and forecasting.&lt;/strong&gt; You carry an annual new-business quota, with quarterly KPIs covering pipeline coverage, audit conversion, average engagement value and blended margin. Maintain weekly pipeline hygiene in the CRM, submit a forecast you can defend, and flag slippage as soon as you see it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market feedback.&lt;/strong&gt; Report what EMEA buyers procure and what they decline, and how our pricing compares with Instructure, D2L, Cornerstone and the generalist integrators, so that the service catalogue can be adjusted.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;External representation.&lt;/strong&gt; Speak at sector events and contribute to thought leadership alongside our principal investigators, building recognition for CLS among education buyers in your region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Targets and KPIs&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role carries a quota set on net-new signed bookings (total contract value) in your territory, with a six-month ramp and a quarterly review:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Net-new signed bookings (TCV)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reference clients signed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Average engagement value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Audit-to-implementation conversion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Blended gross margin on signed work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;New qualified opportunities created&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forecast accuracy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Network in the sector.&lt;/strong&gt; Eight or more years selling into education, research or corporate learning in EMEA, preferably DACH and/or the UK, with decision-maker relationships you can open within the first 90 days. You should be prepared to discuss your top 15 target accounts and the route into each.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A closing record in complex services.&lt;/strong&gt; Consistent achievement against a quota of €1M or more in professional services, consulting, systems integration or enterprise EdTech, covering six-figure deals, multi-stakeholder buying groups and six- to twelve-month cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consultative selling.&lt;/strong&gt; Experience selling scoped engagements whose deliverables were defined jointly with the client, and fluency in a recognized methodology such as MEDDIC, Challenger or Command of the Message.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain credibility.&lt;/strong&gt; The ability to hold a substantive conversation with a pro-vice-chancellor about digitalization, a CLO about competency frameworks or a research director about co-funded projects, together with a working understanding of how universities and research organizations buy: budget cycles, committee approval, procurement frameworks and public tender rules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfort in an early-stage unit.&lt;/strong&gt; Experience building a territory or a new offering from a standing start, and the ability to sell a service catalogue that is still being completed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages.&lt;/strong&gt; Business-fluent &lt;strong&gt;German&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt;. Both are required, since public education buyers in DACH contract in German.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial discipline.&lt;/strong&gt; Rigorous CRM and forecasting practice, and a readiness to qualify out early rather than carry unlikely deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional integrity.&lt;/strong&gt; You will represent a research institution to universities and public bodies, so commitments made during the sales process must be ones delivery can meet.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice to have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling into publicly funded research programmes, or EU and national grant-co-funded projects (Horizon Europe, Innovate UK, BMBF).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of the LMS/SIS landscape and its incumbents — Instructure, D2L, Cornerstone, Moodle, SAP SuccessFactors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with UK public procurement frameworks (Crown Commercial Service, JISC) or German public tendering (VgV, e-Vergabe).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in the education practice of a systems integrator, Big Four firm or consultancy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior success selling talent, recruitment or academic content services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;French, Italian or Dutch as a third language.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An existing speaking profile in the education or L&amp;amp;D community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Location and travel&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates must be based in Europe and hold an existing, unrestricted right to work in their country of residence. &lt;strong&gt;Relocation is not offered for this position:&lt;/strong&gt; the network the role depends on should already be in the market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Preferred bases are Germany, Switzerland, Bulgaria or the UK. The role is remote or hybrid, with regular time in Bremen and at the London commercial hub. Expect travel of up to 40% within EMEA for client meetings, tenders and sector events, plus occasional travel to other Constructor locations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Base salary and commission&lt;/strong&gt;, weighted approximately 60/40 at on-target earnings, with accelerators above 100% of quota. The band is competitive for a Director-level individual contributor in DACH or the UK and depends on location and experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A guaranteed ramp&lt;/strong&gt; across the first two quarters while the pipeline is built.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commission on margin as well as revenue&lt;/strong&gt;, so that well-scoped work is rewarded ahead of discounted work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Access to our researchers&lt;/strong&gt;, including principal investigators, CERN-level data scientists, and education methodologists who will join your client meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An existing reference base&lt;/strong&gt;, including named proctoring and platform deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence over the offering.&lt;/strong&gt; As the key commercial voice in these markets, you will shape a service catalogue that is not yet fixed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Firmus Technologies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot; data-ccp-parastyle-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;baa2b379-a6d3-56f4-af2b-6a08de9434e5|1&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[469777841,&amp;quot;Aeonik&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;Aeonik&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;Aeonik&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Aeonik&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Aeonik&amp;quot;,201342446,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342447,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;,201342448,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342449,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201341986,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;20&amp;quot;,335551500,&amp;quot;197122&amp;quot;,335559740,&amp;quot;264&amp;quot;,201341983,&amp;quot;0&amp;quot;,335559738,&amp;quot;145&amp;quot;,469775450,&amp;quot;FIR Body&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;,134234082,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;FIRBody&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Body Text&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt;Firmus Technologies is a global&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;leader&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt; pioneering the development &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;and operation of efficient AI infrastructure across Asia Pacific.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:145,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;Founded in Australia in 2019, our mission is to create the most efficient AI infrastructure by &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;combining&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;cutting-edge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;technology with a steadfast commitment to sustainability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:145,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;At Firmus, we are unique in our approach. We design, build, and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;operate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt; a new class of digital &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;infrastructure – the AI Factory. Through our model-to-grid technology approach, we have pushed &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;the boundaries of multi-generational liquid cooling systems, energy management, AI software &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;orchestration, and construction. For our customers, this approach allows us to make every watt &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;count and deliver low-cost AI tokens globally.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:145,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Firmus AI Cloud&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot; data-ccp-parastyle-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;baa2b379-a6d3-56f4-af2b-6a08de9434e5|1&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[469777841,&amp;quot;Aeonik&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;Aeonik&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;Aeonik&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Aeonik&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Aeonik&amp;quot;,201342446,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342447,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;,201342448,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342449,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201341986,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;20&amp;quot;,335551500,&amp;quot;197122&amp;quot;,335559740,&amp;quot;264&amp;quot;,201341983,&amp;quot;0&amp;quot;,335559738,&amp;quot;145&amp;quot;,469775450,&amp;quot;FIR Body&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;,134234082,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;FIRBody&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Body Text&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt;Our large-scale GPU cloud platform, Firmus AI Cloud, is purpose-built &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;to deliver energy-efficient AI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;compute&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;at scale to customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:145,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;It empowers developers, enterprises, educational institutions, and government users to train and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;deploy AI models with unmatched efficiency and cost savings. With an ever-growing suite of services &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;and applications, we are committed to delivering a cloud experience that is market-leading, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;proprietary, and built to scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:145,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:145,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun MacChromeBold SCXW46825641 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-AU&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW46825641 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;ROLE SUMMARY&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW46825641 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Firmus Technologies is seeking a Principal Engineer, AI Cloud Software to own the Firmus AI Cloud API and the control plane behind it. Customers, partner platforms, and AI agents use our API to provision and run GPU compute, and our console, SDKs, CLI, and Terraform provider are all built on it. You will set the technical direction for all of it. Everything you design must work across sites and scale to hundreds of thousands of GPUs in gigawatt-scale AI factories.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:252}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;KEY RESPONSIBILITIES&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Architecture and decisions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:252}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;21&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Own the overall design of the public API: the resource model, contracts, versioning, and the compatibility promise customers and partner platforms build against. Set one contract style, one identity model, and one versioning policy that every domain team follows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:252}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;21&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Own the software architecture behind it: service boundaries and the control-plane model. Set a target architecture two to three years ahead and plan the steps from today&#39;s system to it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:252}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;21&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Design the control plane to keep each region serving when another fails, protect it under load with per-tenant rate limits and fair queuing, and remove the limits that would block growth in tenants, resource types, sites, and request volume.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:252}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;21&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;4&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Lead design reviews for significant changes across the teams, sign off architecture decision records, and settle technical disputes escalated by engineers. Decide at pace with incomplete information, write down the assumptions, and revisit a decision when the evidence changes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:252}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Build and evolve&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:252}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;21&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;5&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Write production code for the hardest parts of the API and the control plane.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:252}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;21&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;6&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Expose the full lifecycle of compute, virtual networking, storage, and Kubernetes resources through the API, on top of the infrastructure, network and storage controllers&#39; other teams own. Give every resource a stable identifier, track multi-step requests to completion, and offer break-fix actions such as reboot, reset, and maintenance notices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:252}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;21&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;7&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Build identity and tenancy into the API: organisations and projects, federated sign-on with MFA, automated user provisioning, group-based roles, and service accounts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:252}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;21&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;8&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Give customers, partner platforms, Firmus operations teams, and AI agents acting for a customer safe access through the same API, with scoped credentials, approval for destructive actions, and a full audit trail.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:252}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;21&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;9&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Keep the console, SDKs, CLI, and Terraform provider consistent with the API, built from a single contract. Ship each capability as a supported feature, not a one-off for a single customer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:252}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Reliability, security, and cost&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:252}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;21&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;10&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Set SLOs and error budgets for the API and control plane and use the budget to decide when reliability work comes first.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:252}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;21&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;11&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Lead the technical response to major incidents in the API and control plane and make sure every post-mortem ends with a fix that stops it happening again.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:252}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;21&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;12&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Design usage records accurate enough to bill from and for customers to verify, with quotas and audit logs that customers can query through the API and export.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:252}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;21&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;13&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Design every service to survive rolling node replacement without customer impact, and keep dependencies and images patched within policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:252}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;21&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;14&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Keep Firmus&#39; SOC 2 Type 2 and ISO 27001 controls passing at every new site.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:252}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;21&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;15&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Own cost at the design level and raise any design change that alters what customers consume.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:252}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Technical leadership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:252}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;21&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;16&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Grow engineers through mentorship, design review, and code review. Hiring and performance review sit with the Engineering Manager.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:252}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
