&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;ms-outlook-mobile-reference-message skipProofing&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience Without Limits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come shape the future of brand experience.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;ms-outlook-mobile-reference-message skipProofing&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At Jack Morton, we design and build&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;head-turning, smile-inducing, impact-driving brand experiences that redefine what experiential marketing can achieve. We help our clients&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;unlock the full value of experiences&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;by turning bold ideas into meaningful connections.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;ms-outlook-mobile-reference-message skipProofing&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;That takes a team that&#39;s bold, curious, and acts as one.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We build on each other&#39;s ideas, challenge conventions, and show up for one another every day. Here, you&#39;ll do your best work, grow quickly, and partner across clients, disciplines, and global teams to bring new ideas to life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;ms-outlook-mobile-reference-message skipProofing&quot;&gt;This is a place where curiosity drives what’s next, boldness raises the bar, and every win is shared. Where ownership is expected, egos are left at the door, and the work reflects the passion and talent of the people behind it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;ms-outlook-mobile-reference-message skipProofing&quot;&gt;Experience without limits—in your work, your growth, and your impact.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Event Manager&amp;nbsp; is responsible for planning and executing high-profile meetings and events in the Healthcare and Pharmaceutical industries. This role requires a strategic thinker with proven expertise in managing complex pharmaceutical events, such as congresses and advisory boards. The Senior Event Manager will lead event coordination, client management, operational delivery, and team mentorship to ensure successful outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and execute complex events from conception to completion, ensuring high standards and adherence to timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and guide a team of event planners and supervisors, fostering professional development and adherence to company processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strong client relationships, supporting the Account Lead in strategy implementation and client communications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead project management, including setting objectives, timelines, and managing risks to ensure project success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop strategic supplier relationships, negotiate terms, and manage all third-party contracts and communications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee onsite event management, ensuring effective communication, risk assessment, and timely problem-solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain compliance with pharmaceutical regulations, codes of conduct, and client privacy protocols.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage budget reconciliation and financial tracking, ensuring accurate quotes, savings documentation, and invoice management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide leadership and coaching to direct reports, conducting regular one-on-one meetings and overseeing personal development plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with peers and teams to ensure effective delivery of client projects and attend required company training and meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in managing pharmaceutical events, including congresses, investigator meetings, and advisory boards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of industry codes of conduct, such as PhRMA Code in the U.S. and EFPIA Code in Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of anti-bribery laws and healthcare compliance programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in project management tools and methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage complex budgets, financial tracking, and reconciliation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent leadership, communication, and organizational skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility to work across multiple accounts and manage various projects concurrently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Cvent or similar event management software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;We make our careers website accessible to any and all users. If you need an accommodation to participate in the application process, please contact us at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ---------- &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;This email address is not for general employment inquiries or vendors; rather it is strictly for applicants who require special assistance accessing our employment website. Due to volume, messages sent to this email address that are not related to an accommodation cannot be answered.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;***JOB SCAM ALERT***&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have recently become aware that individuals not associated with Jack Morton have fraudulently used our name – and the names of some of our employees – to solicit applications for fake jobs, to conduct fake job interviews and to make fake job offers.&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Any request to schedule an interview and any bona fide offer of employment will only come from an authorized representative of Jack Morton with an email address&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ----- data-outlook-id=&quot;e48c5662-ac2c-4f70-a75e-0dd358bfad61&quot; ----- or ----- or ----- We will never require an applicant to provide credit card or banking information to cover any supposed advance costs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have provided personal information in connection with a fake job offer or interview and you are concerned, we suggest that you take appropriate action.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Jack Morton takes these activities very seriously and are taking appropriate steps to shut down this fraudulent activity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We urge you to be careful when sharing your personal information and to be aware of scams involving fake job postings and job offers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 4, 67);&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.rightmove.co.uk/careers/content/uploads/2026/09/Untitled-30-July-2026-at-10.03.05-3-8.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1001&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our vision is to give everyone the belief they can make their move. We aim to make moving simpler,&amp;nbsp;by giving everyone the best place to turn to and return to for access to the tools, expertise, trust, and belief to make it happen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re home to the UK’s largest choice of properties and are the go-to destination for millions&amp;nbsp;of people planning their next move, reading the latest industry news, or just browsing what’s on the market.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;London - hybrid (Wednesday &amp;amp; Thursday office days)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to:&lt;/strong&gt; Engineering Manager, Core Search&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 222, 182); font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;At Rightmove, millions of people use our products at some of the most important moments in their lives. As a Senior Software Engineer II, you&#39;ll play a key role in building the tools, systems and experiences that help keep the UK&#39;s favourite property platform moving forward.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll join a collaborative, high-performing engineering community where autonomy, curiosity and continuous improvement are part of everyday life. Working closely with Product, Design and Engineering colleagues, you&#39;ll help solve meaningful problems at scale, delivering software that is reliable, maintainable and loved by its users. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re passionate about modern engineering practices, continuous delivery and building quality in from the start. Whether it&#39;s shaping architecture, mentoring engineers or exploring new technologies, you&#39;ll have the freedom and support to make a genuine impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 222, 182);&quot;&gt;A note from your manager:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;Help millions of people find the right property faster. Join our collaborative Search team, where you’ll build intelligent, intuitive discovery experiences, experiment with new technologies, and shape how users explore and connect with homes they&#39;ll love.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 222, 182); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Building and evolving products using a modern technology stack including&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;TypeScript, React, Express, Node.js, Kubernetes and GitLab&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Delivering high-quality software that can be released safely and frequently to production&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Partnering with Product, Design and Engineering teams to solve complex, real-world challenges&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Influencing technical direction and helping shape the work that goes into each sprint&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Designing scalable, resilient systems alongside Architects and Principal Engineers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Contributing to engineering communities, standards and best practices across Rightmove&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Coaching and mentoring fellow engineers, helping others grow and develop&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Collaborating through code reviews and technical discussions to continuously improve quality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experimenting with new technologies and approaches that help us work smarter and deliver more value&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 222, 182);&quot;&gt;We&#39;d love to hear from you if...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You enjoy solving complex technical problems and finding simple, elegant solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You&#39;re passionate about software quality and advocate for testing and automation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You have strong experience with &lt;strong&gt;React, TypeScript and modern web application development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You care about performance, scalability and creating great user experiences&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You&#39;re comfortable influencing technical decisions and driving engineering excellence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You enjoy mentoring others and helping teams succeed together&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You&#39;re naturally curious, always looking to learn and improve&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You take ownership, value collaboration and celebrate team success&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 222, 182); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Approach to AI&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At Rightmove, we believe software and product are ultimately people problems, and everything we build aims to improve the lives of others. We see AI as a helpful way to create more space for the human side of our work, from understanding real needs to making sure we are solving the right problems in the right way. There is an expectation that you are proactive in exploring how AI can support your own workflow and productivity, and that you approach it with curiosity and an open mind.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 4, 67);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Rightmove&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Despite our growth, we’ve remained a friendly, supportive place to work, with employee #1 still working here!&amp;nbsp; We’ve done this by placing the Rightmove Hows at the heart of everything we do. These are the essential values that reflect our culture, and include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;create&amp;nbsp;value…&lt;/strong&gt;by delivering results and building trust with partners and consumers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;think&amp;nbsp;bigger…&lt;/strong&gt;by acting with curiosity and setting bold aspirations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;care&amp;nbsp;deeply…&lt;/strong&gt;by being real, having fun, and valuing diversity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;move&amp;nbsp;together…&lt;/strong&gt;by being one team - internally collaborative, externally competitive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;make&amp;nbsp;a difference…&lt;/strong&gt;by focusing on delivering measurable impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.rightmove.co.uk/careers/culture/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;float: left; max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.rightmove.co.uk/careers/content/uploads/2026/09/Job-alerts-1.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;452&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in careers that open doors and help our team develop by providing an open and inclusive work environment, offering ongoing&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;training opportunities, and supporting charity fundraising events. And with &lt;strong&gt;89% of Rightmovers saying we’re a great place to work&lt;/strong&gt;, we’re clearly doing something right!&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.rightmove.co.uk/careers/content/uploads/2026/07/Untitled-30-July-2026-at-10.03.05-1-2.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1000&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 4, 67);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cash plan for dental, optical and physio treatments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical Insurance, Pension and Life Insurance, Employee Assistance Plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;27 days holiday plus two (paid) volunteering days a year to give back, and holiday buy schemes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributory stakeholder pension.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life assurance at 4x your basic salary to a spouse, family member or other nominated person in your life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid leave for maternity, paternity, adoption &amp;amp; fertility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel Loans, Bike to Work scheme, Rental Deposit Loan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Charitable contributions through Payroll Giving and donation matching.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access deals and discounts on things like travel, electronics, fashion, gym memberships, cinema discounts and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We offer hybrid working with a minimum of 2 days in the office. For our roles, such as Field or Home-based positions, different working arrangements apply - full details will be shared during the recruitment process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 222, 180);&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.rightmove.co.uk/careers/content/uploads/2026/09/Untitled-30-July-2026-at-10.03.05-8.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1000&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;em&gt;As an Equal Opportunity Employer, Rightmove will never discriminate based on age, disability, sex, race, religion or belief, gender reassignment, marriage / civil partnership, pregnancy/maternity or sexual orientation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Rightmove, we believe that a diverse and inclusive workforce leads to better innovation, productivity, and overall success. We are committed to creating a welcoming and inclusive environment for all employees, regardless of their background or identity, to develop and promote a diverse culture that reflects the communities we serve.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;By applying, you confirm that you are aged at least 18 or over and&amp;nbsp;that you’ve read and understood our &lt;a class=&quot;decorated-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.rightmove.co.uk/c/privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-start=&quot;192&quot; data-end=&quot;259&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;193&quot; data-end=&quot;211&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, which explains how we handle and protect your personal information during the recruitment process.&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div&gt;At Qualtrics, we create software the world’s best brands use to deliver exceptional frontline experiences, build high-performing teams, and design products people love. But we are more than a platform—we are the creators and stewards of the Experience Management category serving over 18K clients globally. Building a category takes grit, determination, and a disdain for convention—but most of all it requires close-knit, high-functioning teams with an unwavering dedication to serving our customers. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;When you join one of our teams, you’ll be part of a nimble group that’s empowered to set aggressive goals and move fast to achieve them. Strategic risks are encouraged and complex problems are solved together, by passing the microphone and iterating until the best solution comes to light. You won’t have to look to find growth opportunities—ready or not, they’ll find you. From retail to government to healthcare, we’re on a mission to bring humanity, connection, and empathy back to business. Join over 5,000 people across the globe who think that’s work worth doing.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GTM Insights Analyst - GTM Analytics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why We Have This Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;The Qualtrics GTM Planning &amp;amp; Insights team is looking for a GTM analyst who wants to make an impact on a fast-growing business, can conduct in depth analytics and reporting, and can make strategic recommendations for the company. This role is essential to enabling our go-to-market revenue operations and surfacing valuable insights on opportunity areas to our field teams.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You’ll Find Success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical and data-oriented, with great troubleshooting and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has an eye for quality and scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organizational skills with the ability to multitask, prioritize, and manage time effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensures accuracy of work through attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Takes initiative, learns quickly, understands expected outcomes, absorbs context, and works proactively to get results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You’ll Grow&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow your data analysis, problem solving, and communication &amp;nbsp;skills across while developing expertise in sales and go-to-market operations. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn how global sales, customer success, and marketing teams operate, and improve the data/systems/insights that drive their growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to help build a team and function team from the ground up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Things You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform quantitative and qualitative analysis leading to actionable insights, assisting stakeholders throughout the business on special projects / reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle inbound requests from field teams for data analysis, data requests, and decision making support. Proactively work with internal stakeholders to prioritize needs and/or requests on a weekly basis. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transform complex data sets into actionable insights using analytical, visualization, and data tools such as Tableau, Excel, Python, R, MySQL, etc. &amp;nbsp;Create queries, views, reports, and easy-to-consumption dashboards/visualizations. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end problem solving efforts from the discovery &amp;amp; exploration phase through to implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own an entire area of go-to-market operations: taking projects from start to finish with high quality and impact, acting as the “subject-matter-expert”, and collaborating with stakeholders to ensure the analytics are being used to drive business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For On Your Resume&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2-7 years experience in visual reporting tools such as Tableau; experience with SQL and data manipulation/transformation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant experience with sales operations, associated CRM systems (i.e. salesforce.com or SAP C4C), or sales planning processes is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to deal with ambiguity in a fast-paced growth environment, manage strict SLAs and communicate effectively to a global audience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree from a top-tier university with a quantitative or systems focus (e.g. informations systems, computer science, STEM, business analytics, finance, data science)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Should Know About This Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GTM Planning &amp;amp; Insights plays a critical role in managing the operating rhythm of our global go-to-market field teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core responsibilities include territory planning, quota setting, pipeline and capacity health, customer health, performance management, and customer journey analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If you are ready for a new high-impact challenge, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Team’s Favorite Perks and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellness Reimbursement each quarter to reimburse wellness activities including gym memberships, massages, workout equipment, meditation apps, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Amazing QGroup Communities; MOSAIQ, Green Team, Qualtrics Pride, Q&amp;amp;Able, Qualtrics Salute, and Women’s Leadership Development, which exist as places for support, allyship, and advocacy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive benefits packages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Qualtrics Hybrid Work Model&lt;/strong&gt;: Our hybrid work model is elegantly simple: we all gather in the office three days a week; Mondays and Thursdays, plus one day selected by your organizational leader. These purposeful in-person days in thoughtfully designed offices help us do our best work and harness the power of collaboration and innovation. For the rest of the week, work where you want, owning the integration of work and life. #hybrid&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Qualtrics is an equal opportunity employer meaning that all qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability, status as a protected veteran, or any other protected characteristic.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;​​​​​​​Applicants in the United States of America have rights under Federal Employment Laws:&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/agencies/whd/posters/fmla&quot;&gt;Family &amp;amp; Medical Leave Act&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/poster&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunity Employment&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/agencies/whd/posters/employee-polygraph-protection-act&quot;&gt;Employee Polygraph Protection Act&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Qualtrics is committed to the inclusion of all qualified individuals. As part of this commitment, Qualtrics will ensure that persons with disabilities are provided with reasonable accommodations. If reasonable accommodation is needed to participate in the job application or interview process, to perform essential job functions, and/or to receive other benefits and privileges of employment, please let your Qualtrics contact/recruiter know.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Not finding a role that’s the right fit for now? Qualtrics Insiders is the one-stop shop for all things Qualtrics Life. Sign up for exclusive access to content created with you in mind and get the scoop on what we have going on at Qualtrics - upcoming events, behind the scenes stories from the team, interview tips, hot jobs, and more. No spam - we promise! You&#39;ll hear from us two times a month max with fresh, totally tailored info - so be sure to stay connected as you explore your best role and company fit.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;At Qualtrics, we create software the world’s best brands use to deliver exceptional frontline experiences, build high-performing teams, and design products people love. But we are more than a platform—we are the creators and stewards of the Experience Management category serving over 18K clients globally. Building a category takes grit, determination, and a disdain for convention—but most of all it requires close-knit, high-functioning teams with an unwavering dedication to serving our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you join one of our teams, you’ll be part of a nimble group that’s empowered to set aggressive goals and move fast to achieve them. Strategic risks are encouraged and complex problems are solved together, by passing the microphone and iterating until the best solution comes to light. You won’t have to look to find growth opportunities—ready or not, they’ll find you. From retail to government to healthcare, we’re on a mission to bring humanity, connection, and empathy back to business. Join over 5,000 people across the globe who think that’s work worth doing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Field CTO – EMEA&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why We Have This Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The EMEA Field CTO organization serves as the primary bridge between Qualtrics&#39; product vision, customer strategy, field execution, and market innovation. In this role, your mandate is to Innovate, Prove, and Scale: you will partner with C-suite executives at strategic enterprise customers to shape their Experience Management (XM), AI, and enterprise technology transformation strategies. You won&#39;t just support deals—you&#39;ll generate new intellectual property, enterprise architectures, and sales motions that elevate how our entire field sales engineering team engages the market. Working closely with Product, Engineering, Sales, and Customer Success, you will establish Qualtrics as an indispensable platform within complex enterprise ecosystems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You’ll Find Success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic Innovation: A passion for developing differentiated platform positioning, strategic sales motions, and novel solution architectures that extend beyond single deal cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive Presence: Excitement around partnering with Fortune 500 C-suite leaders to deliver visionary keynotes, executive workshops, and high-impact advisory sessions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Systems &amp;amp; Ecosystem Thinking: A knack for connecting Qualtrics to broader enterprise technology stacks, including AI, data platforms, cloud, CRM, and ERP systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product-Field Translation: Enthusiasm for translating real-world market shifts, customer needs, and emerging technologies into actionable feedback for Product and Engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scalable Mentorship: Joy in coaching, enabling, and scaling proven approaches to the broader field engineering organization to lift collective capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You’ll Grow&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive &amp;amp; Advisory Standing: Expand your profile as an industry thought leader through speaking engagements, publications, analyst meetings, and executive briefings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frontier Technology Mastery: Deepen your technical edge at the intersection of Enterprise Experience Management, Generative/Agentic AI, and enterprise data architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Functional Influence: Build top-tier strategic leadership experience by directly shaping Product roadmaps and field-wide go-to-market strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Things You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Innovate Platform Positioning: Create and deploy new enterprise solution architectures, AI use cases, and strategic sales campaigns to position Qualtrics as a core platform in evolving market shifts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prove Impact on Strategic Deals: Partner with Sales Engineering and AEs on our largest enterprise opportunities to validate innovative positioning and drive measurable business outcomes through executive workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale Capability to the Field: Package successful customer engagements into repeatable solution architectures, strategic sales plays, and enablement assets adopted by the broader sales engineering org.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence Product Strategy: Establish a continuous feedback loop between Fortune 500 customers and internal Product &amp;amp; Engineering teams to prioritize key roadmap investments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Qualtrics Globally: Drive market leadership by presenting at industry conferences, customer events, analyst briefings, and executive advisory sessions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For On Your CV&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record in enterprise solution architecture, strategic presales, or Field CTO roles within enterprise software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated capability in architecting and positioning complex platforms alongside enterprise AI, data strategy, cloud, CRM, or CDP environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience engaging and advising C-level executives at Fortune 500 organizations on digital transformation and business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of building repeatable intellectual property, technical positioning frameworks, or field enablement programs that scale across an organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-functional execution experience aligning Product, Engineering, Sales, and Customer Success teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Should Know About This Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High-Impact Innovation Hub:&lt;/strong&gt; We are not just deal support—we act as an internal incubator for new ideas, generating intellectual property, enterprise architectures, and sales plays that elevate the entire company&#39;s go-to-market strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Direct Influence on Product &amp;amp; Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; We sit at the exact intersection of field execution and product vision, giving us a direct voice to shape Qualtrics&#39; platform strategy and influence product roadmaps based on real-world Fortune 500 interactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Peer Community of Technical Experts:&lt;/strong&gt; You’ll work alongside seasoned enterprise architects and industry thought leaders who value collaboration, high-velocity problem solving, and sharing technical innovation across the group.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;C-Suite Access &amp;amp; Executive Visibility:&lt;/strong&gt; Our team leads the highest-stakes executive engagements, board-level vision sessions, and customer workshops across EMEA, giving you unmatched visibility inside and outside the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture of Scaled Mentorship:&lt;/strong&gt; We believe a win for one is a win for all; we actively invest time in translating individual successes into enablement programs that lift the capabilities of the broader field sales engineering org.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Team’s Favorite Perks and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Perks &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comprehensive Healthcare &amp;amp; Mental Health:&lt;/strong&gt; Fully funded Bupa private medical and dental insurance for you and your dependents, alongside 24/7 confidential mental health support, coaching, and care resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid Leave:&lt;/strong&gt; 25 days annual leave per year, plus 1 additional day per year of service (up to 5 additional days), alongside additional family support leave programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Protection &amp;amp; Equity:&lt;/strong&gt; Income protection (66% of salary after 13 weeks of illness), death in service benefit (up to 4x salary), business travel accident coverage, and an Employee Equity Purchase Plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional Growth &amp;amp; Career Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Career Action Plans, mentorship programs, and resources covering interpersonal skills, time management, and work-life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regional &amp;amp; Team Perks (UK)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quarterly Wellness Allowance:&lt;/strong&gt; Wellness reimbursement of up to £300 gross per quarter to support activities for you and your family.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company Pension Plan:&lt;/strong&gt; 9% employer contribution with a 5% employee salary sacrifice contribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commuter Assistance:&lt;/strong&gt; Up to £5,000 gross per year paid monthly via payroll toward commuting costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Family Support &amp;amp; Experience Bonus:&lt;/strong&gt; Annual Experience Bonus of £1,450 after one year of employment, plus adoption and surrogacy reimbursement up to £8,200.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Qualtrics Hybrid Work Model&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;em&gt;Our hybrid work model is elegantly simple: we all gather in the office three days a week; Mondays and Thursdays, plus one day selected by your organizational leader. These purposeful in-person days in thoughtfully designed offices help us do our best work and harness the power of collaboration and innovation. For the rest of the week, work where you want, owning the integration of work and life. #hybrid&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Qualtrics is an equal opportunity employer meaning that all qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability, status as a protected veteran, or any other protected characteristic.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;​​​​​​​Applicants in the United States of America have rights under Federal Employment Laws:&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/agencies/whd/posters/fmla&quot;&gt;Family &amp;amp; Medical Leave Act&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/poster&quot;&gt; Equal Opportunity Employment&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/agencies/whd/posters/employee-polygraph-protection-act&quot;&gt; Employee Polygraph Protection Act&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Qualtrics is committed to the inclusion of all qualified individuals. As part of this commitment, Qualtrics will ensure that persons with disabilities are provided with reasonable accommodations. If reasonable accommodation is needed to participate in the job application or interview process, to perform essential job functions, and/or to receive other benefits and privileges of employment, please let your Qualtrics contact/recruiter know.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Not finding a role that’s the right fit for now? Qualtrics Insiders is the one-stop shop for all things Qualtrics Life. Sign up for exclusive access to content created with you in mind and get the scoop on what we have going on at Qualtrics - upcoming events, behind the scenes stories from the team, interview tips, hot jobs, and more. No spam - we promise! You&#39;ll hear from us two times a month max with fresh, totally tailored info - so be sure to stay connected as you explore your best role and company fit.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
