&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Now is an amazing time to join Nozomi Networks as we build the future of OT and IoT cybersecurity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We defend some of the world’s largest organizations and critical infrastructure in more than 68 countries and we’re just getting started. Our AI-powered cybersecurity platform secures operational technology (OT) and Internet of Things (IoT) infrastructures for enterprises and government entities across energy, manufacturing, transportation, resources, and critical infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Due to exponential growth, we are looking to appoint a Global Renewals Leader who will be responsible for renewing large volumes of customer contracts.&lt;br&gt;We are seeking someone who can quickly ramp up on our product offerings, client engagement model and renewal processes, whilst building out our global renewals team. You will play a critical role in supporting our customer success and revenue organizations, and your work will directly impact our corporate goals. This is a unique opportunity to build a global renewals team, whilst implementing best practice processes working with our sales leadership team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;This position requires a strong knowledge of systems and process selling, the ability to manage and close large volumes of opportunities. The Renewals leader will collaborate within Revenue and Customer Success, Marketing and Legal to maximize the renewal success while looking for additional opportunities for upselling additional revenue. The Renewals leader will work in partnership with the Account Executives when expansion opportunities are identified, ensuring that the right sales resources are engaged to maximize growth within the account.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the renewal strategy and operating model, including process, coverage, segmentation, playbooks, and workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own renewal performance against GRR, renewal rate, churn, and contraction targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the global renewals forecast and provide accurate, data-driven visibility into renewal pipeline, risk, churn, contraction, and expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and enforce renewal pricing and commercial strategies, including uplift, multi-year agreements, co-termination, downsell/contraction management, and non-standard terms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the optimization of Salesforce and other systems supporting the renewal lifecycle, ensuring accurate data, pipeline visibility, forecasting, and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive and close renewals through the full renewal lifecycle, including quoting, negotiations, purchase orders, agreement execution, and order submission.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use proven negotiation skills to maximize renewal outcomes while identifying and pursuing upsell opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Sales and Customer Success to proactively identify and mitigate renewal risk within the customer base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships and collaborate cross-functionally with Regional Sales Directors and teams responsible for cross-sell, upsell, and expansion opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;To be successful in this role, you need:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing a recurring revenue book of business with accountability for GRR and renewal targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to build and operationalize renewal processes, playbooks, and forecasting methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial and negotiation skills, including experience with pricing, uplift, multi-year agreements, and contract terms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working cross-functionally with Sales, Customer Success, Finance, Legal, Deal Desk, and Revenue Operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with the ability to use data to identify renewal risk, trends, and opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in cybersecurity, infrastructure, networking, or another technically complex B2B SaaS environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience building a global renewals team from the ground up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of success managing a high-volume portfolio of accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication, relationship-building, and follow-up skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organization and time management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Salesforce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel up to 20%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Competencies:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Active Listening and Communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business Insight and Acumen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive for Results (Get things done)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Emotional Intelligence (EQ), Interpersonal skills and Empathy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Objection Handling, Influencing&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;and Negotiation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Planning &amp;amp; Organizing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relationship Building and Customer Focus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resilience and Adaptability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solution Orientated Mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Teamwork, Collaboration and Cultural Alignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Team Leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership Performance through Action&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;People Development and Performance Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are and what we stand for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nozomi Networks is the leader in OT and IoT Cybersecurity. We protect the world&#39;s critical infrastructure, industrial and government organizations from cyber threats by providing exceptional network visibility, threat detection and operational insight. We’re always innovating and we hire the best at what they do to ensure our customers always have access to fast product enhancements, exceptional engineering support and rapid deployment across continents.&amp;nbsp;If you like a challenge, and value integrity and customer success, we invite you to help Nozomi Networks build the future of OT and IoT cybersecurity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity, Inclusion and Belonging are part of our core beliefs, at Nozomi Networks. Diversity of thought, background and culture broadens our knowledge of the world and helps us learn, grow, and gain new perspectives. What makes us all different is what makes us powerful.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All of our benefits are customized to the country you are based in, naturally we want to get the best out of our Nozomiers, so we provide the best benefits packages, such as:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work-Life Balance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unparalleled Flexible Time-Off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Need to know information&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Successful candidates will be subjected to background verification checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Be cautious of unsolicited messages, fake email addresses, requests for money and unclear job descriptions. Report suspicious activity to authorities. Our open job opportunities and descriptions are posted on Nozomi Networks&#39; career page. If in any doubt please apply for opportunities on our careers website &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nozominetworks.com/company/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you would like to know more about our Privacy Policy, please click &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nozominetworks.com/legal/job-applicant-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;. Any questions about how we process personal information, or if you would like help exercising your privacy rights please contact us using the email provided within the Privacy Policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Sony Music Entertainment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Sony Music Entertainment, we fuel the creative journey. We’ve played a pioneering role in music history, from the first-ever music label to the invention of the flat disc record. We’ve nurtured some of music’s most iconic artists and produced some of the most influential recordings of all time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, we work in more than 70 countries, supporting a diverse roster of international superstars, developing and independent artists, and visionary creators. From our position at the intersection of music, entertainment, and technology, we bring imagination and expertise to the newest products and platforms, embrace new business models, employ breakthrough tools, and provide powerful insights that help our artists push creative boundaries and reach new audiences. In everything we do, we’re committed to artistic integrity, transparency, and entrepreneurship.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Music Entertainment is a member of the Sony family of global companies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Music is looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Product Manager, Data &lt;/strong&gt;to join our talented product team in our London office and lead the development of a portfolio of shared data products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our products and teams work with data spanning streaming, fan engagement, social and creator activity, and commerce. As new datasets and requirements emerge, we need to understand what the data contains, establish what it means and make it useful beyond the team or product where it originated.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own the strategy, roadmap and delivery of a portfolio of shared data products. Working with business stakeholders, source-product owners and data engineering, you will turn business needs into clear requirements, deliver dependable datasets and establish definitions and relationships that can be reused across products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the strategy and roadmap for a portfolio of shared data products, with a focus on developing new datasets to meet emerging business needs.&lt;/strong&gt; Understand needs across teams, identify valuable opportunities and prioritise a portfolio of initiatives that supports artist teams and the wider business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn business requests into well-defined data initiatives.&lt;/strong&gt; Meet the people who produce and use the data, examine source datasets and establish the questions users need to answer, the information required and the measures of success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define reusable datasets with engineering.&lt;/strong&gt; Agree on the records, fields, relationships, quality, freshness and access requirements needed for each use case you’re defining. Establish clear acceptance criteria and resolve tradeoffs with stakeholders and engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead delivery and adoption.&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain a prioritised backlog and work with engineering through implementation, validation, launch and ongoing improvement. Ensure the teams receiving the data can use it to meet the agreed need.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Steward shared definitions and data models.&lt;/strong&gt; Work with domain experts and engineers to establish consistent definitions, identifiers, relationships and metrics. Develop the shared semantic layer through the initiatives you deliver, so concepts such as artists, tracks, markets, campaigns and audiences can be understood consistently across products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connect datasets to enable new capabilities.&lt;/strong&gt; Identify where combining data creates value and lead the product work required, including opportunities to relate streaming performance to social activity, campaigns, fan engagement and commerce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make data discoverable and understandable.&lt;/strong&gt; Ensure data products have clear documentation, usage examples and known limitations, helping analysts, data scientists and downstream product teams use them confidently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help develop and apply practical data standards.&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with leadership, engineering and relevant specialists on quality, ownership, access, lineage and appropriate use. Translate these expectations into requirements for the data products you lead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agree responsibilities for ongoing use of the data products you deliver.&lt;/strong&gt; Work with source-product owners and engineering teams to establish how source changes, maintenance, quality issues and communication with users will be handled for those initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measure adoption and impact.&lt;/strong&gt; Gather user feedback and evidence of usefulness, track whether the capabilities delivered meet their intended outcomes and use those findings to inform the roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build stakeholder alignment.&lt;/strong&gt; Explain priorities and investment decisions, communicate progress and translate technical considerations into clear business implications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work closely with our existing Data Platform product and engineering teams, coordinating priorities and dependencies with the platform migration and operational roadmap. You will also partner with source-product PMs and the teams building on the shared data products you deliver.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a track record of leading data products or platform capabilities from discovery and strategy through delivery, adoption and ongoing improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can set a clear product direction and prioritise pragmatically, balancing business value, user needs, technical constraints and dependencies across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable examining source data and working through detailed requirements with business experts, analysts and engineers..&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience turning fragmented data and business requirements into reusable datasets, shared capabilities or data products that support multiple use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a strong understanding of modern data platforms, including Snowflake or comparable cloud data warehouses, and can work effectively with engineers on data ingestion, modelling, pipelines and downstream consumption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand semantic layers and shared data definitions, and can work with business and technical partners to establish consistent meaning across products and domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can make informed product decisions about data quality, freshness, ownership, access and lineage, with an understanding of privacy and appropriate data use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable working across product boundaries, clarifying responsibilities and influencing teams whose roadmaps and priorities may differ.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong analytical and organisational skills, with the ability to translate complex problems into clear requirements, priorities and delivery plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You communicate effectively with technical teams, business stakeholders and executives, creating alignment around both the work and the outcomes it should deliver.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong documentation skills and can make data products, definitions and decisions understandable to the teams that depend on them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You focus on whether people can use and rely on the capabilities you deliver, with experience measuring adoption, usefulness and business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in the music or entertainment industry, particularly with streaming, consumption or artist audience data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with fan engagement, social and creator analytics, marketing campaigns, D2C commerce or customer data platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience connecting data across platforms through shared identifiers, entity relationships or audience segmentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building data capabilities that support analytics, marketing intelligence or AI-powered products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data catalogs, observability tools or business intelligence platforms such as Sigma.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing global or enterprise-scale data products, platform migrations or change management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we give you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You join a vibrant global community with the opportunity to channel your passion every day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A modern office environment designed for you, empowering you to bring your best.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investment in your professional growth and development enabling you to thrive in our vibrant community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The space to accelerate progress, positively disrupt and create what happens next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We give you the platform to champion positive change, with the opportunity to contribute to our social impact, diversity, equity and inclusion initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We provide an excellent range of benefits like private medical cover, a generous pension scheme, life assurance, income protection, plus loads of music industry perks. There’s also time off over winter break.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an active part of a culturally and socially diverse society, Sony Music’s aim is that our workforce is diverse and inclusive. Sony Music is an equal opportunity employer and supports workforce diversity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We employ, retain, promote and otherwise treat all employees and job applicants according to their merit, qualifications, competence and talent. We apply this policy without regard to any individual’s sex, race, religion, origin, age, sexual orientation, marital status, medical condition or disability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please click&lt;a href=&quot;http://tools.sonymusiccreative.com/privacy/PCP_UK.pdf&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt; to read our privacy policy before beginning the application process as you will need to agree to the terms of the policy before submitting your information. &lt;strong&gt;Please note that applicants must be at least 18 years of age&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At NiCE, we don’t limit our challenges. We challenge our limits. Always. We’re ambitious. We’re game changers. And we play to win. We set the highest standards and execute beyond them. And if you’re like us, we can offer you the ultimate career opportunity that will light a fire within you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position: Technical Product Owner&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: Hedge End, Hampshire&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;So, what’s the role all about?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here at NiCE Public Safety, we develop state of the art solutions for the Public Safety market, bringing together voice, video and screen recording, playback and analysis for Security customers worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are currently expanding our development team to allow us to continue to develop an exciting product that enables Police forces worldwide to keep up with the increasing demands of managing growing amounts of digital evidence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;How will you make an impact?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You own the Product Plan, driven from the Product roadmap, created by the Product Managers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You create a prioritised backlog based on High Level product requirements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You work closely with NICE Architects and Product Managers to clearly describe business goals and customer requirements into product backlog items&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Assess and review technical documentation and ensure the development team create appropriate levels of product documentation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You support the Product Manager in development of user scenarios for technical users&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You work closely with R&amp;amp;D to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Explain the motivation and the customer needs behind a new requirement&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own and Groom (create and explain) the User stories&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be there daily for the team for any questions &amp;amp; feedback&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Understand and prioritise technical requirements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Somebody who’s comfortable getting into a detailed technical discussion with our team of software developers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Happy to work on back-end solutions (e.g. software running as Windows Services)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You provide support to Customer Support, Professional Services, Technical Pre-sales teams and Training where required&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Have you got what it takes?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bachelor’s degree in a technical discipline/STEM subject, preferably Computer Science or Engineering, MBA&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to multitask and prioritise work&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to understand technical solutions, experience of software development&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to understand the big picture and translate it to detailed needs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience working in an Agile delivery methodology organisation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Communicating effectively at all levels, from executive management to individual contributor&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent English verbal and writing communication skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fast learner with ability to educate her/himself on relevant technologies e.g. Azure / Cloud-based services&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to remain focused and calm under pressure&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Great interpersonal skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;You will have an advantage if you also have:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A growing knowledge of AI tools, technologies and processes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to work successfully with clients and business partners directly&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience of working with Azure technologies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An appreciation of Next Generation (NG) emergency services&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in writing Technical Systems/Solutions Documentation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience of systems software&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Breaking down complex market requirements into secure, scalable, and resilient system designs (this will come from candidates with a Systems/Architect background)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Learn more about the Benefits at NICE&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join an ever-growing, market-disrupting, global company where the teams – comprised of the best of the best – work in a fast-paced, collaborative, and creative environment! As the market leader, every day at NICE is a chance to learn and grow, and there are endless internal career opportunities across multiple roles, disciplines, domains, and locations. If you are passionate, innovative, and excited to constantly raise the bar, you may just be our next NICEr!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Enjoy NICE-FLEX!&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At NICE, we work according to the NICE-FLEX hybrid model, which enables maximum flexibility: 2 days working from the office and 3 days of remote work, each week. Naturally, office days focus on face-to-face meetings, where teamwork and collaborative thinking generate innovation, new ideas, and a vibrant, interactive atmosphere.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requisition ID: 11829&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Type: &lt;/strong&gt;Individual Contributor&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About NiCE &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;NICE Ltd. (NASDAQ: NICE) software products are used by 25,000+ global businesses, including 85 of the Fortune 100 corporations, to deliver extraordinary customer experiences, fight financial crime and ensure public safety. Every day, NiCE software manages more than 120 million customer interactions and monitors 3+ billion financial transactions. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Known as an innovation powerhouse that excels in AI, cloud and digital, NiCE is consistently recognized as the market leader in its domains, with over 8,500 employees across 30+ countries. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;NiCE is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, national origin, age, sex, marital status, ancestry, neurotype, physical or mental disability, veteran status, gender identity, sexual orientation or any other category protected by law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At NiCE, we don’t limit our challenges. We challenge our limits. Always. We’re ambitious. We’re game changers. And we play to win. We set the highest standards and execute beyond them. And if you’re like us, we can offer you the ultimate career opportunity that will light a fire within you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;At NICE, we don’t limit our challenges. We challenge our limits. Always. We’re ambitious. We’re game changers. And we play to win. We set the highest standards and execute beyond them. And if you’re like us, we can offer you the ultimate career opportunity that will light a fire within you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;So, what&#39;s the role all about?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here at NICE Public Safety, we provide state of the art solutions for the Public Safety &amp;amp; Justice market, providing software as a service for multi-media evidence management and Emergency Contact Centres to a worldwide customer base.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are currently expanding our development team to allow us to continue to develop an exciting product that enables law enforcement agencies worldwide to keep up with the increasing demands of managing growing amounts of digital evidence.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are looking for a talented Software Developer to join our team. You must:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Be able to communicate effectively, including via email, instant message, phone and video conferencing tools.&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Be fierce in your pursuit of product quality.&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Be an excellent problem solver with an active interest in the latest design and development tools and technologies.&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Be knowledgeable and enthusiastic about process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How will you make an impact?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Design, implementation and developer-level test of UI, server and interface components, using C# in multi-threaded, multi-server environments.&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Ensuring your code takes into account the concerns of security, scalability, compatibility and maintainability.&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Performing testing of your work, fixing defects and helping to resolve customer support cases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Have you got what it takes?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Solid experience developing ASP.NET web applications in C# using Visual Studio/Visual Studio Code&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Experience working in collaborative multidisciplinary teams&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Experience creating maintainable code and using source control solutions such as Azure DevOps, GIT or similar&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Experience of unit and automated testing using tools such as NUnit, Jasmine and Selenium&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Solid understanding of the principles of network security, authentication and authorization&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Experience of working with databases using Entity Framework&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Good knowledge of SOLID principles&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Experience creating RESTful APIs and ensuring API extensibility&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Experience of SOA (service oriented architectures)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will have an advantage if you also have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Cloud experience (Azure)&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Containers (docker, K8s)&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Security best practice (OWASP top ten)&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;OpenIDConnect/Identity server&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Micro service architecture&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;MS SQL Server&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Azure DevOps, TeamCity&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Infrastructure as Code (Bicep, ARM templates, Terraform)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;BSc in Computer Science/Software Engineering or equivalent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requisition ID: 11240&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting into: Manager, Engineering.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Type: Individual Contributor.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About NiCE &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;NICE Ltd. (NASDAQ: NICE) software products are used by 25,000+ global businesses, including 85 of the Fortune 100 corporations, to deliver extraordinary customer experiences, fight financial crime and ensure public safety. Every day, NiCE software manages more than 120 million customer interactions and monitors 3+ billion financial transactions. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Known as an innovation powerhouse that excels in AI, cloud and digital, NiCE is consistently recognized as the market leader in its domains, with over 8,500 employees across 30+ countries. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;NiCE is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, national origin, age, sex, marital status, ancestry, neurotype, physical or mental disability, veteran status, gender identity, sexual orientation or any other category protected by law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;À propos du poste&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous recherchons un(e) Head of Integrated Marketing France pour rejoindre notre équipe Marketing France, basée à Paris.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rattaché(e) à la Head of Marketing France, vous piloterez l&#39;une des trois équipes Marketing du marché français et managerez une équipe de 3 personnes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Votre mission : être le point de connexion entre la stratégie Global et son exécution sur le marché France, en fédérant l&#39;ensemble des parties prenantes autour d&#39;une vision marketing claire, cadrée et exécutée dans les temps.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;À la croisée de la stratégie, de l&#39;orchestration et de l&#39;exécution, vous porterez la vision marketing France auprès du Global et des instances exécutives locales, tout en veillant à ce que chaque campagne — globale ou locale — soit livrée avec excellence et dans les délais. Vous piloterez également le programme de fidélité en France.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Vos missions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Définir et porter la vision stratégique marketing France, en s&#39;appuyant sur une compréhension fine de la stratégie Global et en assurant sa traduction pertinente sur le marché français (spécificités locales : créa, moments de consommation, culture...).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Être l&#39;interlocuteur constructif du Global : savoir s&#39;intégrer dans une stratégie globale tout en la challengeant de façon argumentée lorsque les spécificités françaises le nécessitent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fédérer l&#39;ensemble des pôles (Sales, Brand &amp;amp; Media, Creative, CRM, Analytics, Global...) pour s&#39;assurer que chacun travaille vers les mêmes objectifs et dans le même calendrier.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Piloter et sécuriser le calendrier de livraison des campagnes (globales et locales) : brief à temps, validation des plans média, validation brand, etc., pour garantir une exécution sans accroc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Simplifier et cadrer des sujets complexes impliquant de multiples parties prenantes, en faisant émerger les décisions à prendre et en portant les recommandations qui en découlent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formaliser et présenter la vision et la performance marketing France à un niveau exécutif, avec clarté et impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Piloter le programme de fidélité en France, en garantissant sa cohérence avec la stratégie marketing globale et les priorités business locales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intégrer l&#39;IA dans les méthodes de travail de l&#39;équipe, pour gagner en efficacité et en qualité d&#39;exécution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manager et développer une équipe de 3 personnes, en apportant vision, coaching, structure et exigence d&#39;exécution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Le profil recherché&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous êtes un(e) leader marketing structuré(e), reconnu(e) pour votre capacité à simplifier des sujets complexes multi-stakeholders et à faire en sorte que les choses avancent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous apportez notamment :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8 ans et plus d&#39;expérience en marketing, avec une expérience significative dans des environnements matriciels et multi-marchés.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une capacité avérée à travailler à l&#39;interface du Global et du Local, en sachant à la fois s&#39;aligner sur une stratégie globale et la challenger de façon constructive quand nécessaire.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un leadership naturel pour fédérer, cadrer et orchestrer des sujets impliquant de nombreuses parties prenantes, sans lien hiérarchique direct sur la plupart d&#39;entre elles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une forte capacité de formalisation et de communication, notamment pour porter une vision ou une recommandation devant un public exécutif.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une orientation PMO marquée : rigueur, sens du détail, capacité à garder le contrôle sur des plannings complexes et à faire respecter les délais.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une appétence pour l&#39;IA et son intégration dans les méthodes de travail marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une expérience réussie en management et dans le développement de talents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une maîtrise courante du français et de l&#39;anglais.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Les compétences qui feront votre réussite&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership et fédération d&#39;équipes transverses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Simplification et cadrage de sujets complexes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sens de l&#39;organisation et rigueur (PMO)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capacité à challenger de façon constructive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication et formalisation à niveau exécutif&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gestion de projet et respect des délais&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Appétence pour l&#39;IA et les nouveaux outils&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Management et développement de talents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connaissance du média (brand et performance)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orientation business, à l&#39;aise avec la data et le reporting chiffré&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Airship&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Airship is trusted by world’s leading brands such as Alaska Airlines, BBC and The Home Depot to drive revenue growth and customer loyalty with exceptional cross-channel customer experiences. Today, brands are challenged to deliver seamless, unified customer experiences across a fragmented array of channels and devices— apps, websites, email, SMS, wallets and more.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Airship’s no-code, AI-powered platform was designed with non-technical, growth-focused teams in mind, making it easy to create, test and orchestrate hyper-personalized experiences across all channels. With the ability to easily enrich customer data and rapidly launch growth experiments, Airship enables brands to deliver consistent, meaningful interactions that accelerate conversion and foster deeper customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We invite you to be part of our journey in building products and delivering services that touch millions of customers around the world every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To learn more about us, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.airship.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.airship.com/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1727358600004000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3xEidfNT5kaSMR1LbqH2tz&quot;&gt;www.airship.com&lt;/a&gt;, read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.airship.com/blog/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.airship.com/blog/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1727358600004000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2S7rp6uesS3WbpmG9CFOaR&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt; or follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/airship-social&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.linkedin.com/company/airship-social&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1727358600004000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2T3DnwhcK_pt63jzkrYdK6&quot;&gt;LinkedIn.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;About the Role&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Backend Java Engineer, you will design, develop, and support distributed systems that&amp;nbsp;combine scale with high reliability. You will work on low-latency services that process&amp;nbsp;continuous event streams and support analytical workloads across terabytes of data.&amp;nbsp;Our backend infrastructure runs on Google Cloud Platform. It uses Java-based microservices&amp;nbsp;and SQL and NoSQL databases. You will join a core engineering team that shapes Airship’s&amp;nbsp;technical foundations and engineering practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design data schemas and take ownership of data semantics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain, improve, and scale Java APIs and distributed services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate performance issues using server metrics, application data, and system&amp;nbsp;behavior&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the reliability, testability, and maintainability of our backend systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product and engineering teams on technical design and implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help define technical standards across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and own large-scale releases and technical projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI as a technical assistant to draft development plans and investigate problems or&amp;nbsp;bugs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Critically assess AI-generated suggestions for accuracy, security, and suitability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Duties and responsibilities described are not comprehensive. Additional tasks may be&amp;nbsp;assigned, or the role’s scope may change based on business needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least three years of experience designing, operating, and maintaining distributed&amp;nbsp;systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional fluency in spoken and written French&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Java development skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with unit testing, code reviews, documentation, and Git-based version&amp;nbsp;control&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading significant releases or technical projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with continuous integration and continuous delivery practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative and pragmatic approach to software development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A commitment to building reliable, maintainable, and testable systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;We&#39;d Be Delighted If You Also Have&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience troubleshooting and improving JVM performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Google Cloud Platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of distributed NoSQL databases or key-value stores&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Linux administration fundamentals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Work Location &amp;amp; Travel Requirements&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Airship’s ‘Digital First’ approach to work means that for the majority of our roles, work can be performed remotely, either some or most of the time. Airship believes that flexible work contributes to a more productive and more equitable work environment, and that Airshippers are able to collaborate, innovate, and support one another across different locations and timezones.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Some roles may require that employees perform their work from a specific location to support business activities, and/or be within proximity to an Airship office location or customer or partner locations, while other roles can be performed 100% remotely.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is &lt;strong&gt;fully remote&lt;/strong&gt; and may require &lt;strong&gt;up to 10%&lt;/strong&gt; travel based on business needs or as requested by your manager.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Compensation&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Starting pay may vary based on factors such as relevant skills, work experience, market demands, and location. All offers include stock options so employees have the opportunity to benefit from Airship’s success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical insurance options for you and your dependents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible time off, paid holidays, paid parental leave, and paid volunteer time off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support for your overall wellbeing with employer-subsidized mental health and employee wellness programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A digital-first work environment and a monthly stipend to support remote work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentorship and growth opportunities to build skills and accelerate professional development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;And more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;AI in Recruiting&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We use artificial intelligence tools in our recruitment process as decision-support tools only. Airship&#39;s People Operations team reviews all AI-generated scores and recommendations before making any hiring determination. No applicant is rejected solely on the basis of an AI-generated output.&amp;nbsp;Depending on your location, you may have the right to request human review of any AI-assisted employment decision or to opt out of AI evaluation. To make a request or learn more about how we use AI in hiring, contact &lt;a ----- ----- or visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://airship.com/legal&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;airship.com/legal&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;View our EU and UK Candidate Privacy Notice&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.airship.com/legal/eu-and-uk-candidate-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;**&lt;strong&gt;Please Note:&lt;/strong&gt; To ensure the security of your personal information, Airship will only contact candidates through email addresses ending with ----- class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Hiring Commitment&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Airship is committed to fostering a diverse work environment and providing equal employment opportunities to all applicants and employees. We welcome your application and our hiring and employment decisions are made irrespective of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, gender expression, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, disability status or any other characteristic protected by law. In alignment with our commitment to equal opportunity, Airship will consider for employment all qualified applicants, including those with criminal histories, in a way that adheres to the principles of fairness and the requirements of local Fair Chance laws, where applicable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;By submitting this application, I affirm that the facts set forth in it are true and complete to the best of my knowledge. I understand that if I am employed, false statements, omissions, or misleading information given in my application, interview(s), or in a background check may result in dismissal.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Indépendant | Rémunération à la commission uniquement | Territoire de vente local | Commissions déplafonnées&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;À propos de l’opportunité&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous recherchons des commerciaux terrain expérimentés, à l’aise pour se rendre dans une entreprise, engager la conversation avec le propriétaire et convaincre de nouveaux commerçants.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que conseiller commercial itinérant indépendant, vous vendrez les solutions de paiement, de point de vente et logicielles de SumUp aux petites et moyennes entreprises de votre région. Vous identifierez vous-même vos prospects, gérerez votre portefeuille d’opportunités et accompagnerez les clients lors de leur mise en route.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous devrez justifier d’une expérience en prospection à froid et apprécier la vente en face à face sur le terrain. Vous gérerez votre propre activité et organiserez vos démarches commerciales de manière autonome, tout en bénéficiant de la formation et du soutien de SumUp.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Vos missions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trouver de nouveaux clients grâce à des visites en face à face, de la prospection en porte-à-porte et des démarches directes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cibler les entreprises locales générant d’importants volumes de paiement et susceptibles de tirer parti des produits SumUp.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Poser des questions sur le fonctionnement de chaque entreprise et recommander des solutions adaptées en matière de paiement, de matériel, de caisse et de logiciels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gérer le processus de vente depuis le premier échange, en passant par les démonstrations de produits, la gestion des objections et la conclusion, dans le cadre du partenariat.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aider les clients à mettre en place et à commencer à utiliser leurs produits SumUp.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Établir des relations avec les chefs d’entreprise et demander des recommandations aux clients satisfaits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Planifier vos visites et vos suivis afin d’optimiser votre temps sur le terrain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Suivre votre activité, vos opportunités et vos résultats de vente, et transmettre les informations nécessaires au traitement des ventes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Échanger avec votre interlocuteur SumUp pour bénéficier de son expertise produit et de conseils commerciaux.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Ce que nous recherchons&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Indispensable&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Au moins un an d’expérience dans la vente sur le terrain dans des secteurs tels que les télécommunications, l’énergie, les technologies d’entreprise, la gestion des déchets, les systèmes de sécurité ou l’approvisionnement en produits alimentaires et boissons.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une expérience de la prospection à froid, notamment en démarchant des entreprises en face à face et en trouvant vos propres prospects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une expérience de la vente auprès de petites et moyennes entreprises et des relations directes avec les propriétaires ou les décideurs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Des résultats démontrables en matière d’acquisition de nouveaux clients et d’atteinte d’objectifs commerciaux. Nous vous demanderons des exemples de vos réalisations et de la manière dont vous y êtes parvenu.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;La capacité à gérer un processus de vente de la première prise de contact à la conclusion, y compris la gestion des questions et des objections.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un bon sens de l’organisation et un suivi rigoureux.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;La capacité à gérer les refus, à tirer les leçons des retours d’expérience et à persévérer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une bonne compréhension du statut d’indépendant et la volonté de développer votre portefeuille de clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;La capacité à vous déplacer sur votre territoire de vente afin de rencontrer régulièrement vos prospects et clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Atouts&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un réseau existant de chefs d’entreprise locaux susceptibles de bénéficier des produits SumUp.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une expérience dans le domaine des paiements, des services aux commerçants ou des systèmes de point de vente.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Une expérience de la vente par téléphone est un atout, mais vous devez également avoir vendu en face à face sur le terrain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Rémunération&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Il s’agit d’une activité indépendante, rémunérée exclusivement à la commission, sans salaire de base ni revenu minimum garanti. Les commissions sont déplafonnées et dépendent de vos résultats commerciaux et de l’activité des commerçants apportés.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Le système de commissions comprend, dans le cadre des conditions Partner :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paiements : 50 % du revenu net annualisé lié aux transactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Matériel : 50 % du prix de vente retenu dans le barème.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Logiciels et abonnements : 50 % du montant annuel retenu dans le barème.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Revenu résiduel : 20 % du revenu net mensuel généré par les commerçants apportés, pendant une durée maximale de trois ans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Avantage de bienvenue : trois fois le montant habituel des commissions résiduelles pendant les trois premiers mois.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Primes supplémentaires liées à certains produits ou opérations commerciales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Les nouveaux partenaires bénéficient des conditions Partner pendant la période de lancement. Leur maintien est ensuite soumis aux critères d’activité du programme ; un barème Agent de 40 %, sans commissions résiduelles, peut s’appliquer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Les conditions d’éligibilité, les bases de calcul et les modalités de versement sont précisées dans le contrat et présentées avant tout engagement. Les commissions s’entendent avant déduction de vos frais professionnels, cotisations sociales et impôts applicables.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Formation et accompagnement&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous vous aiderons à vous familiariser avec les produits et leur commercialisation grâce à un parcours initial et à un accompagnement continu couvrant la prospection, les entretiens de vente, les démonstrations, la gestion des objections et l’accompagnement des clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Les modalités du parcours initial et les prérequis à la commercialisation vous seront communiqués avant le démarrage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Votre interlocuteur SumUp vous apportera également son soutien en matière de développement territorial, d’analyse de vos opportunités et de conseils commerciaux, dans le respect de votre autonomie d’organisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Commercial terrain, Commercial itinérant, Sales, Freelance, Vente, Commercial B2B, Commercial indépendant, Développement commercial.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 110, 153);&quot;&gt;What Cognite is:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 41, 255);&quot;&gt;Relentless&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 110, 153);&quot;&gt;to achieve&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Cognite operates at the forefront of &lt;strong&gt;industrial digitalization, building AI&lt;/strong&gt;, and data solutions that solve the world’s hardest, highest-impact problems. With unmatched industrial heritage and a comprehensive suite of AI capabilities, including low-code AI agents, Cognite accelerates the digital transformation to drive operational improvements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We thrive in challenges. We challenge assumptions. We execute with speed and ownership. If you view obstacles as signals to step forward - not backwards - you’ll feel right at home here.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cognite.com/en/company/newsroom/cognite-s-industrial-ai-momentum-soars-driving-ecosystem-impact-at-global-conference&quot;&gt;Moonshot&lt;/a&gt; is bold: Unlock $100B in customer value by 2035, and redefine how global industry works. Join us in this venture where AI and data meet ingenuity, and together, we will forge the path to a smarter, more connected industrial future.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 100%;&quot; width=&quot;708&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Field / Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel:&lt;/strong&gt; Approximately 50% (Client sites, etc)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Cognite&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cognite is a global industrial Software-as-a-Service (SaaS) company enabling the full-scale digital transformation of heavy-asset industries. Our core software product, Cognite Data Fusion (CDF), powers companies with contextualized OT/IT data to develop and scale solutions that increase safety, sustainability, and operational efficiency while driving revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Business Development Director within our Supply Chain Center of Excellence (CoE)&lt;/strong&gt;, you will drive Cognite’s growth by winning new Supply Chain business within accounts headquartered in your territory. Operating as a subject matter expert, you will leverage deep domain insights to help customers transform their supply chain value chain using Cognite Applications and the Cognite Data Fusion Platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Territory &amp;amp; CoE Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and execute a targeted territory strategy to accelerate bookings growth and secure high-impact supply chain clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pipeline Generation:&lt;/strong&gt; Actively prospect and leverage your personal network to generate pipeline, providing compelling &quot;commercial insights&quot; on optimizing the supply chain value chain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Complex Sales Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead extended territory teams (including pre-sales and technical experts) through complex enterprise sales cycles to exceed bookings targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value-Based Selling:&lt;/strong&gt; Quantify ROI and present strong business cases to help enterprise executives justify software investments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner-savvy:&lt;/strong&gt; work with partners to qualify and progress their pipeline, and drive joint engagements on qualified opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deal Negotiation:&lt;/strong&gt; Support the Account / Engagement Leader in negotiating favorable pricing and commercial terms with C-level executives by demonstrating the long-term strategic value of Cognite’s solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with internal Product Management and Marketing teams to feed real-market supply chain insights back into product strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Hygiene &amp;amp; Forecasting:&lt;/strong&gt; Support the Account Leaders and their First Line Managers in accurately forecasting monthly/quarterly bookings and maintaining up-to-date account records in &lt;a href=&quot;http://salesforce.com&quot;&gt;Salesforce.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge, Skills, Abilities (KSAs) &amp;amp; Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Competencies:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain &amp;amp; Industry Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep domain expertise in complex Supply Chain operations for Energy, Manufacturing or Power Utilities verticals. Understanding of Production operations and industry x.0 initiatives is also required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Value Selling:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to sell value and build quantified ROI frameworks for prospective buyers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Informal Leadership, Influence &amp;amp; Autonomy:&lt;/strong&gt; High degree of self-motivation, time management, and ability to informally lead and effectively influence cross-functional deal teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Stellar presentation, written, and verbal communication skills tailored for C-suite engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge &amp;amp; Technical Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Software/SaaS:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven mastery of selling complex analytics or data platforms (e.g., AI, Big Data, Data Warehousing, Business Intelligence, Machine Learning).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Ecosystems:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with modern data architectures and tools, such as Big Data frameworks (Hadoop, Spark, Hive, BigQuery), Data Warehouses, and Machine Learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 10+ years of experience in the Manufacturing and broader industrial supply chain environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Track Record:&lt;/strong&gt; 7+ years of direct or in-support sales experience, selling enterprise software/SaaS (BI, Big Data, Advanced Analytics, or AI/ML) to C-level executives, Management and operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Performance:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated history of consistently meeting or exceeding SaaS bookings goals in direct / partner / channel-based sales models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Environment Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Prior experience operating in high-growth startup environments (Series A, B, or C stage).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Bachelor’s degree required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes Us Great &amp;amp; Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture &amp;amp; Values:&lt;/strong&gt; High autonomy, a culture of speed and openness, social and diversity initiatives (Together@Cognite), and a commitment to innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; Competitive base + variable compensation, 401(k) employer matching, fully covered health/dental/vision/disability premiums, and learning stipends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workplace Flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; Unlimited PTO, paid parental leave, and catered company lunches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 110, 153); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn more about us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cognite.com/en/resources/blog/key-highlights-from-impact-2025&quot;&gt;Impact 2025&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cognite.com/en/company/newsroom/cognite-s-industrial-ai-momentum-soars-driving-ecosystem-impact-at-global-conference&quot;&gt;Cognite&#39;s Industrial AI: Moonshot&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We’re globally recognized domain experts with an international presence that spans Phoenix, Houston, Oslo Tokyo, Bengaluru, and Abu Dhabi.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Cognite is committed to creating a diverse and inclusive environment at work and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive the same level of consideration for employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;FEQ128R38&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are on a mission to empower our customers to solve the world&#39;s toughest data and AI problems by utilizing the Databricks Data Intelligence Platform. As a Sr. Delivery Solutions Architect, you will partner with Sales, Solutions Architecture, and Field Engineering to accelerate the adoption, growth, and strategic impact of Databricks with our most complex customers. You will serve as a senior technical advisor, helping customers design, implement, scale, and optimize complex data and AI solutions across business units, geographies, and product areas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a highly technical and strategic customer-facing role. You will define technical execution strategies for high-value accounts, drive architectural alignment across complex use cases, and orchestrate Databricks, customer, and partner teams to deliver measurable outcomes. You will build trusted relationships with senior technical and executive stakeholders while contributing expertise, frameworks, and best practices that scale beyond individual customer engagements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Impact You Will Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define technical execution strategy across high-value, complex customer accounts spanning multiple use cases, business units, geographies, or product areas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a senior technical advisor to customer architects, technical leaders, and Director/VP-level stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and influence secure, governed, scalable architectures while balancing performance, cost, reliability, and long-term platform strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestrate Databricks, customer, and implementation partner teams to align technical execution and accelerate strategic outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipate platform maturity and scaling needs and establish technical standards for security, governance, developer experience, and operational excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive adoption, consumption, and measurable business outcomes through technical strategy and execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex technical escalations spanning multiple systems, teams, or workloads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reusable technical frameworks, solutions, and assets that scale across customers, teams, or regions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor DSAs and contribute to technical enablement, specialization, and thought leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years in solutions architecture, technical consulting, professional services, data engineering, or a related senior technical role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience leading technical strategy and architecture for high-value or highly complex customer environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience navigating complex programs across multiple business units, product areas, geographies, or technical workstreams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in one or more Data and AI domains, with strong knowledge of distributed data systems and cloud architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong coding proficiency in Python, SQL, Scala, or similar languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing secure, governed, scalable, and production-ready architectures across cloud and enterprise environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to solve complex technical problems using first-principles thinking, structured analysis, and technical experimentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to influence senior technical stakeholders and executive audiences and de-escalate complex customer situations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional leadership and stakeholder management skills, with the ability to orchestrate teams without formal authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of driving customer adoption, consumption, and measurable business outcomes through technical leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating reusable technical frameworks, assets, or programs that extend impact beyond individual customer engagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Databricks experience or certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognized expertise in a Data and AI specialization or competitive technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience influencing product direction through structured customer feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;External technical thought leadership through blogs, conferences, summits, seminars, or industry events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring technical talent or leading enablement across teams or regions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;FEQ128R40&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are on a mission to empower our customers to solve the world&#39;s toughest data and AI problems by utilizing the Databricks Data Intelligence Platform. As a Delivery Solutions Architect (DSA), you will partner with Sales, Solutions Architecture, and Field Engineering to accelerate adoption and growth of the Databricks platform. You will serve as a trusted technical advisor, helping customers design, implement, scale, and optimize data and AI solutions that deliver measurable business value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a technical and customer-facing role focused on architecture, technical strategy, and customer outcomes. You will influence technical execution across complex use cases, guide architectural decisions, and align Databricks, customer, and partner teams from technical win through production and adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Impact You Will Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and influence technical execution strategies across complex use cases and multiple workstreams within strategic accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted technical advisor to customer technical leads and architects, leading architecture discussions and guiding technical decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design secure, governed, and scalable Databricks architectures while balancing performance, cost, reliability, and long-term needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and demonstrate working solutions, prototypes, and reusable technical assets that accelerate customer outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipate platform maturity and scaling needs and establish best practices for security, governance, and operational excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive adoption and consumption by influencing architecture, unblocking delivery, and connecting technical execution to business outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner across Databricks, customer, and implementation teams to align resources, manage risks, and accelerate delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor peers and contribute reusable technical guidance, frameworks, and enablement across the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in solutions architecture, solutions engineering, technical consulting, professional services, data engineering, or a related technical role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in influencing technical strategy and architecture across complex customer use cases or multiple workstreams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong coding proficiency in Python, SQL, Scala, or similar languages, with the ability to build, debug, and validate technical solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of distributed data systems, data engineering, analytics, data warehousing, AI/ML, and modern cloud architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing secure, governed, scalable, and production-ready data solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to solve ambiguous technical problems, evaluate trade-offs, and validate solutions through structured analysis or experimentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading architecture discussions with technical leads, architects, and senior customer stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of platform operational excellence, including security, governance, performance, reliability, and cost optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to drive customer adoption, consumption, and measurable business outcomes through technical leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management and cross-functional leadership skills, with the ability to align teams without formal authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Databricks experience or certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing expertise in a technical specialization such as AI/ML, data engineering, streaming, data warehousing, governance, or migrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AWS, Azure, or GCP and production cloud deployments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating reusable technical frameworks, demos, or enablement that scale across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Zürich (hybrid)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead Data &amp;amp; AI engagements for enterprise clients in Switzerland, with a focus on Financial Services, combining strong technical understanding with consulting and delivery leadership. Working closely with our teams in Switzerland, Poland, and India, you will help clients turn their Data &amp;amp; AI ambitions into practical solutions while contributing to new opportunities and the development of our Data &amp;amp; AI service line.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;flex-1 flex flex-col px-4 max-w-3xl mx-auto w-full pt-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-find-provider-scope=&quot;&quot;&gt;
