&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Ensure client accounts are well managed and growing by improving KPIs and customer benefits, increasing embeddedness, and seeking opportunities for new journeys. In addition, this role supports the Manager, Customer Success by training and coaching the more junior and newer team members to increase team skills, together with providing day-to-day direction and support to CSMs for clients within their portfolio.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:257}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
