&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Aiven&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Aiven is the open source based data platform that builders trust to run PostgreSQL®, Apache Kafka®, ClickHouse®, OpenSearch®, Valkey™ and more in production, on any cloud. Builders ship faster. Their companies run on data that stays available, secure and under control.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You own the commercial relationship with a book of existing Aiven customers across the UK &amp;amp; Ireland, worth more than $4m in ARR. Your job is to keep those customers, grow them, and turn their success into proof for the next customer. You spot risk early, and find the next use case before the customer asks for it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You also open new doors: cold and warm outreach into accounts that look like your best customers, from first conversation through close.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You lead with AI from the front. It shapes how you plan, how you engage and what you say in every customer conversation. Agents do the research, monitoring and first drafts; you decide what matters and where to push. The outcome is growth: more ARR retained, more expanded and more pipeline created, earlier and more predictably.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Why now: Aiven has ambitious growth plans, and we&#39;re on track. Every customer we serve is building AI, and AI depends on the data platform underneath it. Our open source based platform means no lock-in, so builders ship faster and our customers move with more innovation velocity. You sit at the centre of that, working with customers from Fintech and AI innovators through to Utilities whose AI ambitions depend on us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the strategic partnership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow each account in your book beyond its current baseline in usage and commitments. This is the primary mandate of the role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and run an account plan for every priority account, with clear goals, stakeholders, risks and expansion opportunities across the Aiven platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Solutions Architects and Technical Account Managers on technical validation, and bring in Product Engineering, Aiven leadership and executives where a customer needs senior backing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Retain and grow ARR&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spot contraction and churn risk early, using usage and sentiment signals surfaced by agents, then act on them before the customer does. Build a protection plan for each risk with the Aiven customer team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Find cross-sell and upsell opportunities across the Aiven platform, and see them through to close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run renewals as a plan, not an event. Know the commercial position, the decision makers and the competing options well before the renewal date. Lead commercial and contract negotiation through to signature.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualify and manage every renewal, expansion and new logo opportunity with MEDDPICC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build relationships at every level&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships with the builders who use the Aiven platform day to day (engineering, platform and product leads) and the teams who consume the services it delivers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships with executives, budget holders and senior IT decision makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn happy customers into proof&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use your relationships to build positive sentiment, then work with Marketing to turn it into events, webinars, case studies and references matched to the right prospect.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Aiven at UKI industry events, and feed customer, competitive and market insight back to Product, Engineering and leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Open new doors&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own new logo opportunities in the UKI territory, from prospecting through close, using cold and warm outreach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run the book AI-native&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own how your work gets done: decide which tasks you do, which agents do and which stop entirely. Review this as the tools improve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run account research, risk and usage monitoring, outreach drafting and forecasting through agents. Spend your time on judgment, relationships and negotiation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep Salesforce accurate so the forecast, and the agents reading it, reflect reality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share what works with the team. The way you work is a product too.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience owning a book of existing customers in enterprise B2B software, with a record of retaining and growing ARR, managing renewals and churn risk, and negotiating contracts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling to technical users and to executive buyers, and adjusting your message for each.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A structured approach to account planning and multi-threading.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication in English, written and spoken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily, hands-on use of AI tools in your sales workflow, with examples of work you have redesigned or cut as a result.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High agency: a record of owning accounts end-to-end and solving hard problems without waiting for a blueprint.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience co-selling with cloud providers and partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with usage-based or consumption pricing, and with using usage data to spot risk and opportunity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling open source based data technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running customer advocacy: references, case studies, event speakers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we measure success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quota attainment, net revenue retention and gross revenue retention for your book, against target.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expansion ARR from cross-sell and upsell, against target.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Churn and contraction risks flagged early, each with a documented protection plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive and budget holder coverage across priority accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer references, case studies and event speakers delivered each year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pipeline creation, deal progression and on-time opportunity booking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forecast accuracy and CRM hygiene.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time spent on customer conversations vs. admin and research, trending the right way quarter on quarter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Workflow improvements adopted by the wider team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role context&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team: Field Sales EMEA South.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Book: more than $4m ARR across existing customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customers: Fintech and AI innovators through to Utilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reports to: EMEA South Sales Director.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First 90 days: learn the business, the technology, your customer base and how we work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focus: existing customers first, with new logo opportunities in UKI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Works closely with: Solutions Architects, Technical Account Managers, Support, Product Engineering, Marketing, Sales Development and Aiven leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: London, UK, with the right to work there. Hybrid working, with regular time together in the London hub for planning and deal reviews, and travel to customers as needed. Adjustments available.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p4&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunities:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;Aiven provides equal employment opportunities to all qualified employees and applicants for employment without regard to age, gender identity, national or ethnic origin, religion, sexual orientation, physical and mental ability, marital and family status or without regard to any other similar personal attributes. Aiven complies with applicable local laws governing non-discrimination in employment in every location in which the company operates. This policy applies to all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, placement, promotion, termination, layoff, transfer, leaves of absence, compensation, training and any other terms and conditions related to employment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p4&quot;&gt;At Aiven, we are committed to providing reasonable accommodations for qualified individuals with disabilities or special needs in our working environment and job application procedures. We make all reasonable accommodations for persons with disabilities or who otherwise need support to thrive in the workplace. We are committed to continuously improving workplace accessibility. There is an option to request a discussion in the application process but if you have any questions before applying please write to us at -----<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Muck Rack is trusted by thousands of organizations around the world to understand how their brands show up across news, social media and AI-generated answers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our AI-powered platform connects the entire PR workflow in one place, helping communications teams manage media relationships, understand the conversations shaping their brands, take action and measure their impact. Combined with analyst-led Media Intelligence and advisory services, Muck Rack turns signals into insights and insights into action.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founder-controlled and growing&amp;nbsp; profitably and sustainably, we have the freedom to build forward-thinking products, put our customers first, and offer an inclusive culture that welcomes diverse perspectives.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our Agents team at Muck Rack is building AI for PR and communications professionals. Our first agent helps customers understand their media coverage. Next, we’re building agents that can plan and carry out multi-step workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll take features from idea to production, working across our Python agent runtime, MCP server, and Django/Vue application. You’ll help decide how the technology works, ship it to real customers, and learn from how they use it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll help shape what we build next and how we build it. You’ll work with new models, solve real customer problems, and take your ideas from experiment to production. If you want to build agents people actually rely on, we’d like to meet you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build agents that take action.&lt;/strong&gt; Build tools, prompts, guardrails, and multi-turn workflows with memory. Help agents know when to act, ask a question, or hand off to a human&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ship the full experience.&lt;/strong&gt; Build in-product chat, streaming responses, permission-aware APIs, and our external MCP server&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make quality measurable.&lt;/strong&gt; Build evals, catch regressions, and use production feedback to improve quality, latency, and cost&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help shape the platform.&lt;/strong&gt; Make decisions about how we build, deploy, and run agents as the product grows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To Be Set Up for Success in This Role, You&#39;ll Need to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years building production software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent Python skills, including async programming and experience with FastAPI, FastMCP, or Django&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience shipping LLM-powered features or agents to real customers including exposing tools via MCP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A practical understanding of prompting, tool use, context management, and where models go wrong&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience measuring AI quality and using what you learn to improve it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong API and tool design skills, including authentication and authorization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively incorporates AI tools into day-to-day work to improve productivity and accelerate delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working-hour overlap with US time zones (Eastern preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If Any of the Below Also Describe You, This Could Be an Exciting Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agent frameworks such as Pydantic AI, LangGraph, or the OpenAI Agents SDK&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MCP servers and LLM tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI evaluation tools and methods, including DeepEval and LLM-as-judge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Streaming UIs, server-sent events, and Vue.js&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with LLM observability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI security, including prompt injection defenses and tenant isolation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interview Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Below you&#39;ll find an outline of the interview plan for this role. Please note that this is what we expect the process to look like; we may ask you for supplemental information or require an additional step before making a final decision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30-minute interview with a member of our Talent Team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A 1 hour zoom interview with the hiring manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Peer interviews with several team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30-minute Executive Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30-minute Bar Raiser&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel &amp;amp; Team Engagement Expectations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires up to 10% travel for team collaboration, customer engagements, and company events. As part of our commitment to building strong connections across our fully distributed team, attendance at our annual company offsite (typically held in Mexico) is expected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;108&quot;&gt;The anticipated salary range for this role in Ireland is €95,000–€110,000 annually, depending on experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The anticipated salary range for this role in United Kingdom is £105,000–£115,000 annually, depending on experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;110&quot; data-end=&quot;211&quot;&gt;The anticipated salary for this role in Bulgaria is €6,500+ gross per month, depending on experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual compensation decisions are based on a number of factors, including experience level, skillset, and balancing internal equity relative to peers at the company. We expect the majority of the candidates who are offered roles at our company to fall healthily throughout the range based on these factors. We recognize that the person we hire may be less experienced (or more senior) than this job description as posted. If that ends up being the case, the updated salary range will be communicated with you as a candidate.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Muck Rack?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote Work, Forever&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fully distributed team with a permanent remote setup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office stipend, phone and internet reimbursement, coworking membership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Virtual and in-person team bonding (lunches, events, competitions)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transparent &amp;amp; Fair Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive geo-neutral pay in the U.S.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual reviews to ensure equity and market alignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Standardized bonus or commission structure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) with employer contributions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive medical, dental, vision, disability, and life insurance for employees and dependents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;100% premium coverage for individuals on high-deductible plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;24/7 Virtual Care and Employee Assistance Program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employer-funded HSA contributions and other pre-tax benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quarterly wellness stipend and free Headspace subscription&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time Off &amp;amp; Family Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;4+ weeks of PTO, plus paid sick and mental health days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;13 paid holidays with the option to swap for personal days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 16 weeks of fully paid parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning and Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transparent pathways for internal mobility and promotion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bi-annual performance reviews, team workshops, and leadership training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited access to Coursera and O’Reilly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 additional PTO days annually for learning and development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusive, Customer-First Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commitment to equity and valuing diverse perspectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agile, founder-led company focused on collaboration and innovation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trusted by 3,000+ companies worldwide&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Note: Benefits and compensation reflect offerings for U.S.-based employees. Support is provided for employees in other locations, in compliance with local laws and regulations.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we are a fully distributed team, we do have limitations on where we can hire and maintain a list of acceptable working locations based on job function. If we are unable to hire in your current location for the role for which you applied, you will be notified via email. While we enjoy many benefits as a permanently distributed and remote company, we cannot always support relocation or extended travel and have guidelines in place to ensure compliant work away from your designated permanent residence.&lt;/p&gt;
