&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THG is committed to creating a diverse &amp;amp; inclusive environment and hence welcomes applications from all sections of the community.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Because of the high volumes of applications our opportunities attract, it sometimes takes us time to review and consider them all. We endeavour to respond to every application we receive within 14 days. If you haven&#39;t heard from us within that time frame or should you have any specific questions about this or other applications for positions at THG please contact one of our &lt;span class=&quot;mark75xs2u5gf&quot; data-markjs=&quot;true&quot; data-ogac=&quot;&quot; data-ogab=&quot;&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsb=&quot;&quot;&gt;Talent&lt;/span&gt; team to discuss further.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Department Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Technology Infrastructure team operates globally and is responsible for every aspect of the firm&#39;s hybrid platform. This ranges from our EUC/Office environments to Trading and Core service Co-Location Data Centres, and extends to Public Cloud, delivering top-tier technology services to a dynamic and demanding Trading organisation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In addition to meeting the round-the-clock operational demands of the platforms, we continuously evolve and transform our platforms to maintain a competitive edge that our business requires. We innovate to provide valuable solutions and leverage our skilled Technology teams to deliver against rapidly changing business requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a member of our London-based Infrastructure and Platform Engineering team, this position supports our multi-tenant private and public cloud initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role contributes to the delivery of services to our core business areas globally, including Trading, middle and back office, and Technology. The role requires an understanding of platforms including Windows, virtualisation and their associated technologies, delivered through on-premises, hosted and public cloud environments. It involves system integration, support and continuous improvement, with an emphasis on standardisation, repeatability, automation and orchestration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate will cover BAU rota activities alongside business project initiatives. We are looking for a proactive self-starter who can manage their workload, identify opportunities for improvement and work alongside senior engineers to develop their experience in solution design, scoping and architecture across our key technology platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With the team’s broad technology remit, this role would suit someone early in their Windows platform engineering career who is keen to build their experience in a fast-paced environment and gain exposure to a wide range of technologies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A minimum of 5 years of industry experience. Prior experience in a similar role within a Financial institution will be advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive platform engineering and support experience biased towards the Microsoft server technology portfolio, including On-premise bare metal hardware deployments (preferably HPE), Advanced virtualisation design, architecture and support across VMware and Microsoft Hyper-V platforms, together with container technologies such as Kubernetes. This should also include enterprise integration experience with security, high availability, networking, load balancing aspects to deliver applications and infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience administering Microsoft 365 services including Exchange Online, Entra ID, Teams and SharePoint Online.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience and proficiency in translating requirements through to providing and supporting solutions and environments for both proprietary and commercial software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Platform engineering and support experience with public cloud platforms, preferably with a major Hyperscaler like Microsoft Azure or AWS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Infrastructure as Code methodologies with On-Prem and Cloud IaaS, achieved through automation and orchestration of cross-platform services using tools such as Source Control, Ansible, Jenkins, Terraform and ServiceNow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable scripting or programming skills in languages such as PowerShell, Python and familiarity with APIs and data structures in JSON/YAML or similar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with GenAI technologies via Public Cloud, OpenAI, AWS, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate is analytical and methodical, with a proven track record in problem-solving, critical BAU, advanced engineering and technology service delivery in a high-pressure, time-sensitive environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You should be passionate about emerging technology trends, innovations and directions, and eager to suggest and implement new solutions to enhance our technology performance. You should also understand the need for rapid delivery while appreciating business risk and constraints to ensure adherence to service levels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The candidate should have experience working both independently and as part of a diverse team, meeting both broad and specific project/BAU objectives. This role requires excellent organisational skills, open communication, and a collaborative approach.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your commitment to continuous improvement should be evident, both in learning from others and sharing knowledge to enhance our team&#39;s capability and function.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;BlueCrest is committed to providing an inclusive environment for its workforce. As an employer, we provide equal opportunities to all people regardless of their gender, marital or civil partnership status, race, religion or ethnicity, disability, age, sexual orientation or nationality. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Department Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Technology Infrastructure team operates globally and is responsible for every aspect of the firm&#39;s hybrid platform. This ranges from our EUC/Office environments to Trading and Core service Co-Location Data Centres, and extends to Public Cloud, delivering top-tier technology services to a dynamic and demanding Trading organisation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In addition to meeting the round-the-clock operational demands of the platforms, we continuously evolve and transform our platforms to maintain a competitive edge that our business requires. We innovate to provide valuable solutions and leverage our skilled Technology teams to deliver against rapidly changing business requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The AI DevOps Engineer is a very technical, hands-on role, responsible for end to end delivery and operations of our DevOps environments. They will be joining the team as we lead an ambitious technology modernisation journey, moving to greater adoption of AI, microservices and public cloud. We’re continuing to evolve our global infrastructure - spanning multiple global data centres - into a modern hybrid architecture that leverages both existing on-prem and multi-cloud environments and capabilities across Azure and AWS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Over the past four years, we&#39;ve modernised our core trading systems and introduced a range of key technologies including AI, Kubernetes, Kafka, ELK, Prometheus, and more. As we expand and enhance the platforms, our focus is on automating and standardising to ensure consistency, scalability and reliability across all environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experiences and Skills Required:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong object oriented Python skills (not just scripting)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent understanding of containerisation technologies, ideally Kubernetes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with GitHub Actions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Infrastructure as Code (IaC):
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good, enterprise experience with Terragrunt, Terraform, and Ansible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivery-focused mindset, with priorities aligned to business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have, but willing to learn otherwise:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and deploying AI agents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise across Azure and AWS, with a solid understanding of AI-native services:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Azure AI Foundry and Amazon Bedrock&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud automation experienceAgentOps/DataOps frameworks (e.g. LangGraph, Dagster) and OpenTelemetry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Predictive operations tools (e.g. Prophet, Dynatrace)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI tool integration, including embedding LLM APIs and agents into pipelinesExperience integrating DevOps infrastructure with MCPs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with infrastructure testing frameworks (Terratest, Terraform Test, Molecule, JUnit, pytest)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kubernetes engineering and support across on-prem, VMware, AKS and EKS environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Linux and Windows administration and network automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Java and/or C# troubleshooting capability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CI/CD experience with GitHub Actions and/or TeamCity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Artifact repository management (Nexus, Artifactory)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Observability, monitoring and tracing (OpenTelemetry, Prometheus, ELK, Tempo, Jaeger)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Platform engineering on Azure and/or AWS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data platform experience (Kafka, Redis)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Chaos engineering and resilience testing (Gremlin, LitmusChaos)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a very strong individual contributor who is passionate about emerging technologies. You’ll need to be comfortable working in a very dynamic, fast-paced environment. Enabling the business is our number one priority – this means working on any part of the delivery stack, from routine o/s IaC, to documentation, instrumentation all the way to automating work through Python microservices or LangChain based agents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You should be passionate about AI and other emerging technology trends, innovations and directions, and eager to suggest and implement new solutions to enhance our technology performance. You should also understand the need for rapid delivery while appreciating business risk and constraints to ensure adherence to service levels.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The candidate should have extensive experience working both independently and as part of a diverse team, meeting both broad and specific project/BAU objectives. This role requires excellent organisational skills, open communication, and a collaborative approach.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Your commitment to continuous improvement should be evident, both in learning from others and sharing knowledge to enhance our team&#39;s capability and function.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;BlueCrest is committed to providing an inclusive environment for its workforce. As an employer, we provide equal opportunities to all people regardless of their gender, marital or civil partnership status, race, religion or ethnicity, disability, age, sexual orientation or nationality. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Affirm, we exist for the moments that matter—giving people a clear, predictable way to pay over time, with no hidden fees, no surprises, and no tradeoffs on what matters most.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;Affirm is reinventing credit to make it more honest and friendly, giving consumers the flexibility to buy now and pay later without any hidden fees or compounding interest. Our mission to deliver honest financial products that improve lives extends beyond borders. Consumers across the globe need safe, transparent financing. Our retail partners need Affirm to be there for them, wherever that might be. To help achieve this vision, we are expanding our product lines and becoming a global company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The International Consumer product team is responsible for building and scaling Affirm’s direct-to-consumer products and experiences across international markets. This includes our apps, wallets, marketplace, and related offerings that help consumers discover, use, and manage Affirm.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Product Manager on the International Consumer team, you will drive the strategy, execution, and growth of Affirm’s direct-to-consumer products across international markets – from iterating on the product vision, refining the product strategy, developing a roadmap, and leading execution.&lt;br&gt;In this role, you will work closely with a broad set of cross functional teams across the entire business, as well as a number of engineering teams. Effective stakeholder management and ability to successfully navigate organizational dynamics are a must for success. You should be commercially minded, be high agency with a bias towards action, and comfortable having technical conversations (and opinions).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive the execution, growth, and scale of Affirm’s consumer products and experiences across international markets&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Take Affirm’s direct-to-consumer products and adapt them for international markets by understanding consumer needs, analyzing performance data, and iterating on the product’s features and capabilities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive success metrics by shipping high impact work that meaningfully moves the needle for Affirm’s business and customers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner effectively with engineering teams across the organization to drive product development and prioritization&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborate with stakeholders (such as Design, Research, Analytics, Marketing, Legal, Compliance, Credit, Fraud, etc.) to shape your product roadmap and incorporate legal, governance, and regulatory oversight into your products&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Understand Affirm’s international consumers at a deep level: what’s important to them, what drives their decision making, why they love Affirm, and what they wish we could do better&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Identify and create the experiences that make it seamless for consumers to discover, use, and manage Affirm across our apps, wallets, marketplace, and related direct-to-consumer offerings&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn’t your first rodeo. You’ve directly managed technical software products from kick-off to post-launch – driving meaningful business impact that you can speak to&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have experience working on consumer technology products in Canada, UK, EU, or Australia (bonus points if that experience is in fintech, commerce, marketplaces, or payments)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re equally comfortable diving into technical details with an engineer, iterating on a Figma with a designer, and breaking down a funnel with a data analyst&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have the discipline, organizational skills, and interpersonal communication skills necessary to navigate complex organizational dynamics – you have specific examples of times when you’ve secured a decision from a broad group of senior stakeholders&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ve worked in an environment where you were reliant on engineering teams outside of your direct purview and were able to effectively influence them to prioritize and build what you needed for your product&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re the kind of person who cares about getting things done. You have a bias towards action and can effectively navigate obstacles and blockers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can turn incomplete, conflicting, or ambiguous inputs into a solid action plan&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have direct experience shipping high-quality products on time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You feel comfortable jumping into the commercial aspects of product development – you’re able to connect customer needs, product decisions, and business outcomes, and make clear tradeoffs across them&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Grade - N&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equity Grade - 5&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Employees new to Affirm typically come in at the start of the pay range. Affirm focuses on providing a simple and transparent pay structure which is based on a variety of factors, including location, experience and job-related skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Base pay is part of a total compensation package that may include monthly stipends for health, wellness and tech spending, and benefits (including 100% subsidized medical coverage, dental and vision for you and your dependents). In addition, the employees may be eligible for equity rewards offered by Affirm Holdings, Inc. (parent company).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;GBR base pay range per year: &amp;nbsp;£120,000–£168,000 GBP&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Location - Remote UK&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote-first with flexibility built in&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Affirm is proud to be a remote-first company. Most roles can be done from almost anywhere within the country of employment. Some positions may occasionally require in-person work at an Affirm office, and a few are office-based due to the nature of the work. All new hires will be invited to attend an in-person onboarding experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits designed for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Our benefits reflect our commitment to care, transparency, and flexibility. Here are a few highlights:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health coverage at no cost: We cover 100% of premiums for employees and their dependents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spending stipends: Monthly stipends support your tech setup, and the ability to choose health and wellness options that are right for you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off to recharge: Flexible time off and generous holiday calendars help you rest when you need to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a piece of what you build: Our employee stock purchase plan (ESPP) lets you buy Affirm stock at a discount.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re committed to providing an inclusive interview process, including accommodations for candidates with disabilities. If you need support, we’re happy to help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For positions based in San Francisco or Los Angeles: Affirm considers qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records, as required by law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By clicking &quot;Submit Application,&quot; you acknowledge that you have read Affirm&#39;s&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.affirm.com/global-candidate-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Global Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; and consent to the use of your personal information as described.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Twilio, we’re shaping the future of communications, all from the comfort of our homes. We deliver innovative solutions to&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://customers.twilio.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://customers.twilio.com/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;hundreds of thousands of businesses&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;and empower millions of developers worldwide to craft personalized customer experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our dedication to &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.twilio.com/en-us/blog/open-work&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.twilio.com/en-us/blog/open-work&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;remote-first work&lt;/a&gt;, and strong culture of connection and global inclusion means that no matter your location, you’re part of a vibrant team with diverse experiences making a global impact each day. As we continue to revolutionize how the world interacts, we’re acquiring new skills and experiences that make work feel truly rewarding. Your career at Twilio is in your hands.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hiring and how we work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We use Artificial Intelligence (AI) to help make our hiring process efficient. That said, every hiring decision is made by real Twilions!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Also, while we are a remote-first company, you may be asked to report in person on an ad-hoc basis for team gatherings, functional off-sites or customer meetings.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;See yourself at Twilio&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join the team as Twilio’s next New Business Account Executive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is needed to sell into high value Enterprise prospects and existing customers with ARR over $25k. You will play a key role in further growing Twilio’s Communication Products business across the DACH&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Region. You will be responsible for sourcing new, high value customers as well as driving the sales process from internal leads to qualifying new prospects and handling deals to closure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be responsible for new customer acquisition and driving ACV for a specific set of accounts while maintaining the highest levels of customer satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master creating pricing proposals, negotiating terms and managing the contract process. Ideally, you also have experience selling communications to a technical and business audience, building trust and mutual respect with technical customers and peers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be passionate about what you do and you are able to think outside of the box and have extraordinary interpersonal and communication skills to make complex contractual, technical, and financial details sound simple.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to balance challenging priorities and handle multiple projects/deals at the same time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Twilio values diverse experiences from all kinds of industries, and we encourage everyone who meets the required qualifications to apply. If your career is just starting or hasn&#39;t followed a traditional path, don&#39;t let that stop you from considering Twilio. We are always looking for people who will bring something new to the table!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of Enterprise Sales experience and a track record of personally selling and closing complex solutions to enterprise and software companies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience identifying, mapping and prospecting enterprise accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success in selling complex, technical solutions such as cloud communications platforms, APIs, and/or enterprise software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in account management, developing and managing large enterprise clients, and a history of meeting or exceeding sales targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Fortune 500 or similarly large enterprises&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in working within a quota-driven environment with proven ability to close high-value deals (e.g., six to seven figures)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in solution-based selling or consultative selling&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong negotiation and contract management skills, including handling complex deals with long sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prospecting and lead generation skills—ability to develop a pipeline through multiple channels, including direct sales, partnerships, and networking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build and nurture relationships with C-level executives, decision-makers, cross-functional partners and key stakeholders in large enterprises&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong presentation and negotiation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in a dynamic environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluent in German&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally, you also have experience selling both to a business and technical audience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of the CPaaS ecosystem and familiarity with:&amp;nbsp;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud communications (voice, SMS, chat, video, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;APIs and integrations for communication services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Telecommunications industry dynamics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of enterprise technology architecture and the technical needs of large organizations, including how CPaaS solutions integrate with existing systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will be remote, and based in UK, Spain or Ireland.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We prioritize connection and opportunities to build relationships with our customers and each other. For this role, approximately 25% travel is anticipated to help you connect in-person in a meaningful way.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working at Twilio offers many benefits, including competitive pay, generous time off, ample parental and wellness leave, healthcare, a retirement savings program, and much more. Offerings vary by location.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Twilio thinks big. Do you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We like to solve problems, take initiative, pitch in when needed, and are always up for trying new things. That&#39;s why we seek out colleagues who embody our values — something we call &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.twilio.com/company/values&quot;&gt;Twilio Magic&lt;/a&gt;. Additionally, we empower employees to build &lt;a href=&quot;https://twilio.org/support-and-resources/impact-fund&quot;&gt;positive change in their communities&lt;/a&gt; by supporting their volunteering and donation efforts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;So, if you&#39;re ready to unleash your full potential, do your best work, and be the best version of yourself, apply now! If this role isn&#39;t what you&#39;re looking for, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.twilio.com/company/jobs#open-positions&quot;&gt;please consider other open positions.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay alert to recruitment fraud&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We care about your safety. Scammers sometimes impersonate Twilio recruiters through fake job postings, emails, websites, or messages. Please ensure you are engaging with an official @&lt;a href=&quot;http://twilio.com&quot;&gt;twilio.com&lt;/a&gt; email address. We will never ask for payment, gift cards, cryptocurrency, or banking information during the recruiting process. We do not make job offers without a formal interview process or conduct interviews exclusively through text-based messaging apps.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Twilio is proud to be an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/strong&gt; We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, reproductive health decisions, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, genetic information, political views or activity, or other applicable legally protected characteristics. We also consider qualified applicants with criminal histories, consistent with applicable federal, state and local law. Qualified applicants with arrest or conviction records will be considered for employment in accordance with the Los Angeles County Fair Chance Ordinance for Employers and the California Fair Chance Act. Additionally, Twilio participates in the E-Verify program in certain locations, as required by law.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Duetto&#39;s platform runs 24/7 for hotels, resorts, and casinos around the world, and that reliability doesn&#39;t happen by accident. We&#39;re looking for a Senior DevOps Engineer to architect, build, and own the AWS infrastructure that keeps our Revenue &amp;amp; Profit Operating System fast, secure, and always on, while helping shape how our engineering org automates its way out of manual toil.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes Us Different?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Duetto is the hospitality industry&#39;s leading revenue management platform, founded in 2012 by former Wynn Resorts executives who knew the industry needed better technology. We built the world&#39;s first Revenue &amp;amp; Profit Operating System — a suite of tools (GameChanger, ScoreBoard, BlockBuster, Advance and more) that goes beyond room pricing to give hotels, resorts and casinos a complete picture of their revenue and profitability. Trusted by clients ranging from independent boutique hotels to global chains, we&#39;ve been named the #1 Revenue Management Software by HotelTechAwards four years running and the #1 Best Place to Work in Hotel Tech in 2025. Backed by GrowthCurve Capital since 2024, we&#39;re accelerating our investment in AI, and we&#39;re genuinely passionate about the industry we serve. We build products we&#39;re proud of, for customers we care about.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect and implement infrastructure for seamless migrations of critical systems, keeping uptime and reliability front and center&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and maintain the tooling and processes that let our SaaS products scale and run themselves on AWS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with developers to strengthen the reliability, performance, security, and scalability of our application architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain the critical infrastructure components that keep everything highly available and secure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive alignment across technical and non-technical teams, making sure infrastructure decisions serve the whole business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take your turn as last line of defense in our weekly on-call rotation, leading root cause analysis and driving fixes that stick for good&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You may be a good fit if you have the following:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in an Ops, DevOps, or SRE role, with real system design and architecture chops. You&#39;re comfortable administering cloud infrastructure hands-on (AWS preferred, Azure or GCP also welcome), and you know your way around networking and security at an engineering level.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re fluent in the AWS ecosystem (IAM, VPC, EC2, ELB, RDS, S3, Lambda, API Gateway, Secrets Manager, KMS, CloudWatch, CloudTrail), have run Terraform/Terragrunt in production, and have worked with Chef or Puppet.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re at home with GitHub, GitHub Actions, Jenkins, JFrog Artifactory, and GitOps workflows, and you&#39;ve used DataDog, Prometheus, or Grafana to keep tabs on system health.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can read Java, Ruby, Bash/Zsh, HCL, Python, and JavaScript well enough to move fast across a codebase.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong candidates may also have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ECS or EKS, exposure to SOC2 or secure-by-default practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with L7 load balancing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Duetto?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll own meaningful infrastructure decisions, not just execute someone else&#39;s blueprint. New tooling choices are proposed with a business case and decided as a team, so your judgment matters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We&#39;re an AI-forward company across every function, not just engineering. You&#39;ll be equipped to use AI for things like incident triage, IaC code generation, and runbook authoring, and encouraged to push that further&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll work at the intersection of serious infrastructure and an industry we genuinely love. Our customers depend on us around the clock, and that shows up in how seriously we take reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real collaboration, not silos. You&#39;ll partner directly with developers and cross-functional teams to solve problems together, not just file tickets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We celebrate diverse perspectives and back that up with the room to debate ideas openly. Come as you are, and bring your full self to the work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: Remote, Croatia, Spain or UK&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work model: Fully remote&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekly on-call rotation as last line of support for 24/7 services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Duetto is an equal opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, colour, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sound like you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like the kind of infrastructure work that gets you excited, apply even if you don&#39;t check every single box. We&#39;d rather meet someone with the right instincts and hunger to grow than tick boxes on a checklist.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-REMOTE&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job title:&lt;/strong&gt; Principal Engineer&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;London / Bristol / Edinburgh&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Enterprise Architecture&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary:&lt;/strong&gt; £120,000 - £160,000&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting to:&lt;/strong&gt; Director of Enterprise Architecture&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role is based in London, Bristol or Edinburgh&amp;nbsp;and requires existing right to work in the UK.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;At this time, we are not able to offer visa sponsorship for this role. We are committed to building a diverse, global team and our sponsorship policy is evaluated on a role-by-role basis. We encourage you to keep an eye on our careers site to stay informed about future opportunities where we are able to offer visa sponsorship.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Kaluza is the Energy Intelligence Platform, turning energy complexity into seamless coordination. We help energy companies overcome today’s challenges while accelerating the shift to a clean, electrified future.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our platform orchestrates millions of real-time decisions across homes, devices, markets and grids. By combining predictive algorithms with human-centred design, Kaluza makes clean energy dependable, affordable and adaptive to everyday life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;With teams across Europe, Asia and Australia, and a joint venture with Mitsubishi Corporation in Japan, we power leading companies including OVO, AGL and ENGIE, as well as innovators like Volvo and Volkswagen.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will I be doing?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;303&quot; data-local-id=&quot;71635837-a0ff-40e4-8b75-a1ff2b4444d0&quot;&gt;As a Principal Software Engineer at Kaluza, you will be the leading technical authority for a major global product area comprising multiple modules. You will lead innovation on some of the most complex, ambiguous, and large-scale solutions, aligning them with target architecture standards and contributing to the creation of a scalable platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;651&quot; data-local-id=&quot;afe318c5-d169-4335-980d-c55899c830d5&quot;&gt;You’ll have a broad sphere of influence, enabling multiple teams and serving as a strategic partner to our architecture leadership team and our community of principal and staff engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;840&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5d1958d8-2004-4ea0-821c-a0ebcadb4a0e&quot;&gt;Your impact will come mostly from &#39;hands-off&#39; work; you’ll not be expected to write code day-to-day. But for some challenges, you may need to dive into code-level design or help build a proof-of-concept.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ideally you’ll have/be&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1072&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c232f15f-f0a4-4008-a7b5-f91f1cfafc20&quot;&gt;Architect modern distributed, cloud-based systems applying modern architecture and engineering practices in an enterprise software environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1219&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8dba6a70-6d5c-45e2-a3af-1ccdaa41a861&quot;&gt;Shape and influence technical vision and product roadmaps to align with business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1310&quot; data-local-id=&quot;562ddf14-2519-461d-9844-e47621078721&quot;&gt;Provide hands-on leadership, making appropriate technical choices to satisfy requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1404&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7a0244ae-b45c-4845-88d4-50316da986b9&quot;&gt;Mentor and guide engineers in delivering autonomous, loosely coupled distributed systems with proven architectural principles and patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1547&quot; data-local-id=&quot;77346099-2aa3-43c1-91d9-749290fea5e1&quot;&gt;Lead technical due diligence and make high-stakes decisions with confidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1627&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7e1a1e9f-a262-4aec-8e83-9332f726304a&quot;&gt;Deliver results, influence diverse audiences, and orchestrate cross-functional solutions spanning multiple product features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1755&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c409df9a-e0b3-4f6b-a9a3-39d995612adf&quot;&gt;Engage effectively with both technical teams and executive leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1826&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7cb74d57-f395-456f-b7cf-298b271ed930&quot;&gt;Work independently and collaboratively, bringing strong opinions while respecting others, communicating openly, and maintaining self-awareness with a continuous growth mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What will set you apart&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2035&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a0dbc1d1-8544-470c-ae8a-18a2b9c5f141&quot;&gt;Experience enabling engineering teams to use AI and delivering AI/ML powered solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2126&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4e471dc5-7261-4e8c-ad4b-265e11f79d54&quot;&gt;Demonstrable experience in architecting solutions in complex business domains, particularly interface design and data modelling, ideally with experience in AWS and API design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2305&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1d87f974-8329-4a1b-9b26-2dfa45af34f8&quot;&gt;Proven track record delivering global &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;B2B2C&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; SaaS (energy or other mission‑critical industries).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2404&quot; data-local-id=&quot;769f5e5e-483c-4ef8-ba0e-ff433059a8a0&quot;&gt;Success driving adoption of modern engineering practices (e.g. DevOps, CI/CD).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2486&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d6312d22-3a41-4bcc-837e-9eee49ca8fda&quot;&gt;Experience leading teams through significant changes in ways of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2562&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f6f5546f-363b-4985-91fd-d58666e49784&quot;&gt;Ability to ramp up rapidly in new domains and technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where you&#39;ll work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer flexible working, with an expectation of 3 days a week in the office. This gives us the best of both: real time together to collaborate and build relationships, with the flexibility to work in the way that suits you best the rest of the week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kaluza Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here at Kaluza we have five core values that guide us as a business: Play to win, Solve the real problem, Build trust every day, Own the outcome, Go further together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discretionary Bonus Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical Insurance + Virtual GP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to Furthr - a Climate Action app&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free Mortgage Advice and Eye Tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perks at Work - access to thousands of retail discounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5% Flex Fund - to spend on the benefits you want most&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;26 days holiday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Progressive Leave Policy - With no qualifying service periods, including 26 weeks full pay if you have a new addition to your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personal Learning Budget - Upskill, learn and grow!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Office Budget&lt;br&gt;And more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We want the best people&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re keen to meet people from all walks of life — our view is that the more inclusive we are, the better our work will be. We want to build teams which represent a variety of experiences, perspectives and skills, and we recognise talent on the basis of merit and potential.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We understand some people may not apply for jobs unless they tick every box. But if you&#39;re excited about joining us and think you have some of what we&#39;re looking for, even if you&#39;re not 100% sure, we&#39;d still love to hear from you.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Find out more about working in&lt;a href=&quot;http://kaluza.com/&quot;&gt; Kaluza&lt;/a&gt; on our&lt;a href=&quot;https://kaluza-dev.webflow.io/careers&quot;&gt; careers page&lt;/a&gt; and&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/kaluza/&quot;&gt; LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Shape how Graphcore products move from hardware design into reliable volume manufacturing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Staff Manufacturing Product Engineer, you will take a leading role in supporting NPI development and volume production across complex hardware products. You will connect design, test, quality and supply chain decisions with real manufacturing outcomes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Your work will help ensure products are manufacturable, resilient and ready for supplier capability. You will provide DfM feedback that improves PCB and system design before issues reach production.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will work closely with contract manufacturers, especially during NPI and early volume manufacture. You will drive yield improvement, analyse production data and resolve L6 manufacturing issues.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This role suits someone who enjoys practical engineering ownership across design and production. You will travel to Taiwan and work close to suppliers shaping next generation manufacturing technologies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The team and culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will join the Manufacturing and Technology Process team within Operations. The team works across Bristol, Cambridge and Taiwan, close to foundry, package assembly and PCBA partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work happens through clear ownership, supplier engagement and fast feedback into design teams. You will speak up early when manufacturability, yield or capability needs attention.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The team values evidence, responsibility and strong cross-regional relationships. Decisions are made through engineering judgement, data and direct accountability for manufacturing performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Strong fault diagnosis, problem solving and failure analysis skills, including ICT to SMT debug&lt;br&gt;· Thorough understanding of Automated surface mount assembly processes and manufacturing methodologies&lt;br&gt;· Working knowledge of L10 mechanical design and system build, ideally for HPC products&lt;br&gt;· Ability to connect silicon, package and PCB interactions into clear DfM feedback&lt;br&gt;· Experienced in statistical analysis tools (e.g JMP, SQL, Python)&lt;br&gt;· Experience using continuous improvement methods, including SPC and DOE&lt;br&gt;· Strong interpersonal skills for supplier-facing, cross-functional and cross-regional engineering work&lt;br&gt;· Extensive experience in a similar manufacturing facing role&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;While we have outlined a set of requirements, we value transferable skills and diverse experiences. If you meet most of our essential criteria, we encourage you to submit an application and showcase how your background makes you a strong candidate.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Flexible working: Balance your work and personal life with greater flexibility&lt;br&gt;· Generous leave: Take time to rest, recharge and enjoy life outside of work&lt;br&gt;· Retirement planning support: Up to 5% matched pension&lt;br&gt;· Phantom equity: Share in Graphcore’s success&lt;br&gt;· Workplace experience: Enjoy thoughtfully designed office spaces for collaboration, with free food and an on-site barista to support your day&lt;br&gt;· Peace of mind protection: Income protection and life assurance to provide financial security for you and your loved ones&lt;br&gt;· Flexible benefits: Tailor your benefits package with a choice of additional options, including private medical insurance and dental cover&lt;br&gt;· Optional benefits: Dental cover, health cash plan, private medical insurance, cycle to work scheme, give as you earn&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome people from all backgrounds and experiences and are committed to building an inclusive environment where everyone can do their best work.&lt;br&gt;We’re an equal opportunity employer and recognise that everyone brings different strengths and perspectives. If you need any adjustments during the interview process, just let us know - we’re happy to support you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sponsorship&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants must have the legal right to work in the UK. Unfortunately, we are unable to provide visa sponsorship or support visa applications for this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join the Team at Graphcore&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Graphcore is one of the world’s leading innovators in Artificial Intelligence compute. It is developing hardware, software and systems infrastructure that will unlock the next generation of AI breakthroughs and power the widespread adoption of AI solutions across every industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of the SoftBank Group, Graphcore is a member of an elite family of companies responsible for some of the world’s most transformative technologies. Together, they share a bold vision: to enable Artificial Super Intelligence and ensure its benefits are accessible to everyone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Graphcore’s teams are drawn from diverse backgrounds and bring a broad range of skills and perspectives. A melting pot of AI research specialists, silicon designers, software engineers and systems architects, Graphcore brings together deep expertise to solve complex problems and deliver meaningful progress in AI compute.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to turn hardware design into stronger manufacturing performance, we’d love to hear from you. Apply now to help shape how Graphcore products are built.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Fanatics Markets:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Markets is the real-money prediction and trading app where you can invest in moments you care about. Built on a secure platform, we let users predict real-world outcomes and trade on events they actually follow — from sports and entertainment to political elections and beyond. Our mission is to redefine how fans engage with the moments and markets that matter most. We&#39;re looking for the right people to help us build the future of prediction markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This Staff Software Engineer role is an individual contributor position with technical leadership and significant ownership across our full stack: the web application customers use to interact with our product and the backend systems that power it. You&#39;ll combine hands-on engineering with responsibility for shaping architecture, setting technical direction, and enabling engineers across teams to deliver effectively.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Whether your deepest expertise is in frontend or backend engineering, you&#39;ll apply that strength across the platform while making meaningful contributions on the other side of the stack. Joining a product at an exciting early stage, you&#39;ll help define its technical foundations, identify the highest-impact engineering challenges, and turn ambiguous problems into clear plans that balance customer needs, delivery speed, and long-term reliability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your impact will extend beyond the systems you build. You&#39;ll lead complex initiatives spanning teams, mentor engineers, and establish practices that improve engineering quality and effectiveness. You&#39;ll also shape our approach to AI-assisted development while building systems that can handle millions of events daily.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On the engineering side, we&#39;re pioneering the use of AI as a code collaborator. We need engineers who have gone beyond experimentation — who actively use Claude Code, Codex, GitHub Copilot, or similar tools to ship production code faster while maintaining exceptional quality standards, and who can help others adopt these workflows responsibly and effectively.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set technical direction for major areas of the Markets platform, aligning architectural decisions with product strategy and guiding their implementation across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design and delivery of complex, scalable systems and customer experiences, contributing hands-on in React, Next.js, and TypeScript or backend services in Go, while making meaningful contributions across the stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and resolve ambiguous engineering problems spanning team or system boundaries, turning them into clear proposals, delivery plans, and measurable outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own critical initiatives end-to-end, from discovery and technical specifications through implementation, instrumentation, deployment, monitoring, and iteration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product, design, platform, and infrastructure teams to make informed tradeoffs across customer experience, accessibility, performance, security, reliability, and delivery speed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define architecture and integration patterns for frontend applications, backend APIs, and event-driven systems, with particular attention to correctness in markets, orders, and transactions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide the design of experimentation capabilities, including feature flags and A/B tests, so teams can validate ideas quickly and safely&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipate scaling constraints, reliability risks, and technical debt; build alignment on pragmatic improvements and drive them through to completion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise engineering standards through design reviews, code reviews, testing strategies, observability, and safe deployment practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor engineers and develop technical leaders, helping teams make sound decisions and solve problems independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and evolve standards for AI-assisted development, including appropriate use cases, review expectations, security safeguards, and validation strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure and improve engineering effectiveness, sharing tools and practices that increase delivery speed without compromising quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead through influence in an early-stage product environment, creating clarity, unblocking teams, and establishing ways of working that support growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Substantial experience building and operating highly scalable production systems, with demonstrated impact at Staff level or equivalent scope, including technical leadership across teams or major platform areas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in either user-facing web applications built with JavaScript/TypeScript and React or backend services built with languages such as Go, Java, or Python, alongside the ability to reason across the full stack. If you&#39;re frontend-strong, you don&#39;t need to arrive fluent in Go, but you should be comfortable engaging with backend architecture and system tradeoffs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of setting technical direction and delivering complex initiatives from ambiguous requirements through to measurable production outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong architectural judgment, including the ability to assess tradeoffs, establish clear system boundaries, and evolve systems as product requirements and scale change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience shaping React architecture, component-driven development, and modern state management using tools such as Next.js, TanStack Query, Tailwind, or Zustand; or deep backend experience with data modeling, distributed systems, and event-driven architecture using technologies such as Postgres and Kafka/PubSub&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of your primary language&#39;s features, idioms, and best practices, with experience establishing standards adopted beyond your immediate team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of performance, reliability, and security, including responsive design and accessibility on the frontend or scalability, observability, data integrity, and failure handling on the backend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience defining API contracts and collaborating across product, platform, and infrastructure teams to deliver reliable systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience shaping CI/CD pipelines, testing strategies, and safe deployment practices across services or applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead through influence, build alignment across teams, and communicate technical decisions clearly to engineers and non-technical stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of mentoring engineers, strengthening technical decision-making, and increasing the effectiveness of others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience using AI tools such as Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, or Copilot to ship production code, with sound judgment about their limitations and appropriate validation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Specific examples of improving development workflows, with evidence of their impact on delivery speed, quality, or engineering productivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team-first approach, with the judgment to move between strategic technical work and hands-on delivery according to the needs of the product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to create clarity in a high-growth environment where priorities evolve and decisions must be made quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional collaboration skills, including experience aligning teams and navigating dependencies within large enterprise environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;You don&#39;t need to tick every box — deep strength in one area, demonstrated technical leadership, and a willingness to learn go a long way.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience shaping technical foundations in early-stage or high-growth startup environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with real-money transaction systems, including financial correctness, auditability, and regulatory requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing technical roadmaps or leading architectural changes adopted across multiple teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in building developer tools or improving engineering productivity at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience establishing AI-assisted engineering practices across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributions to open-source projects or the technical community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BSc in Computer Science or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on the role, your interview and onboarding experience may include in-person components, such as onsite interviews or Launching into Better: LIVE—a multi-day cultural immersion in New York City for full-time, non-seasonal hires. These sessions are designed to build connections and bring our culture to life, though specific travel and participation requirements will be confirmed based on your role and location. Your recruiter will provide clear guidance at each stage of the process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ready to build the future of sports trading? If you possess some of these skills but not all of them, we still encourage you to apply! Please note that visa sponsorship is not available for this position. We are open to fully remote candidates based in the United Kingdom. Remote employees may also be eligible for a home office setup stipend.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.organization-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics will never ask candidates for money, banking information, or other sensitive personal information as part of the interview process. If you receive a suspicious message claiming to be from Fanatics recruiting, please do not respond and report it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a -----
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soho, London&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid working: 3 days in the office Tues - Thurs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To provide technical leadership and hands-on contribution within a data engineering team, designing, building, and optimizing robust data pipelines and infrastructure for a global sports betting and media business. This role is crucial in delivering high-quality data solutions that support LiveScore’s strategic goals and embody our commitment to being Fan Driven and a Champion of Sport. You will mentor junior engineers and ensure technical excellence in your domain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At LiveScore Group, we’re the proud home of three of the most exciting brands in the sports and gaming world: LiveScore, LiveScore Bet and Virgin Bet. A fully owned and operated ecosystem that converges the two worlds of sports media and sports betting. We’re proud of the high ratings for our commitment to excellence and fueling fan’s passion for sport driving us to the top.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don’t just lead; we innovate. Our cutting-edge products and immersive experiences set the standard, but it’s our people who truly make the difference. Every day, our team embody our values: adaptability, teamwork, a fan-driven approach, and an ever-curious mindset that fuels our ambition. As we scale and continue to create a culture that allows all employees to thrive, we know we need the most talented people with diverse backgrounds, perspectives and skills. If you’re good at what you do, come and join us. The more inclusive we are, the more amazing experiences we can create for our users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We know that job descriptions can sometimes seem daunting, and you might not feel you tick every box. But, if you’re passionate about the role and have relevant experience, we want to hear from you!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Leadership and Guidance:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a primary technical point of contact and subject matter expert for specific data engineering projects or domains, guiding team members through complex technical challenges and promoting innovative solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End Data Solution Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, develop, test, and deploy highly scalable, reliable, and fault-tolerant data pipelines and ETL/ELT processes. This includes data ingestion from diverse sources, data transformation, and data loading into various data stores (e.g., data warehouses, data lakes).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architectural Implementation:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with Data Architects to translate architectural blueprints and standards into concrete implementations, ensuring new data components align with the overall data strategy and infrastructure requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentorship and Skill Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Actively mentor and coach junior and mid-level data engineers, providing constructive feedback, sharing technical knowledge, and fostering their growth in coding, data modeling, and general data engineering best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-On Contribution:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain a significant hands-on role in coding, data modeling, infrastructure-as-code development, and platform configuration, leading by example and ensuring high-quality output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Quality and Performance Assurance:&lt;/strong&gt; Take direct responsibility for ensuring the quality, integrity, and performance of data assets within their assigned domain or projects, implementing monitoring, validation, and optimization strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Efficiency and Cost Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively identify and implement technical optimizations for data processing, storage, and infrastructure utilization to improve efficiency, reduce operational costs, and enhance system performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Code Review and Best Practices:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead and participate in rigorous code reviews, advocating for and enforcing engineering best practices, coding standards, and architectural patterns to maintain high code quality and system stability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Complex Problem Solving:&lt;/strong&gt; Diagnose, troubleshoot, and provide effective solutions for highly complex data-related issues, incidents, and performance bottlenecks, often working under pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate effectively with other engineering teams, product managers, data scientists, and business stakeholders to understand data requirements, integrate solutions, and provide technical insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills, Knowledge and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced Data Pipeline Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven, in-depth experience as a senior or lead data engineer with a strong portfolio of hands-on contributions to designing, building, and optimizing complex, large-scale data pipelines and ETL/ELT processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Data Warehousing (EDW) and Data Modeling:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong practical experience with EDW concepts, principles, and implementation, specifically including the design and practical application of a single, integrated data model for analytical purposes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud Data Platforms:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience with cloud-native data services and infrastructure on at least one major cloud provider (e.g., AWS services like S3, Redshift, Glue, EMR; GCP services like BigQuery, Dataflow, Pub/Sub; Azure services like Data Lake, Synapse Analytics).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cost Optimization Strategies:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ability to identify, propose, and implement technical solutions that lead to significant cost savings in data processing, storage, and infrastructure within a large-scale data environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Software Engineering Fundamentals:&lt;/strong&gt; Expert proficiency in software development methodologies (e.g., Agile, Scrum), version control (Git), CI/CD pipelines, automated testing, and comprehensive understanding of software engineering best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Programming Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional coding skills in at least one relevant programming language (e.g., Python, Scala, Java, JavaScript, C/C++), with a focus on writing clean, efficient, and maintainable code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Database Systems:&lt;/strong&gt; Extensive experience with various database technologies including relational databases (e.g., PostgreSQL, MySQL), NoSQL databases (e.g., MongoDB, Cassandra), and analytical data warehouses (e.g., Snowflake, Redshift, BigQuery).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Architecture Principles:&lt;/strong&gt; Solid understanding of data architecture patterns (e.g., Data Mesh, Data Lakehouse, Lambda/Kappa architectures), distributed systems, and their practical application.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regulatory Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; Practical experience in developing and maintaining robust and auditable data solutions for regulatory reporting, particularly within the gaming or other highly regulated industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluent in AI prompting alongside staying ahead of emerging AI technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Leadership &amp;amp; Mentorship:&lt;/strong&gt; A natural leader who can effectively guide, inspire, and technically mentor junior and mid-level engineers. Possesses the ability to break down complex problems, provide clear direction, and foster a learning environment, thereby enhancing team capabilities and promoting adherence to best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What can we offer?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company Performance Bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Working Agreements where applicable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Healthcare Scheme + Employee Enhanced Assistance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced Family Leave - Maternity, Shared Parental &amp;amp; Adoption Leave: up to 6 months at full pay and 6 months at half pay. Paternity leave: up to 4 weeks at full pay&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subsidised Gym Membership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual Travel Card Loan &amp;amp; Ride to Work Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance (x3 salary)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributory Pension Plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Virgin Family: Giving you access to exclusive Virgin offers and experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thursday drinks in the office and regular socials&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Motive empowers the people who run physical operations with tools to make their work safer, more productive, and more profitable. For the first time ever, safety, operations and finance teams can manage their drivers, vehicles, equipment, and fleet related spend in a single system. Combined with industry leading AI, the Motive platform gives you complete visibility and control, and significantly reduces manual workloads by automating and simplifying tasks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Motive serves nearly 100,000 customers – from Fortune 500 enterprises to small businesses – across a wide range of industries, including transportation and logistics, construction, energy, field service, manufacturing, agriculture, food and beverage, retail, and the public sector.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://gomotive.com&quot;&gt;gomotive.com&lt;/a&gt; to learn more.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Staff Product Manager, UK Market, you will define and execute Motive&#39;s product strategy for the UK, with the opportunity to expand your scope to continental Europe over time. You will own the commercial roadmap: where we compete, what we build, and in what order. You will then deliver it, working with engineering teams and peers across the product organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;International expansion is one of the most important strategic initiatives at Motive. You will partner closely with sales, marketing, customer success, finance, product leaders, designers, and engineers to bring our products to customers who face different regulations, vehicles, hardware, and buying needs than in the US. You will be a senior voice in the room as leadership decides where to invest, and you will see those decisions through to shipped product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To succeed, you must be comfortable influencing leaders across the company and navigating complex technical and organizational challenges. We operate like a startup within a larger organization, so you will wear many hats. Being entrepreneurial, commercially minded, and growth-oriented is critical.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the UK product strategy. Decide which segments, products, and use cases to prioritise to win, grounded in customer, competitive, and regulatory insight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align the company on the right commercial roadmap. Work with GTM, finance, and executive leadership to turn market opportunity into prioritised roadmaps, business cases, and investment asks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute with engineering. Partner with multiple engineering teams and product peers to scope, sequence, and deliver UK requirements, including regional feature adaptations, compliance products, and hardware and integration needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a deep understanding of UK customers, from fleet operators to drivers, through regular customer visits and field research, and translate what you learn into clear product requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence across the product organization so that shared platform and product teams deliver against UK priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish success metrics for the region, such as win rate, market coverage, adoption, and revenue, and report progress to senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the broader international strategy through market research, benchmarking, and financial and risk assessments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years in product management at a B2B company or on operational products, with a track record of leading complex, cross-functional initiatives at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product sense and execution, with the commercial judgement to tie roadmap decisions to business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep analytical skills and the ability to synthesise insight for an executive audience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to influence up and across, including senior engineering and business leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a startup or new team environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in the UK. London preferred for in-office collaboration. Ability to travel within the UK for customer visits and field research (about 1-2 times per quarter) and to San Francisco 1-2 times per year for team meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with products similar to Motive&#39;s, such as connected devices, telematics, fleet or asset management, IoT hardware plus software, or AI video and safety products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with international launches or localization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Creating a diverse and inclusive workplace is one of Motive&#39;s core values. We are an equal opportunity employer and welcome people of different backgrounds, experiences, abilities and perspectives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please review our Candidate Privacy Notice&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-link&quot; href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1X9AbvQHki8zZCyjDjip1g0NtdZHcykJc/view?usp=drive_link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;UK Candidate Privacy Notice &lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1nqdWTJ7WJJikhj1Yhlo4jxDRA_6yXZbd/view&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_-8012333603671085849gmail-docs-internal-guid-8821a356-7fff-42cb-93df-e4c910033371&quot;&gt;The applicant must be authorized to receive and access those commodities and technologies controlled under U.S. Export Administration Regulations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;It is Motive&#39;s policy to require that employees be authorized to receive access to Motive products and technology.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Regarding US-based roles, depending on your role and primary work location, Motive Technologies, Inc. (“Employer”) discloses candidates may be required to execute a non-compete covenant with the Employer. This requirement does not apply to lawyers, interns, or employees working in CA, MN, MT, ND, OK, or where otherwise prohibited by law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Non-compete covenant terms in all other jurisdictions will be subject to the applicable statutory requirements, including but not limited to, procedures, industry related prohibitions, or salary and compensation thresholds.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;All job postings are for existing vacancies. Please note; some interviews or new-hire training sessions may be held in person at one of our global offices.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Staff Product Manager – E-Commerce Web Upper Funnel [Permanent - CDI] (f/m/d)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Paris or Lille, France&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Decathlon E-Commerce Web – Scope Upper Funnel&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At the heart of Decathlon’s global digital ecosystem, our &lt;strong&gt;E-Commerce Web&lt;/strong&gt; team builds the online destination for millions of sports lovers worldwide. The &lt;strong&gt;Upper Funnel&lt;/strong&gt; scope is the front door of our digital experience: from landing on the homepage and navigating categories, to discovering products via search, AI-driven recommendations, conversational shopping, retail media placements, and inspiring content. Our mission is to seamlessly guide users from inspiration to intent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joining this high-traffic Web Product organization means operating at massive scale where speed, discovery excellence, SEO, targeted monetization, and next-gen personalized user journeys drive our everyday business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR FUTURE CONTRIBUTION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Staff Product Manager – Upper Funnel&lt;/strong&gt;, you will provide the strategic direction, functional architecture, and product leadership needed to scale and modernize the discovery and exploration experience across Decathlon&#39;s web platform. Operating with high autonomy, you will address complex challenges across search performance, catalog structuring, retail media integration, and emerging AI paradigm shifts like conversational interface models and agentic workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your mission centers on 4 strategic pillars:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Strategic Alignment, Stakeholder Management &amp;amp; Upper Funnel Vision&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Holistic Discovery &amp;amp; Engagement Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;: Define and drive the strategic vision for upper funnel web touchpoints (Homepage, Category/Listing Pages, Search Engine, Navigation Taxonomy, Retail Media Ad Placements, Conversational Assistants, and Inspiration Hubs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive &amp;amp; Cross-Functional Alignment&lt;/strong&gt;: Partner with global business directors, commercial/merchandising leads, SEO specialists, retail media monetization teams, and AI platform engineering leads to align executive leadership around major web platform shifts and discovery roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Macro Metrics &amp;amp; Funnel Performance&lt;/strong&gt;: Track, measure, and optimize key upper funnel metrics across the customer journey: Organic/Direct Traffic, Search CTR, Category Depth, Conversational Engagement &amp;amp; Intent Resolution Rate, Ad Yield/eCPM, Bounce Rate, Product Detail Page (PDP) Click-through Rate, and Top-of-Funnel Conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Functional Architecture &amp;amp; Web Ecosystem Orchestration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Functional Architect&lt;/strong&gt;: Define boundary maps and functional scope across web squads (Search &amp;amp; Conversational Discovery, Taxonomy &amp;amp; Merchandising, Personalization/Recommendations, Retail Media &amp;amp; Sponsored Listings) to eliminate overlap and friction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tight Triad Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;: Work in close sync with Staff/Principal Web Engineers and Staff UX/UI Designers to align frontend performance (Core Web Vitals), modular web design systems, micro-frontend architecture, conversational UI patterns, and backend search/ad-serving APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Seamless Omnichannel &amp;amp; Funnel Handoff&lt;/strong&gt;: Ensure fluid transitions from external acquisition channels into the web upper funnel, balancing organic product discovery and agentic assistance with sponsored/retail media inventory while designing seamless handoffs toward the lower funnel (PDP, Cart &amp;amp; Checkout).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Strategic Sparring &amp;amp; Product De-Risking&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Trusted Strategic Advisor&lt;/strong&gt;: Serve as a sparring partner for Group Product Managers (GPMs) and Product Managers (PMs) within the Web &amp;amp; E-Commerce domain, helping them navigate complex search algorithms, LLM agent architectures, ad server integrations, taxonomy dependencies, and high-volume web constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;De-Risking High-Stakes Initiatives&lt;/strong&gt;: Formulate and execute validation strategies for high-risk discovery and monetization concepts (e.g., visual/voice search, conversational product advisors, agentic auto-replenishment/bundles, sponsored product placements).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Experimentation at Scale&lt;/strong&gt;: Design and lead high-volume A/B and multivariate testing strategies, balancing conversational interaction models and ad impression density against organic conversion performance using CRO frameworks and Opportunity Solution Trees (OST).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. Elevating Product Craft &amp;amp; Modern Web Capabilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-First, Agentic &amp;amp; Monetization Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;: Champion the organizational adoption of cloud-native AI platforms (e.g., Google Vertex AI), conversational frameworks, agentic e-commerce patterns, and modern retail media capabilities to amplify both user experience and platform revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Web Craft &amp;amp; Best Practices&lt;/strong&gt;: Upskill the PM community in modern web product practices, continuous discovery frameworks, technical web performance optimization, and data-informed decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Community Multiplier&lt;/strong&gt;: Elevate the overall bar of the Product Management organization as a thought leader without acting as a direct line manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING TO THE TABLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;E-Commerce Web Scale (7+ years)&lt;/strong&gt;: Proven track record in Product Management with hands-on experience scaling high-traffic e-commerce web platforms (Upper Funnel, Search, Merchandising, or Navigation).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Upper Funnel &amp;amp; SEO Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;: Deep understanding of top-of-funnel mechanics, technical SEO, site search algorithms, taxonomy design, and conversion rate optimization (CRO).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; Discovery Mastery&lt;/strong&gt;: Strong expertise in web analytics (GA4/Amplitude/Contentsquare), high-traffic A/B testing frameworks, quantitative/qualitative user research, and Opportunity Solution Trees (OST).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Functional Architecture &amp;amp; Scoping&lt;/strong&gt;: Ability to decompose complex e-commerce catalog, ad-tech, and AI/search problems into modular MVP/V0/V1 execution strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Storytelling &amp;amp; Alignment&lt;/strong&gt;: Exceptional ability to translate complex search/agentic architectures, retail media revenue drivers, UX metrics, and conversion data into compelling narratives for executive stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Pluses &amp;amp; Emerging Tech Strengths&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Google Vertex AI&lt;/strong&gt;: Practical experience using Google Vertex AI (for Search, Recommendations, or custom ML/LLM model deployment) is a major plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conversational &amp;amp; Agentic E-Commerce&lt;/strong&gt;: Solid understanding or experience with conversational AI interfaces (chat/voice product advisors) and agentic commerce concepts (autonomous intent-matching, task-oriented AI agents) is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Retail Media &amp;amp; Monetization&lt;/strong&gt;: Experience with Retail Media concepts and ad management (sponsored products, ad-server integrations, balancing yield vs. UX) is a major plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft Skills &amp;amp; Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;: Strong strategic influence, ability to thrive in ambiguity, passion for cross-functional collaboration in Triad, and an empathetic approach to mentoring junior PMs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER YOU&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid Work Model&lt;/strong&gt; (Paris or Lille base) 2 days of remote work per week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tailored Equipment&lt;/strong&gt; (Mac or Windows, according to mission and sustainability commitments);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Exposure&lt;/strong&gt;: Local project team within a global retail and digital network with international career opportunities;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: Internal/external trainings, skill development programs, and conference attendance;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comprehensive Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;: Competitive salary package including employee stock ownership, profit-sharing, and monthly/quarterly performance bonuses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL CONTEXT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What if technology allowed us to push the boundaries and take sports experiences to new levels? That&#39;s exactly our goal at Decathlon Digital! We are a team of 5,000+ experts in software engineering, product management, data, cloud, and cybersecurity, distributed across Paris, Lille, and Amsterdam. Together, we are creating the largest digital sports platform, leveraging tech innovation from design to value chain optimization, connected experiences and product second life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changing the game for good&lt;/strong&gt;. We are in this for the love of sports. And like everything we love, we want it to last. That’s why we are embarking on a journey to create a more sustainable tech model, reducing our direct environmental impact while maintaining a safe, diverse, and inclusive space for all our people to learn and thrive together. Team up with us to design the digital future of sports.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CSQ128R8&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Forward Deployed Engineer (FDE) you will work with customers to build and productionize solutions to their data &amp;amp; AI challenges using the Databricks platform. You will own the architecture, lead design decisions, and implement end-to-end systems spanning data engineering, AI, and application development. We work cross-functionally to shape long-term strategic priorities and initiatives alongside engineering, product, and developer relations. FDEs deliver with customer empathy, integrating with client systems, training, and other technical needs to help customers get most value out of their data.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on, customer-facing role for builders who thrive at the intersection of technology and business impact. The ideal candidate combines engineering expertise with adaptability, curiosity, and a passion for working with customers and teammates to solve complex problems that drive measurable outcomes. FDEs are billable and know how to complete projects according to specification with exceptional customer empathy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Production Solution Delivery: Lead impactful customer technical projects by delivering production-grade systems, designing and building reference architectures, custom applications and data ingestion and ML/AI model integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transformational Impact: Guide strategic customers as they implement transformational big data projects including end-to-end design, build and deployment of industry-leading big data and AI applications. Work with engagement managers to scope technical delivery work with input from the customer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Empower Customers: Guide customers on architecture and design; bootstrap or implement customer projects which leads to a customers&#39; successful understanding, evaluation and adoption of Databricks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the Architecture: Lead architecture and design decisions, ensuring solutions are secure, scalable, and aligned with both customer needs and Databricks best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the Databricks technical team, Project Manager, Architect and Customer team to ensure the technical components of the engagement are delivered to meet customer&#39;s needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Engineering and Databricks Customer Support to provide product and implementation feedback and to guide rapid resolution for engagement specific product and support issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer Immersion: Embed with customer teams, engaging with stakeholders from technical ICs to executives to deeply understand challenges and deliver impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reusable Assets &amp;amp; Scale: Contribute accelerators, frameworks, and best practices that scale impact across accounts and influence the Databricks product roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What we look for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years experience in data engineering, data platforms &amp;amp; analytics, or software engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable writing code in either Python, Scala, JavaScript/TypeScript, and modern frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of two or more common Cloud ecosystems (AWS, Azure, GCP) with expertise in at least one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience with distributed computing with Apache Spark™ and knowledge of Spark runtime internals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CI/CD for production deployments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of MLOps, ML/AI models and AI APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and deployment of performant production end-to-end data architectures and applications that combine data pipelines, ML/AI models, and user-facing interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with technical project delivery - managing scope, timelines and measurable outcomes, translating complex concepts into actionable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Documentation and white-boarding skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with enterprise clients and managing conflicts across a broad stakeholder range&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build skills in technical areas, and demonstrate curiosity, adaptability, and eagerness to explore new technologies which support the deployment and integration of Databricks-based solutions to complete customer projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel to customers 20% of the time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Databricks Certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Unframe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Unframe is an AI-first startup helping the world’s largest enterprises bring LLM-powered applications to life in days - not months. We combine the speed of a product company with the flexibility of a consultancy, helping customers move from idea to deployed AI systems faster than anyone else in the market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Backed by Bessemer, Craft, and TLV Partners with $100M in Series B funding, we’re building a fast-growing, revenue-generating company working with Fortune 500 customers globally&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits on the front line: you engage directly with enterprise clients, lead discovery to uncover core business challenges, and design and ship tailored AI solutions built on Unframe&#39;s platform. You own the work end-to-end, serving as the strategic and technical bridge from initial conversation through to final deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a true builder role. You write the precise specifications and prompt architectures that bring solutions to life, making the critical design decisions that determine whether an enterprise AI deployment actually succeeds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a project-led role with unmediated access to clients at every stage. You will typically manage several engagements simultaneously, with short planning horizons and evolving requirements. Roughly 30 to 40 percent of the role is active client management, ensuring senior stakeholders remain aligned through delivery, progress reviews, and post-deployment rollouts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Enterprise Discovery: &lt;/strong&gt;Conduct discovery sessions directly with enterprise clients to map workflows, uncover business challenges, and distinguish surface-level requests from fundamental operational needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design &amp;amp; Spec AI Solutions: &lt;/strong&gt;Translate customer problems into structured solution plans on Unframe&#39;s platform. Write detailed specs and define prompt and context structures, owning the complete solution design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive End-to-End Delivery: &lt;/strong&gt;Collaborate with engineers and AI specialists to deliver solutions on target. Prioritize requirements and manage tradeoffs across speed, stability, and scope.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Represent the User &amp;amp; Platform: &lt;/strong&gt;Act as the voice of enterprise operators and domain experts while collaborating with the Platform team to identify reusable product patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in product management or technical delivery roles, with a proven track record working alongside engineering teams on complex, fast-paced technical products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Bilingual Fluency (English &amp;amp; French):&lt;/strong&gt; Fluent in French to connect with users and stakeholders in France, and fluent in English for daily collaboration across our international teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer-Led Discovery: &lt;/strong&gt;Proven experience personally leading consultative conversations with enterprise buyers and operators - not supporting a sales call, not interviewing platform users, but owning the conversation to surface unstated needs and translate them into clear solution scope.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Stakeholder Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Ability to manage senior client relationships through a complex delivery; keeping stakeholders aligned, navigating competing priorities, and being the primary point of contact when requirements shift or timelines compress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem-to-Solution Design: &lt;/strong&gt;Ability to start from a raw business problem without existing features for reference, defining exactly how an AI solution should function and writing precise specs for build teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Complex Delivery Execution: &lt;/strong&gt;Experience shipping AI-powered features under tight timelines, managing evolving requirements, and documenting strategic tradeoffs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Solutions Experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Direct exposure to building with LLMs - writing prompt structures, defining context and output constraints, working with agentic systems, or managing model uncertainty in a shipped product or working prototype. This is the dimension most learnable on the job; concrete work product carries more weight than certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Builder Orientation: &lt;/strong&gt;Driven by creating customer-facing solutions rather than simply managing traditional roadmaps or processing requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Competencies: &lt;/strong&gt;Strong written communication, systems thinking, high attention to detail, fluent English (written and verbal), and the ability to navigate multi-faceted projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Remote (France):&lt;/strong&gt; This position is 100% remote within France.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Why join us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;At Unframe, you’ll help build AI systems that are already delivering real value to global enterprises - not prototypes, demos, or side projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;You’ll work with exceptional teammates, collaborate directly with top-tier customers, and have real influence over both the solutions we ship and the evolution of our platform. This is a hands-on, high-impact role where product thinking, technical depth, and creativity come together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;If you enjoy solving hard problems, moving fast, and building practical AI products that actually make it to production - we’d love to meet you.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Software Engineering Intern - Fullstack (x/f/m)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set a new pulse for healthcare!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Software Engineering Intern&lt;/strong&gt; to join the &lt;strong&gt;Engineering&lt;/strong&gt; team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your mission will be to build innovative products and features that improve the daily lives of care teams and patients. You will work in a feature team developing solutions that directly impact healthcare professionals and patients across Europe, contributing to our Operating System powered by AI to manage all clinical and administrative activities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working in the tech team at Doctolib means building innovative products and features to improve the daily lives of care teams and patients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your responsibilities include but are not limited to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and own features alongside experienced engineers — from design and development to testing and shipping — with a direct impact on real users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineers, product managers, and designers to solve complex technical challenges and build scalable, secure, and user-friendly healthcare tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clean, efficient code following industry best practices in design, testing, and peer review&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve real-world problems that directly enhance patient care and improve doctor-patient relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore new tools and technologies, including AI and distributed systems, as part of your continuous growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to a culture of learning and collaboration by sharing knowledge and engaging actively with your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Before you read on: if you don&#39;t have the exact profile described below, but you feel this job description matches your skill set, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll be a great fit if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You love problem-solving and are driven by curiosity — you&#39;re not afraid to dive into complex issues and find creative solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in a collaborative environment and enjoy working with cross-functional teams, sharing knowledge, and learning from your peers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a passion for technology and product development, and always keep the user experience in mind&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable coding, with the help of AI agents like Claude Code, in multiple languages and eager to learn our tech stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are in your final year of a degree in Software Engineering, Computer Science, or a related field and looking for a 6-month full-time internship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eager to learn and work in a team of builders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are fluent in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;It would be fantastic if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience with web development or building products in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have worked on side projects or contributed to open-source communities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are familiar with AI-assisted coding tools and eager to integrate them into your daily workflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Doctolib Tech&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our solutions are built on a single fully cloud-native platform that supports web and mobile app interfaces, multiple languages, and is adapted to country and healthcare specialty requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our stack is composed of Rails, TypeScript, Java, Python, Kotlin, Swift, and React Native.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We leverage AI ethically across our products to empower patients and health professionals. Discover our AI vision &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/ai-careers/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Want to learn more about our tech culture and environment? Visit the&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/tech-doctolib/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Doctolib Tech site&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tech masterclasses throughout the internship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free breakfast at the office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to the best AI tools for coding and development, along with dedicated training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discounted membership to Urban Sports Club&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meal vouchers worth €8.50 per day, with €4.50 covered by Doctolib&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;50% reimbursement of public transportation subscriptions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive health insurance, fully covered by Doctolib for employees and their children under the basic plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free mental health and personalised coaching programme with our partner, &lt;a href=&quot;http://moka.care/&quot;&gt;Moka.care&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A comprehensive three-month onboarding programme, including Doctolib Academy and various training courses in languages, soft skills, and technical skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A works council subsidy providing partial reimbursement for sports or leisure activity memberships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For employees with disabilities or caregiving responsibilities, a support package including adapted remote-working arrangements, paid authorised leave for medical appointments, and enhanced psychological support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our interview process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coding Game (1h)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruiter Interview (30 minutes)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feature Building Interview (1h)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Behavioral Interview (1h)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internship (6 months)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paris (Levallois)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid work setup (up to 2 remote days per week)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Start date: March 2027&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We welcome everyone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Doctolib, we are committed to improving access to healthcare for everyone. This translates into our recruitment process. We evaluate candidates based solely on qualifications and motivation, without any form of discrimination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The more diverse ideas are heard, the more our product will truly improve healthcare for all. You are welcome to apply to Doctolib, regardless of your gender, religion, age, sexual orientation, ethnicity, or disability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To ensure equal opportunities, we invite you to exclude personal information (e.g., pictures, age) from your applications. If you require any accommodation, please let us know for support during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us in building the healthcare we all dream of!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your data privacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All information provided is processed by Doctolib for application management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For data processing details, click here:&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-DE&quot;&gt; Germany&lt;/a&gt; |&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-FR&quot;&gt; France&lt;/a&gt; |&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-IT&quot;&gt; Italy&lt;/a&gt; |&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-COM&quot;&gt; Netherlands&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please contact hr.dataprivacy(at)doctolib.com for inquiries or to exercise your rights.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-xl s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Your Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Senior Data Engineer into our engineering &lt;/strong&gt;team at Doctolib.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Your mission will be to build data products that provide insights and support decision-making across Doctolib, helping to transform access to healthcare. You will work in a feature team developing data pipelines and solutions that empower our organization with data-driven insights while supporting our AI strategy, enabling health professionals to deliver better care and helping millions of patients access quality healthcare.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Working in the tech team at Doctolib means building innovative products and features to improve the daily lives of care teams and patients.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-xl s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities include but are not limited to:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;s-list-disc s-pb-2 s-pl-6 s-flex s-flex-col s-gap-1 s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Build and maintain data pipelines using Python (Dagster) to support Doctolib&#39;s AI strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain data marts in BigQuery using SQL/Jinja, DBT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Create dashboards for high-level reporting using Tableau&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Collaborate with stakeholders to understand their data needs and define specifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Ensure data quality, security (GDPR compliance), and availability through monitoring and optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-xl s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Before you read on: if you don&#39;t have the exact profile described below, but you feel this job description matches your skill set, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll be a great fit if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;s-list-disc s-pb-2 s-pl-6 s-flex s-flex-col s-gap-1 s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have at least 7+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of experience as a Data Engineer, or a similar role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You have a first experience using code assistant (Claude, Cursor)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You are proficient in Python, SQL, and DBT for building data pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You have experience with BI tools such as Tableau, Metabase, or similar platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You have first experience with Google Cloud Platform (GCP) stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You have a good understanding of functional aspects of data (Sales, Finance, Web Analytics, Product)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You have strong communication skills and can collaborate effectively with business teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You are fluent in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;It would be fantastic if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;s-list-disc s-pb-2 s-pl-6 s-flex s-flex-col s-gap-1 s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Have experience with AI products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Have experience with Vertex AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Are familiar with GDPR regulations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-xl s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Life at Doctolib Tech&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;s-list-disc s-pb-2 s-pl-6 s-flex s-flex-col s-gap-1 s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Our solutions are built on a single fully cloud-native platform that supports web and mobile app interfaces, multiple languages, and is adapted to country and healthcare specialty requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Our stack is composed of Rails, TypeScript, Java, Python, Kotlin, Swift, and React Native.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;We leverage AI ethically across our products to empower patients and health professionals. Discover our AI vision&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;s-break-all s-font-semibold s-transition-all s-duration-200 s-ease-in-out hover:s-underline s-text-highlight dark:s-text-highlight-night hover:s-text-highlight-400 dark:hover:s-text-highlight-400-night active:s-text-highlight-dark dark:active:s-text-highlight-dark-night&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/ai-careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Want to learn more about our tech culture and environment? Visit the&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;s-break-all s-font-semibold s-transition-all s-duration-200 s-ease-in-out hover:s-underline s-text-highlight dark:s-text-highlight-night hover:s-text-highlight-400 dark:hover:s-text-highlight-400-night active:s-text-highlight-dark dark:active:s-text-highlight-dark-night&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/tech-doctolib/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Doctolib Tech site&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-xl s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;s-list-disc s-pb-2 s-pl-6 s-flex s-flex-col s-gap-1 s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Free comprehensive health insurance (basic package) for you and your children&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;25 days of paid vacation per year, plus up to 14 days of RTT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Free mental health and coaching services through our partner Moka.care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Work from abroad for up to 10 days per year thanks to our flexibility days policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Lunch vouchers (Swile card) worth €8.50 per working day, with €4.50 covered by Doctolib&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;A subsidy from the work council to refund part of the membership to a sport club or a creative class&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;50% reimbursement of your public transport subscription&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Parent Care Program: receive one additional month of leave on top of the legal parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Enrollment in Doctolib&#39;s long-term employee value sharing plan called DoctoGrowth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;For caregivers and workers with disabilities, a package including an adaptation of the remote policy, extra days off for medical reasons, and psychological support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Relocation support in case of international mobility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Access to the best AI tools for coding, development and dedicated training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-xl s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Our interview process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;s-list-disc s-pb-2 s-pl-6 s-flex s-flex-col s-gap-1 s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Recruiter Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Coding Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;System Design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Behavioral interview &amp;amp;&amp;nbsp;Meeting with the team at the office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;At least one reference check&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;We want your experience to be clear, respectful, and transparent. Learn more about our hiring process on our &lt;a class=&quot;s-break-all s-font-semibold s-transition-all s-duration-200 s-ease-in-out hover:s-underline s-text-highlight dark:s-text-highlight-night hover:s-text-highlight-400 dark:hover:s-text-highlight-400-night active:s-text-highlight-dark dark:active:s-text-highlight-dark-night&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/tech-doctolib/getting-hired/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;candidate experience page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-xl s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Job details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;s-list-disc s-pb-2 s-pl-6 s-flex s-flex-col s-gap-1 s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Permanent position&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Tech stack: Python, SQL, DBT, BigQuery, Tableau, Dagster&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Full-time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Paris&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Hybrid work setup (up to 2 remote days per week)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Start date: as soon as possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-xl s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;We welcome everyone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;At Doctolib, we are committed to improving access to healthcare for everyone. This translates into our recruitment process. We evaluate candidates based solely on qualifications and motivation, without any form of discrimination.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;The more diverse ideas are heard, the more our product will truly improve healthcare for all. You are welcome to apply to Doctolib, regardless of your gender, religion, age, sexual orientation, ethnicity, or disability.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;To ensure equal opportunities, we invite you to exclude personal information (e.g., pictures, age) from your applications. If you require any accommodation, please let us know for support during the hiring process.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Join us in building the healthcare we all dream of!&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-xl s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Your data privacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;All information provided is processed by Doctolib for application management. For data processing details, click here:&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;s-break-all s-font-semibold s-transition-all s-duration-200 s-ease-in-out hover:s-underline s-text-highlight dark:s-text-highlight-night hover:s-text-highlight-400 dark:hover:s-text-highlight-400-night active:s-text-highlight-dark dark:active:s-text-highlight-dark-night&quot; href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-DE&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Germany&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;em&gt;l&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;s-break-all s-font-semibold s-transition-all s-duration-200 s-ease-in-out hover:s-underline s-text-highlight dark:s-text-highlight-night hover:s-text-highlight-400 dark:hover:s-text-highlight-400-night active:s-text-highlight-dark dark:active:s-text-highlight-dark-night&quot; href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-FR&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;France&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;em&gt;l&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;s-break-all s-font-semibold s-transition-all s-duration-200 s-ease-in-out hover:s-underline s-text-highlight dark:s-text-highlight-night hover:s-text-highlight-400 dark:hover:s-text-highlight-400-night active:s-text-highlight-dark dark:active:s-text-highlight-dark-night&quot; href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-IT&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Italy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;em&gt;l&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;s-break-all s-font-semibold s-transition-all s-duration-200 s-ease-in-out hover:s-underline s-text-highlight dark:s-text-highlight-night hover:s-text-highlight-400 dark:hover:s-text-highlight-400-night active:s-text-highlight-dark dark:active:s-text-highlight-dark-night&quot; href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-COM&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Netherlands&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;. Please contact hr.dataprivacy(at)doctolib.com for inquiries or to exercise your rights.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Join a team of passionate and committed people working to improve healthcare.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Doctolib, our tech teams build products and features that improve the daily lives of healthcare professionals and patients. We work in feature teams within an agile environment, in close collaboration with Product, Design, Data Science, and Business teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an &lt;strong&gt;AI Engineer Intern&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Tech team and contribute to the development of AI-powered features at Doctolib.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work closely with experienced AI and software engineers to explore, prototype, evaluate, and improve AI-based solutions. This internship will give you the opportunity to gain practical experience across the different stages of an AI product, from experimentation to integration into a production environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the development of AI features and services under the guidance of experienced engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write Python code to support prototypes, experiments, evaluation tools, and backend components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiment with large language models, prompting techniques, retrieval, and tool integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to automated tests and documentation for the components you develop&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate issues, analyse results, and suggest improvements to your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in code reviews, technical discussions, and team rituals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will receive regular guidance from your mentor and teammates. The scope of your work will grow progressively as you become familiar with the codebase, the tools, and the technical challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Before you read on, if you do not have the exact profile described below but feel that this internship matches your skills and interests, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be a great fit if you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are in the final year of a degree in Computer Science, Artificial Intelligence, Software Engineering, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have basic experience with Python through coursework, personal projects, research, or previous internships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a basic understanding of programming concepts, data structures, and software development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are curious about artificial intelligence and interested in understanding how AI systems work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable communicating in English, both written and spoken&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It would be fantastic if you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have worked on a project involving machine learning, natural language processing, or large language models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have used agentic frameworks like Langchain or Google ADK.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experimented with AI APIs, prompting, retrieval, or conversational interfaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience in taking products to production and supporting them with real users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have some experience with Git, APIs, testing, or data analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have an interest in healthcare, privacy, or responsible AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Doctolib Tech&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our products are built on a cloud-native platform that supports web and mobile applications across several countries and healthcare systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Even if Doctolib uses technologies like Ruby on Rails, TypeScript, Java, Kotlin, Swift, React Native, and many cloud-related technologies, the principal language you&#39;ll work on is Python.You will also have the opportunity to use AI-assisted development tools within our engineering practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Discover our AI vision&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/ai-careers/&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt; and learn more about our tech culture on the&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/tech-doctolib/&quot;&gt; Doctolib Tech site&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A structured internship with dedicated mentoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to work on real AI projects in a healthcare environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical learning sessions and access to internal engineering communities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to AI tools for coding, development, and learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meal vouchers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free breakfast in the office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 2 days of remote work per week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A flexible workplace policy, depending on the team and location&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative and international working environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The interview process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coding Game&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruiter Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Behavioral Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internship, 6 months, full-time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: Berlin, Paris, Nantes, Milan, or Amsterdam&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid work setup, up to 2 remote days per week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Start date: March 2027&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We welcome everyone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Doctolib, we are committed to improving access to healthcare for everyone. We evaluate candidates based on their qualifications, motivation, and potential, without discrimination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The more diverse ideas are heard, the better our products can serve patients and healthcare professionals. We welcome applications regardless of gender, religion, age, sexual orientation, ethnicity, disability, or place of origin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To support an inclusive recruitment process, we invite you to leave personal information such as pictures and age off your application. If you require an accommodation during the interview process, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us in building the healthcare we all dream of!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your data privacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All information provided through this application is processed by Doctolib for recruitment purposes. For more information about how Doctolib processes your application data, please consult the relevant privacy policy:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-DE&quot;&gt;Germany&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-FR&quot;&gt;France&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-IT&quot;&gt;Italy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-COM&quot;&gt;The Netherlands&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For questions or to exercise your rights, please contact hr.dataprivacy(at)&lt;a href=&quot;http://doctolib.com/&quot;&gt;doctolib.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div data-page-number=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;react-pdf__Page shadow-md&quot; data-page-number=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;react-pdf__Page__textContent textLayer selecting&quot; data-main-rotation=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vos missions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;react-pdf__Page__annotations annotationLayer&quot; data-main-rotation=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;Notre équipe Finance SSC (Shared Service Center) réinvente la comptabilité chez Doctolib. Là où la plupart des entreprises commencent à peine à mentionner l&#39;IA dans leurs fiches de poste comptables, nous l&#39;intégrons déjà au cœur de nos processus. Nous sommes en avance sur le marché — et nous assumons cette ambition.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Nous recherchons un(e) General Accountant Lead &amp;amp; Analyst pour rejoindre l&#39;équipe General Ledger (GL). Ce rôle est bien plus qu&#39;un poste de comptable senior : vous couvrirez l&#39;intégralité des flux d&#39;activités courantes (cycles fournisseurs, clients, immobilisations), avec un fort degré de reporting transverse en clôture, tout en portant un œil critique de contrôle de gestion sur les opérations. Vous serez à la fois garant(e) de la qualité des comptes, pilote de la transformation IA de l&#39;équipe et business partner pour les directions Finance et opérationnelles.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Si vous cherchez un poste où la comptabilité rime avec impact stratégique, transformation digitale et leadership — ce rôle est fait pour vous.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vos responsabilités incluent, mais ne sont pas limitées à :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Piloter l&#39;ensemble des cycles comptables courants (fournisseurs, clients, immobilisations, charges) et garantir leur fiabilité à l&#39;échelle du groupe, en intégrant systématiquement une revue analytique de type contrôle de gestion (Réel vs Budget/N-1, détection d&#39;anomalies, anticipation des impacts P&amp;amp;L)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Orchestrer les processus de clôture de bout en bout dans une posture de « tour de contrôle » : coordination inter-équipes, reporting transverse, allocation analytique des coûts, contrôle interne et documentation SOX intégrés au quotidien&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Identifier et piloter des projets de transformation digitale et IA (agents Dust, solutions R2R, RPA) et construire des livrables autoportés (dashboards self-service, KPIs dynamiques) pour réduire les sollicitations ad hoc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Standardiser les pratiques comptables groupe et contribuer au « kit d&#39;intégration comptable » pour accompagner l&#39;internationalisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Incarner la posture de business partner en traduisant les enjeux comptables en langage business et en assurant une veille réglementaire active&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Les qualités attendues pour ce poste&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Avant de poursuivre votre lecture, si vous n&#39;avez pas le profil exact décrit ci-dessous, mais que vous pensez que cette description de poste correspond à vos compétences et à vos aspirations, nous vous encourageons tout de même à postuler.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vous pourrez être le/la prochain(e) membre de notre équipe si vous :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Disposez d&#39;une formation supérieure en Comptabilité/Finance (DSCG, Master CCA, Grande École, DEC en cours ou obtenu)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Justifiez de 8 à 10 ans d&#39;expérience en comptabilité générale et/ou audit, dont au moins 3 ans en position de management ou de leadership technique&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Avez une expérience significative en Big 4 (Manager/Senior Manager) et/ou en entreprise internationale en forte croissance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Maîtrisez les normes IFRS (dont IFRS 16, 15) et French GAAP, et avez une expérience approfondie des environnements SOX&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Faites preuve d&#39;un esprit analytique fort et d&#39;une capacité à intégrer une démarche de contrôle de gestion dans votre pratique comptable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Êtes à l&#39;aise avec les ERP modernes et maîtrisez Excel/Google Sheets à un niveau avancé&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Parlez anglais couramment (C1/C2) — échanges quotidiens avec les équipes internationales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Êtes un(e) leader naturel(le), capable de fédérer, mentorer et conduire le changement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ce serait fantastique si vous aviez aussi :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Une expérience dans le secteur Tech/SaaS et/ou en environnement multi-pays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Une connaissance de SAP et/ou Coupa&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Une familiarité avec les outils BI (Looker, Tableau) et les solutions de close management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Une expérience démontrée avec des outils d&#39;IA appliqués à la comptabilité (agents IA, RPA, OCR intelligent, modèles prédictifs) ou une forte appétence pour ces sujets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Une compréhension des mécanismes de consolidation et des enjeux de corporate finance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Notre offre&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Une mutuelle avantageuse prise en charge à 100 % par Doctolib (régime de base) pour les employés et leurs enfants&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;25 jours de congés payés et jusqu&#39;à 14 jours de RTT par an&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Un programme de santé mentale et de coaching personnalisé gratuit avec notre partenaire Moka.care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Un programme d&#39;intégration complet de 3 mois incluant la Doctolib Academy et diverses formations (langues, soft skills, compétences techniques)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Un accès aux meilleurs outils IA et des formations dédiées&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Un mois de congé supplémentaire au congé parental légal grâce au programme « Parent Care »&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;10 jours par an de télétravail à l&#39;étranger possible (UE et UK)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adhésion au plan de partage de la valeur de Doctolib, appelé DoctoGrowth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Des tickets restaurant d&#39;une valeur de 8,50 € par jour, dont 4,50 € pris en charge par Doctolib&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Un remboursement à 50 % de l&#39;abonnement aux transports en commun&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Pour les salariés en situation de handicap ou proches aidants, un package comprenant une adaptation du télétravail, des jours d&#39;absence autorisée payés pour les rendez-vous médicaux et un soutien psychologique renforcé&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Le processus de recrutement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Premier entretien avec l&#39;équipe recrutement (30 min)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Entretien opérationnel avec le Directeur Comptable (1h)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Cas pratique technique (1h)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Entretien final avec un membre du leadership Finance (45 min)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Au minimum une prise de référence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Détails du poste&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;CDI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Temps plein&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Lieu de travail : Levallois-Perret&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Prise de poste : dès que possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Rémunération : fixe + variable sur objectifs (selon profil)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Ce poste est éligible au télétravail partiel (2 jours/semaine)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p4&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Chez Doctolib, nous sommes convaincus que nous devons améliorer la santé pour tout le monde. Cela se reflète dans notre processus de recrutement. Nous évaluons les candidatures uniquement sur la base des qualifications et de la motivation, sans aucune forme de discrimination.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Plus les idées sont diverses, plus notre produit améliorera véritablement la santé pour tout le monde. Vous pouvez postuler chez Doctolib, quel que soit votre genre, religion, âge, orientation sexuelle, origine ethnique ou handicap.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Afin de garantir l&#39;égalité des chances, nous vous invitons à exclure les informations personnelles (par exemple : photos, âge) de vos candidatures. Si vous avez besoin d&#39;aménagements particuliers, merci de nous en informer pour que nous puissions adapter le processus de recrutement. Rejoignez-nous pour construire la santé dont nous rêvons tous !&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Toutes les informations fournies sont traitées par Doctolib pour la gestion des candidatures. Pour plus de détails sur le traitement des données, cliquez ici. Veuillez contacter hr.dataprivacy(at)doctolib.com pour toute question ou pour exercer vos droits.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;We’re on a mission to become the go-to destination for students across Europe to find a trusted home away from home. We make every step of the rental journey simple and seamless, so students can focus on what really matters: studying, exploring, and growing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With HousingAnywhere, Kamernet, and Studapart under our roof, we’re Europe’s largest student rental platform. You’ll find us in Rotterdam, Paris, and Cergy, always guided by our four core values: Ownership, We are enablers, We are changemakers, and We are connectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To support our continued growth, we are creating a new, strategic role at the heart of operational performance and customer experience. There is no Quality &amp;amp; Training activity in the Group today : you will build it from the ground up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Quality &amp;amp; Training Manager, you will create and lead the Quality &amp;amp; Training activity for the whole HousingAnywhere Group, covering the Operations teams in Cergy and Rotterdam. You define its scope, methods and tools, and you are responsible for service quality and operational practices across the Group.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You work closely with the managers of the Customer Support and Booking Ops teams to structure training, onboarding, quality monitoring and performance tooling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role is based in France, with frequent travel to our Rotterdam office. English is the main working language.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Building the Quality &amp;amp; Training activity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design the Quality &amp;amp; Training activity : scope, operating model, priorities and roadmap,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up the tools, rituals and governance needed to run the activity at Group level,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Harmonise quality and training practices between the Cergy and Rotterdam teams,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lay the foundations for the activity to grow as needs evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Training &amp;amp; onboarding&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify the training needs of the Ops teams, and accompany the integration process while migrating to a single operating model in 2027,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop complete training programmes covering customer service posture, tools, and day-to-day processes and procedures,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain training materials (scripts, practical guides, process sheets, e-learning content), working with the other departments like Product for new features,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run a structured onboarding and support new joiners in live situations after initial training, to bridge theory and practice,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry out an individual assessment at the end of onboarding (audits, call listening, double listening, tests) and provide personalised follow-up,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead group and one-to-one sessions, on-the-spot debriefs and targeted coaching on the fundamentals: call handling, request qualification, rephrasing, quality of written and spoken answers, and CRM data entry,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Train teams on new procedures and tool changes as they are rolled out.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality &amp;amp; operational performance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and roll out quality standards and control frameworks for each team, across the full user journey,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build structured quality reporting by individual, team and business unit, with a monthly report to managers,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse interactions, indicators and recurring errors to identify root causes and drive continuous improvement plans,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the Ops Project Manager to maintain the knowledge base,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a culture of knowledge sharing and self-learning (e-learning) to reduce reliance on informal mentoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to Voice of Customer and customer satisfaction projects by sharing pain points identified through quality monitoring,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Propose initiatives to align operational practices with company strategy and the user experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise and support managers on using tools and analysing performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in training, quality management or quality monitoring of customer service or operations teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building a quality or training activity from scratch, or a strong drive to do so,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience setting up a quality monitoring programme (call listening, audits, calibration),&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid knowledge of customer service best practices and operational process management,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to analyse spoken and written interactions and turn them into concrete recommendations,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Teaching skills, structure and a results focus, with the ability to convince and motivate teams,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with CRM and telephony tools, e-learning content creation and performance dashboards,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English and French are required. English is the main working language,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel frequently to Rotterdam.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why this opportunity?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A newly created role: you build the Group&#39;s Quality &amp;amp; Training activity from the ground up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Group-wide impact across our teams in Cergy and Rotterdam.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high level of autonomy to design tools, processes and training materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An international environment, working between France and the Netherlands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A role combining training, quality and operations, both strategic and hands-on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position based in our Cergy office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive status with 218 workdays/year (with RTT days off).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;50% transport costs covered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;70% health insurance coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meal vouchers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribution to fitness membership costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Christmas gift vouchers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team-building events and much more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Read more about our France-based teams &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.welcometothejungle.com/en/companies/studapart&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;🧡 &lt;strong&gt;About Alma&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;At Alma, we believe sustainable commerce depends on fair, well-balanced trade. Because finance plays a pivotal role in business, our mission is to put it back in its rightful place - serving merchants and consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Our installment and deferred payment solutions help merchants boost sales by 20% or more, increase customer loyalty, and deliver a seamless shopping experience - without encouraging bad debt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;As the buy now pay later leader in France and active in 10 European countries, we&#39;ve empowered over +25,000 merchants and 10 million consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;With 380+ Almakers and €100M+ ARR, Alma is scaling rapidly across Europe as a member of the Next40, and we&#39;re just getting started!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;👐 &lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;We are hiring for different squads. We will direct you to a specific team depending on your interests and skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;This position is a permanent contract (CDI) based in Paris or remote from France.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;💼 &lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the payment infrastructure of tomorrow&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Design and develop the APIs and backend components that power payments for thousands of merchants and millions of consumers across Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raise the bar on quality, security &amp;amp; performance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Write maintainable, production-grade code that meets the highest standards of a regulated company processing billions of euros.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape our technical architecture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Collaborate closely with Product and other tech leaders to evolve our architecture in line with growing business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own reliability end-to-end&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Lead incident response and performance troubleshooting, driving long-term improvements to ensure our platform stays resilient at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;🧰 &lt;strong&gt;You will work with&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Python, Docker, React, GCP, Kubernetes, PostgreSQL, Redis, Pub/Sub, Datadog&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;🧩 &lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To succeed in this job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8+ years of experience&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;in backend engineering on large-scale systems (excluding internships and apprenticeships)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Strong proficiency in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;relational databases&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;— we&#39;re open to other backend languages, but Python is our core stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluency in French&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;with a solid level of English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Methodical, with strong communication and problem-solving skills; at ease working in a cross-functional environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And it will be nice if you also&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Have experience building&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;payment or financial solutions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Have a track record of&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;influencing product and technical decisions&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Hold a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;in Computer Science or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Don&#39;t meet every single requirement? At Alma, we believe great hires come from diverse paths. If this role excites you, we encourage you to apply. We value potential, curiosity and the ability to grow as much as experience.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;🧘 &lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;If you join, you will be able to grow and impact on:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real-world scale&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;— your code will directly power payments for millions of consumers and tens of thousands of merchants across Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;— you&#39;ll have genuine influence over architecture decisions, not just implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A regulated, fast-moving environment&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;— you&#39;ll tackle the unique challenges of building robust, secure fintech infrastructure in a company that&#39;s still moving fast.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;🤑 &lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive salary&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;based on 12 months&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profit-sharing and employee savings plan&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health insurance&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;100%&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;covered by Alma including family package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disability insurance&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;100%&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;covered by Alma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sport&lt;/strong&gt;: partnerships with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Gymlib&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Classpass&lt;/strong&gt;, or&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;€30/month&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;reimbursement for your sports activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maternity/paternity leave&lt;/strong&gt;: salary maintained at 100% during leave with no seniority requirement. Return to work at 4/5 schedule paid at 100% for 8 weeks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sustainable Mobility Package (FMD)&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;€544.80/year&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;(excluding full-remote contracts)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Meal vouchers&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;€10/day&lt;/strong&gt;, 50% covered by Alma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mental health:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;free access to MindDay platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid time off&lt;/strong&gt;: 25 days/year (+ additional paid leave granted for employees on executive contracts)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Access to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development Platform&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2 weeks of full remote possible&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;per year in summer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;🎯 &lt;strong&gt;Interview Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Video call with a Talent Acquisition team member&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to understand your path, motivation &amp;amp; present you the role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Video call with your future manager&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to deep dive the role, the team, your profile and answer all your questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Take-home coding test&lt;/strong&gt;, followed by a remote feedback session.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Live system design interview&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to assess your practical and architectural knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A coffee chat with the squad you’ll join&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to further assess your skills and team fit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;More information on the hiring process can be found in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://almapay.notion.site/Engineering-Interview-Process-Guide-cfd1c681d3234a4bacb5914b6122d2e9&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interview Guide&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;🌍 &lt;strong&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Alma, we believe that diversity fuels innovation and makes our community stronger. We are committed to building a workplace where every person feels seen, respected, and empowered to do their best work whatever their gender, background, ethnicity, age, sexual orientation, religion, disability or lived experience. As an equal opportunity employer, we welcome applicants from all walks of life, and all employment decisions are made based on qualifications, merit, and business needs.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🧡 About Alma&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Alma, we believe sustainable commerce depends on fair, well‑balanced trade. Because finance plays a pivotal role in business, our mission is to put it back in its rightful place - serving merchants and consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our installment and deferred payment solutions help merchants boost sales by 20% or more, increase customer loyalty, and deliver a seamless shopping experience - without encouraging bad debt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the buy now pay later leader in France and active in 10 European countries, we&#39;ve empowered over +25,000 merchants and 10 million consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With 380+ Almakers and €100M+ ARR, Alma is scaling rapidly across Europe as a member of the Next40, and we&#39;re just getting started!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👐 About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Alma, we work with best‑in‑class partners to expand our addressable market, accelerate growth, and strengthen our value proposition. &lt;strong&gt;Partnerships&lt;/strong&gt; are a key lever in building competitive advantages that support Alma’s ambition to become the European market leader.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our &lt;strong&gt;Strategic Partnerships Managers&lt;/strong&gt; play a pivotal, partner‑facing role. You will also manage and expand top‑tier partnerships (financial technology firms, e‑commerce platforms, point‑of‑sale solutions) and drive business opportunities in a fast‑moving environment. Acting as the central point of contact, you will influence internal and external stakeholders, expand Alma’s reach, and create value for Alma, our partners, and our merchants.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Reporting to the Strategic Partnerships Manager Lead, you will work closely with the Sales team, the Onboarding team, the Retail Training team and the Merchant Support team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This position is a permanent role, based in Paris.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💼 About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;In a nutshell, &lt;strong&gt;your key responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt; will consist in:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and grow a portfolio of strategic partners: build, develop, and nurture long‑term, high‑impact relationships; lead initiatives that create new opportunities and drive revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set strategy and expand scope: manage expansion (new geographies, new use cases/features), optimize existing programs, and define the roadmap for joint projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross‑functional leadership and negotiation: align Product, Sales, Marketing, Legal, Finance, Regulatory, etc. to shape value‑add operating models; build business cases and negotiate/close contracts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;End‑to‑end execution: drive partnership initiatives from idea to validation, launch, and scale; coordinate internal and external stakeholders throughout.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance management: define KPIs/OKRs, monitor results, surface insights, and implement improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner enablement and activation: ensure partners are equipped to market, sell, and support Alma; create playbooks and internal enablement materials; share best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Joint go‑to‑market and growth: design and run partner‑led and partner‑assisted GTM plans, including co‑marketing and co‑selling programs that accelerate commercial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Representation and relationship stewardship: be the single point of contact (SPOC); represent Alma to the partner and the partner within Alma; cultivate a dynamic partner community and long‑term, trusted relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity development: proactively identify, validate, and secure new opportunities with existing partners.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🧰 You will work with&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salesforce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gong&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aircall&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dust&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SalesNavigator&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🧩 About you&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To succeed in this job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5/7+ years’ experience in consulting, project/program management, partnerships, complex sales&lt;/strong&gt;, or similar roles in fintech, e‑commerce, or other fast‑paced/high‑growth environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English and French.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial instinct and business acumen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency with data; able to extract insights and deliver compelling partner presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage multiple complex stakeholders and partners in parallel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record leading cross‑functional projects with high attention to detail.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And it will be nice if you also are a&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great communicator and relationship‑builder: excellent written and presentation skills; you craft compelling value propositions and engage stakeholders effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pragmatic and impact‑focused: you prioritize high‑leverage actions and thrive in fast‑paced settings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Problem‑solving and results‑oriented: you own outcomes and deliver on commitments; strong analytical skills and comfort with ambiguity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tech‑curious, a continuous learner, resilient, and adaptable to shifting priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Don&#39;t meet every single requirement? At Alma, we believe great hires come from diverse paths. If this role excites you, we encourage you to apply. We value potential, curiosity and the ability to grow as much as experience.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;🧘 &lt;/span&gt;What&#39;s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join a growing company that&#39;s reshaping how merchants and consumers connect&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High ownership from day one, with real impact on business growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A fast-paced, entrepreneurial environment where your ideas and results matter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The chance to help build a category and be part of something meaningful&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤑 Compensation &amp;amp; benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive salary&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;based on 12 months&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profit-sharing and employee savings plan&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health insurance&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;100%&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;covered by Alma including family package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disability insurance&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;100%&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;covered by Alma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sport&lt;/strong&gt;: partnerships with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Gymlib&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Classpass&lt;/strong&gt;, or&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;€30/month&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;reimbursement for your sports activities&lt;/li&gt;
