&lt;li&gt;Up to 50% staff discount on THG brands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On-site staff shop.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Know someone who would be perfect for THG? Refer them and get up to £1000 when they pass their probation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anniversary gifts when you hit 5 and 10 years of service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THG is proud to be a Disability Confident Committed employer. If you are invited to interview, please let us know if there are any reasonable adjustments we can make to the recruitment process that will enable you to perform to the best of your ability.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THG is committed to creating a diverse &amp;amp; inclusive environment and hence welcomes applications from all sections of the community.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Because of the high volumes of applications our opportunities attract, it sometimes takes us time to review and consider them all. We endeavour to respond to every application we receive within 14 days. If you haven&#39;t heard from us within that time frame or should you have any specific questions about this or other applications for positions at THG please contact one of our &lt;span class=&quot;mark75xs2u5gf&quot; data-markjs=&quot;true&quot; data-ogac=&quot;&quot; data-ogab=&quot;&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsb=&quot;&quot;&gt;Talent&lt;/span&gt; team to discuss further.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Marketing Director&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to: Chief Commercial Officer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;UK, France, Netherlands, Belgium, Germany, Austria, Spain, Finland, USA. Some travel to our offices will be required from time-to-time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You must have the right to work in one the above countries in order to be considered for the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💼 About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PQShield is looking for a Product Marketing Director who can turn complex technology into stories that people understand, remember, and act on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own how PQShield&#39;s products, technology, and vision are positioned, communicated, and brought to market worldwide. You&#39;ll sit at the intersection of product, engineering, sales, customers, and the broader security market — translating breakthrough cryptography and security technology into compelling narratives for executives, engineers, partners, and buyers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is for a strategic product marketer and exceptional storyteller who can identify the market shift, understand the customer problem, and turn complex technology into differentiated positioning that creates urgency, preference and demand.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Since NIST published its first post-quantum cryptography (PQC) standards, which the PQShield team co-authored, organizations across semiconductors, automotive, defense, and enterprise face significant challenges in preparing for the post-quantum transition. This role will help define the market narrative around that transition, position PQShield&#39;s portfolio within it and give customers a clear reason to act.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⚒️ What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the story: Develop the narrative, positioning, messaging, and value propositions that explain what is changing in the market, why customers need to act, the problem PQShield solves, and why our approach is differentiated.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn technical capability into customer value: Work with cryptographers, engineers and product leaders to understand sophisticated technology, identify what matters to the buyer and translate technical capabilities into clear business and security value without sacrificing technical credibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position the portfolio: Own positioning and messaging for our hardware IP and software portfolio, including PQPlatform, PQPerform, PQCryptoLib, and PQMicroLib. Build a clear messaging architecture that connects the portfolio while preserving the differentiated value of each offering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the customer: Develop deep insight into customer problems, buying journeys, security requirements, regulatory pressures, barriers to adoption, buying dynamics, and the forces driving post-quantum adoption. Turn those insights into sharper products, messaging, and go-to-market strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape category and market narrative: Help define how PQShield talks about post-quantum security, cryptographic agility, and the transition to quantum-safe systems — and how we differentiate our approach in a rapidly evolving market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead product launches: Create and execute compelling go-to-market strategies for new products, certifications, partnerships, and major releases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equip the sales team: Build compelling presentations, stories, solution briefs, case studies, battlecards, and other tools that help sales teams communicate value and win complex deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build buyer and segment-specific stories: Develop differentiated narratives for semiconductors, automotive, military and aerospace, industrial IoT, networking, and enterprise, adapting the value story for different buyers, use cases and business priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own competitive storytelling: Understand the competitive landscape and turn technical and commercial differences into clear, credible differentiation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create exceptional content: Lead the development of white papers, thought leadership, application notes, customer stories, executive content, web experiences, and other material that establishes PQShield as a category leader.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring customer stories to life: Find and develop the stories that demonstrate why customers are making the transition to post-quantum security and why they choose PQShield.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across the company: Partner closely with product, engineering, sales, partnerships, and leadership to ensure the market sees one clear, compelling PQShield story.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎯 Required Skills And Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for an experienced product marketing leader who is exceptionally strong in positioning, messaging and strategic storytelling. You can take an emerging market, complicated buyer problem or deeply technical product and find the clear narrative inside it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of marketing experience, with significant experience in product marketing, technology marketing, B2B marketing, or a closely related discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven ability to develop positioning and stories that change how markets understand a product, technology, or company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional written and verbal communication skills. You can take something highly technical and make it understandable, interesting, and compelling without dumbing it down.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong storytelling instincts and the ability to find the human, business, and strategic narrative inside complex technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience marketing technical B2B products, ideally in cybersecurity, semiconductors, infrastructure, embedded systems, software, or another sophisticated technology market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of security and technology buyers, and the ability to communicate credibly with CISOs, CTOs, engineers, architects, product leaders, and business executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to work closely with technical experts and quickly develop enough subject-matter expertise to challenge assumptions, ask good questions, and tell an accurate story.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong commercial mindset: you understand that great marketing isn&#39;t just about explaining a product — it&#39;s about creating differentiation, urgency, preference, and ultimately revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience launching products and taking complex offerings to market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing compelling sales narratives and enablement for complex, multi-stakeholder sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent strategic judgment, with the ability to determine what the market needs to hear, why it matters, and how PQShield should say it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in a fast-moving environment where you will often need to create the narrative before the market has established one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we can offer you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A competitive compensation package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A remote first company. You will work from home most of the time, but will need to join us in the office for planning sessions and key meetings as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel for customer meetings and marketing events as needed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health insurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous PTO and holiday package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company contributions towards 401K/pension&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;…and other great benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you enjoy working as part of a technology company, value the security of our daily digital lives, and love solving hard problems - then we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PQShield is an Equal Employment Opportunity employer. We’re passionate about talent and proud to foster an inclusive environment; all applicants will be considered regardless of their gender identity, ethnicity, sexual orientation, disability, and age.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;PQShield is an Equal Employment Opportunity employer. We’re passionate about talent and proud to foster an inclusive environment; all applicants will be considered regardless of their gender identity, ethnicity, sexual orientation, disability, and age.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_8220454926977230902gmail-docs-internal-guid-9a9f34f4-7fff-014a-c97c-98ca90610a47&quot;&gt;Algolia is the retrieval intelligence layer that turns intent into trusted, decision-grade outcomes. Powering more than 1.7 trillion queries a year for over 18,000 customers with millisecond latency and 99.999% reliability, we are the recognized leader for Search and Product Discovery by top industry analyst firms. The Algolia platform turns a company&#39;s products, content, and business rules into data that humans, applications and AI agents can act upon. The result is trusted customer experiences with stronger conversions for measurable business impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Algolia was built to help users deliver an intuitive search-as-you-type experience on their websites and mobile apps. We provide a search API used by thousands of customers in more than 100 countries. Billions of search queries are answered every month thanks to the code we push into production every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join the AI Search Group: Enhancing Core Search Capabilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Relevance Group is dedicated to advancing the core search experience by improving both pre-query relevance (Understanding) and post-query relevance (Re-Ranking). We&#39;re responsible for key customer-facing features like Query Suggestions, Dynamic Synonym Suggestions, AI Re-Ranking, and Query Categorization. We’re looking for problem solvers with an entrepreneurial mindset—people who focus on outcomes and use data to drive decisions. If you&#39;re passionate about optimizing search relevance and applying AI thoughtfully to achieve measurable results for customers, we&#39;d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The team is composed of engineers, with different skill sets and backgrounds. Your experience, your knowledge and your perspective will add to this diversity and help the team deliver products that make a difference.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOU WILL:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a key contributor to the design and development of ranking &amp;amp; understanding features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with a team that includes a variety of roles, ranging from front-end developers to machine learning specialists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be responsible for the quality and soundness of our pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOU MIGHT BE A FIT IF YOU HAVE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and operating pipelines in production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with large datasets and high traffic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An interest in solving Ranking challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in building and maintaining API services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rigor in high code quality, automated testing, and other engineering best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using one of the major cloud providers (GCP, AWS or Azure)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent spoken and written English skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NICE TO HAVE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating AI models in production environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Go or Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Kubernetes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sensitivity to data driven decision making, and exploring datasets with SQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sensitivity to end user experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Algolia does not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, sex, age, national origin, military status, veteran status, disability status, sexual orientation, gender identity, genetic information, or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The annual base salary compensation range for this role reflects market pay data within this location. The exact compensation offered for this role may vary depending on specific location and job-related knowledge, technical skills, and experience; and is only one part of our Total Rewards philosophy to compensate and recognize employees for their work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Salary Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€67.500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€94.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FLEXIBLE WORKPLACE STRATEGY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Algolia’s flexible workplace model is designed to empower all Algolians to fulfill our mission to power search and discovery with ease. We place an emphasis on an individual’s impact, contribution, and output, over their physical location. Algolia is a high-trust environment and many of our team members have the autonomy to choose where they want to work and when.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a global presence with offices in Paris, NYC, London, Sydney and Bucharest, however we also offer many of our team members the option to work remotely either as fully remote or hybrid-remote employees.&lt;strong&gt; Positions listed as &quot;Remote&quot; are only available for remote work within the specified country. Positions listed within a specific city are only available in that location - depending on the role it may be available with either a hybrid-remote or in-office schedule.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WE’RE LOOKING FOR SOMEONE WHO CAN LIVE OUR VALUES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GRIT&lt;/strong&gt; - Problem-solving and perseverance capability in an ever-changing and growing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TRUST &lt;/strong&gt;- Willingness to trust our co-workers and to take ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CANDOR&lt;/strong&gt; - Ability to receive and give constructive feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CARE&lt;/strong&gt; - Genuine care about other team members, our clients and the decisions we make in the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HUMILITY&lt;/strong&gt; - Aptitude for learning from others, putting ego aside.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for talented, passionate people to help build the world’s best search and discovery technology. We value autonomy, diversity, and collaboration. We’re committed to creating an inclusive workplace where everyone is respected and supported—regardless of race, age, ancestry, religion, sex, gender identity, sexual orientation, marital status, color, veteran status, disability, or socioeconomic background.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IMPORTANT NOTICE FOR CANDIDATES - Recruitment Fraud Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve recently seen an increase in recruitment scams targeting job seekers. To help protect yourself, please keep the following in mind:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our open positions may appear on third-party job boards, but the &lt;strong&gt;best way to apply safely&lt;/strong&gt; is directly through our &lt;strong&gt;careers page&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;All genuine communication from Algolia will come from an ----- email address. If you receive an email from someone claiming to work at Algolia who does not have an ----- email address, please do not respond or share any personal information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’ll &lt;strong&gt;never ask for payments, purchases, or financial details&lt;/strong&gt; during the hiring process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;READY TO APPLY?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you share our values and our enthusiasm for building the world’s best search &amp;amp; discovery technology, we’d love to review your application!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;In a nutshell&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the intelligence that helps households get the week sorted&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agentic grocery assistance:&lt;/strong&gt; Picnic brings together something unusually powerful for an AI builder: a direct customer relationship, a live grocery assortment and the operational system that takes every order from intention to delivery. That gives you the opportunity to build an assistant that does more than talk; it can understand a household’s plans and constraints, assemble a grounded basket, explain its choices and learn from what customers accept or change. You will decide where models, retrieval, ranking and deterministic services add real value, balancing customer control, correctness, latency, reliability and cost.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical leadership &amp;amp; vision: &lt;/strong&gt;As a Staff AI Engineer, you will be the hands-on technical lead for Agentic Shopping. You will own technical direction, architecture and model-strategy decisions; solve the hardest production challenges yourself; and establish evaluation, observability, safety and fallback patterns that other teams can reuse.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Picnic’s shopping assistant:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the technical direction for agentic shopping experiences that help millions of people plan and shop effortlessly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical leadership &amp;amp; architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the system architecture for multi-turn conversational agents, balancing latency, safety guardrails, and inference costs. Technically mentor engineers across the organization to execute on building production-grade agentic systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rapid prototyping &amp;amp; productionization:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive a fast-paced, iterative engineering cadence. Build initial prototypes, establish architectural patterns, and write production code when necessary to unblock complex technical challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Model fine-tuning &amp;amp; context engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and implement systems architectures for multi-turn, conversational agents using open-weight models and techniques like fine-tuning, distillation, and RAG.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Evaluation &amp;amp; safety feedback loops:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish continuous offline and online evaluation for mission completion, basket correctness, customer effort, clarification quality, acceptance and corrections, safety, reliability, latency and cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with product, design, and product teams to define technical trade-offs, align on agent capabilities, and ensure a seamless, safe user experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;We’re looking for&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of taking complex multi-turn conversational AI systems from architectural design to high-scale production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience training, fine-tuning, and optimizing open-weight LLMs for production deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on expertise building production RAG systems, context management, and state handling for multi-turn dialogues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing robust evaluation loops, continuous monitoring systems, and automated safety/guardrail mechanisms for customer-facing applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead technical direction, perform design reviews, and mentor engineering teams without relying on hierarchy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Python skills and demonstrated ability to choose and productionize appropriate model, orchestration, retrieval, evaluation and inference tooling. Experience with tools such as PyTorch, LangGraph, vLLM, Pydantic AI, Qdrant or DeepEval is useful, or similar framework tools is required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;+ Bonus points!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience taking retrieval, ranking or recommendation models from problem definition to measurable production impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-depth expertise in deep learning for sequence modelling, representation learning, or retrieval and ranking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A degree in Computer Science, AI (or a related field), a PhD, open-source contributions, or peer-reviewed research are considered strong pluses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Picnic Perks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🫱🏼‍🫲🏾 Teamwork makes the dream work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With more than 80 nationalities across 3 countries, you’ll be part of a diverse company with plenty of cool stuff to get involved with, from board game evenings to after-work drinks to our company ski trip and more!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💡 Make a difference&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work in an awesome startup environment with the freedom to drive your own projects and create a visible impact. Our fully electric vehicles and sustainable business model mean you’ll also be contributing to making the world a better place!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🥗 Fresh Lunch, coffee, and snacks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our offices are equipped with fully-fledged coffee bars and a kitchen and chefs. They prepare delicious fresh and warm lunches every day so you can keep your energy up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚲 Health insurance discount &amp;amp; bike plan&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a partnership with CZ (a health insurance provider). Picnic employees get a discount on CZ insurance packages between 5% and 15%. Furthermore, through our partnership with Lease a Bike, you can rent-to-own a new (e)bike at a discounted rate&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌎 Relocation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re moving from another country to join Picnic we make it as smooth as possible for you. We’ll cover your flight costs for you and your partner and kids, your first month&#39;s rent and moving costs (up to €2000), and help you with the 30% tax ruling setup and application.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📆 All the rest&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Picnic you get 25 holidays, we cover your travel expenses and offer a pension plan. And your phone and laptop are on us, as well.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In a nutshell&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a developer working with Salesforce and Python, you&#39;ll join the Master Data team. We own the product data everything else runs on — from integrating supplier catalogues, through enrichment and validation, to what a customer sees in the app and what the warehouse needs to plan how a product fits in a tote. Hundreds of colleagues work with the platform every day, handling large volumes of master data across multiple countries, and your job is to make that easier — a validation that catches a bad value before it reaches a customer, a screen that stops taking eight clicks to do one thing. You&#39;ll solve data issues and steadily improve the platform. Over time the role grows towards software engineering, deeper into Python and data platform architecture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Take ownership of a part of the platform, know it well, and grow into the person others come to for it. You&#39;ll propose improvements rather than waiting for them to be assigned, and you try things and iterate quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintain and extend:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, test, evolve, and refine the core aspects of our master data platform with a creative and analytical approach. Keep it healthy by improving existing flows and integrations while reducing complexity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data modeling and quality: &lt;/strong&gt;Shape how product information is modeled, and build the validation, enrichment and monitoring that keeps it accurate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work with your users: &lt;/strong&gt;Build relationships with the operational teams who work daily with the platform, understand their pain points, and turn those into improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Code Review:&lt;/strong&gt; Review designs and code of teammates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Support existing products and work with other developers to resolve incidents, including occasional on-call shifts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technologies we use&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salesforce: Apex, LWCs, RESTful integrations, Salesforce Connect&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deployments: Salesforce DX &amp;amp; Unlocked Packages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IDEs: VSCode, Intellij; scratch orgs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python: FastAPI, Pydantic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data: SQL, Snowflake, dbt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Version Control: Git, Github&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CI/CD: TeamCity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s Degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering or a related quantitative field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience with Salesforce implementations including Apex&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious and detail-oriented: you pick things up fast, including technologies new to you, like Python or dbt, and you have the patience to chase an inconsistency until you understand where it came from. Using AI tools effectively in your daily work is good evidence of both&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuinely interested in data and the people who depend on it — models, quality, what happens downstream&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid judgement on tradeoffs between configuration and custom code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Applies software engineering best practices to Apex/LWC development e.g. triggers, async apex, testing, access and data lifecycle management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;English skills are on point (no Dutch required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bonus Points!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good command of Python/Java&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with master data, product data management or data engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of DX and unlocked packages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with sharing and security setups of Salesforce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salesforce Certifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Picnic Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✍🏼Every expert was once a beginner!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll get plenty of opportunities to challenge yourself and grow, including the Picnic Tech Academy, Lunch &amp;amp; Learn sessions, and tailored soft skills training. We also offer free professional weekly language courses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💡Make a difference&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work in an awesome startup environment with the freedom to drive your own projects and create a visible impact.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our fully electric vehicles and sustainable business model mean you’ll also be contributing to making the world a better place!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🫱🏼‍🫲🏾Teamwork makes the dream work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With more than 80 nationalities across 3 countries, you’ll be part of a diverse company with plenty of cool stuff to get involved with, from board game evenings to after-work drinks to our company ski trip and more!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🍎You are what you eat&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll get freshly prepared, healthy lunches and snacks (with plenty of vegetarian, vegan, and halal options). Coffee snob? Don’t worry, our amazing Picnic barista has you covered.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚴🏽Stay healthy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mental health is important. As well as having the option to speak with Picnic colleagues who act as confidential advisors, our collaboration with OpenUp gives you easy access to professional psychologists, along with workshops and materials.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There are plenty of sports communities and events to get involved with, from tennis to yoga, to climbing!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🔋Attractive package&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer competitive compensation and a pension plan that looks out for your future self, as well as 25 vacation days per year, so you can recharge your batteries&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌍Benefits for expats&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It can be daunting starting a new job AND moving to a new country. That’s why we offer lots of support for our many expat colleagues, including:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Relocation package: If you join Picnic from abroad, we’ll cover your trip to Amsterdam, sponsor your Visa, and offer you a month of accommodation while you settle in (as long as regulations allow).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the Netherlands, we offer support with your first tax report as well as arranging the 30% ruling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From health insurance to living arrangements to pet passports, there are always colleagues who’ve faced the same challenges and are more than happy to help!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;10yxk9z&quot; data-start=&quot;438&quot; data-end=&quot;460&quot;&gt;In een notendop&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;16&quot; data-end=&quot;436&quot;&gt;Picnic is op zoek naar een SEO Specialist met een passie voor het optimaliseren van websites voor betere vindbaarheid in zoekmachines. Je begrijpt de complexiteit van technische SEO en hebt de drive om impactvolle verbeteringen door te voeren. Werk je graag in een internationaal team en krijg je energie van het laten groeien van de Picnic-website tot hét belangrijkste customer acquisition kanaal? Lees dan snel verder!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;10yxk9z&quot; data-start=&quot;438&quot; data-end=&quot;460&quot;&gt;Kunst van het vak&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;462&quot; data-end=&quot;1611&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;30fy0l&quot; data-start=&quot;462&quot; data-end=&quot;628&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;464&quot; data-end=&quot;496&quot;&gt;SEO-strategieën ontwikkelen:&lt;/strong&gt; Ontwikkel en implementeer SEO-strategieën gericht op het vergroten van organisch verkeer en het verbeteren van zoekmachineposities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;mmgn5y&quot; data-start=&quot;629&quot; data-end=&quot;793&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;631&quot; data-end=&quot;649&quot;&gt;SEO-onderzoek:&lt;/strong&gt; Voer diepgaand keyword research uit om kansen te identificeren en ervoor te zorgen dat content optimaal aansluit op zoekintentie en relevantie.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;gpzsvu&quot; data-start=&quot;794&quot; data-end=&quot;964&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;796&quot; data-end=&quot;829&quot;&gt;Technische SEO-optimalisatie:&lt;/strong&gt; Analyseer en verbeter de technische aspecten van onze website, zoals sitestructuur, crawlbaarheid, indexeerbaarheid en paginasnelheid.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;h8grj4&quot; data-start=&quot;965&quot; data-end=&quot;1142&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;967&quot; data-end=&quot;990&quot;&gt;Nauwe samenwerking:&lt;/strong&gt; Werk intensief samen met webdevelopers en UX/UI-designers om technische SEO-verbeteringen door te voeren en best practices voor websites te waarborgen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;d70vk6&quot; data-start=&quot;1143&quot; data-end=&quot;1327&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1145&quot; data-end=&quot;1170&quot;&gt;Contentoptimalisatie:&lt;/strong&gt; Werk samen met het contentteam om content te optimaliseren en implementeren voor zoekmachines, zonder concessies te doen aan merktoon en gebruikerservaring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;syg1b8&quot; data-start=&quot;1328&quot; data-end=&quot;1488&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1330&quot; data-end=&quot;1357&quot;&gt;Performance monitoring:&lt;/strong&gt; Gebruik SEO-tools om prestaties te monitoren, keyword rankings te volgen, backlinks te analyseren en verbeterkansen te signaleren.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;14cnp8b&quot; data-start=&quot;1489&quot; data-end=&quot;1611&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1491&quot; data-end=&quot;1506&quot;&gt;Rapportage:&lt;/strong&gt; Stel regelmatig rapportages op over organische zoekprestaties en adviseer over optimalisatiestrategieën.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1tfla33&quot; data-start=&quot;1613&quot; data-end=&quot;1634&quot;&gt;Jouw superkrachten&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1636&quot; data-end=&quot;2617&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;u5nfnb&quot; data-start=&quot;1636&quot; data-end=&quot;1710&quot;&gt;Afgeronde MSc. opleiding in Marketing, Bedrijfskunde, Analytics of vergelijkbaar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qxwo9p&quot; data-start=&quot;1711&quot; data-end=&quot;1784&quot;&gt;Tot 2 jaar ervaring als SEO Specialist binnen een customer-facing merk en internationale omgeving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1y799c2&quot; data-start=&quot;1785&quot; data-end=&quot;1908&quot;&gt;Diepgaande kennis van technische SEO, waaronder sitestructuur, crawl management, structured data en mobile-first indexing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;mzaapm&quot; data-start=&quot;1909&quot; data-end=&quot;2015&quot;&gt;Hands-on ervaring met SEO-tools zoals Google Analytics, Google Search Console, SEMrush en Screaming Frog&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1gsspkt&quot; data-start=&quot;2016&quot; data-end=&quot;2119&quot;&gt;Vermogen om technische wijzigingen zelfstandig op websites door te voeren (ervaring met CMS-systemen)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1g2tstw&quot; data-start=&quot;2120&quot; data-end=&quot;2198&quot;&gt;Vloeiend in Nederlands en Engels; kennis van Frans of Duits is een grote pré&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1qdobbq&quot; data-start=&quot;2199&quot; data-end=&quot;2351&quot;&gt;Sterke analytische vaardigheden en het vermogen om complexe data te interpreteren, trends te signaleren en te vertalen naar effectieve SEO-strategieën&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13slj5f&quot; data-start=&quot;2352&quot; data-end=&quot;2514&quot;&gt;Uitstekende communicatieve en samenwerkingsvaardigheden om effectief te werken met multidisciplinaire teams, waaronder developers, designers en content creators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;175q3ce&quot; data-start=&quot;2515&quot; data-end=&quot;2617&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Zelfstandig, nauwkeurig en gedreven om websiteprestaties en gebruikerservaring continu te verbeteren&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Picnic Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🥗Verse lunch, koffie en snacks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Op kantoor hebben we een koffiebar met eigen barista&#39;s, chefs die dagelijks een heerlijke, verse lunch bereiden en snacks en fruit zodat je energie op peil blijft!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚵🏼 Korting op zorgverzekering &amp;amp; fietsenplan&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We werken samen met zorgverzekeraar CZ, waardoor Picnic-medewerkers een korting van 5% tot 15% krijgen op CZ-verzekeringspakketten. Bovendien kun je via onze samenwerking met Lease a Bike voordelig een nieuwe (e-)fiets leasen, die je later zelfs kunt overnemen!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✍🏼Learning &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bij Picnic krijg je alle ruimte om jezelf verder te ontwikkelen. We bieden persoonlijke groeikansen met Lepaya-cursussen, Academy-trainingen en meer. Werk je liever aan je mentale welzijn? Via OpenUp krijg je gratis toegang tot professionele psychologen en diverse trainingen.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;En verder&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bij Picnic krijg je 25 vakantiedagen, een vergoeding voor je reiskosten en een pensioenregeling. Ook zorgen we voor een telefoon en laptop!&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;In a nutshell&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Picnic is looking for an SEO Specialist who&#39;s passionate about optimizing websites for better search performance, understands the complexity of technical SEO, and has the drive to implement impactful changes. If you enjoy working in an international team and are excited to grow the Picnic website to our main customer acquisition channel, we’d love to hear from you!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Launch SEO strategies: &lt;/strong&gt;Create and execute SEO strategies tailored to increase organic traffic and improve search engine rankings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SEO research:&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct in-depth keyword research to identify opportunities and ensure content is optimized for search intent and relevance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical SEO optimization: &lt;/strong&gt;Analyze and enhance the technical aspects of our website, including site architecture, crawlability, indexability, and page speed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Close collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with web developers and UX/UI designers to implement technical SEO changes and ensure website best practices are followed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Content optimization: &lt;/strong&gt;Collaborate with the content team to optimize &amp;amp; implement content for search engines while maintaining brand tone and user engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance monitoring: &lt;/strong&gt;Utilize SEO tools to monitor performance, track keyword rankings, analyze backlinks, and identify improvement areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide regular reports on organic search performance and recommend strategies for improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Your superpowers&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MSc. degree in Marketing, Business Administration, Analytics or similar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 2 years of experience as SEO Specialist in an international environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of technical SEO, including site architecture, crawl management, structured data, and mobile-first indexing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with SEO tools such as Google Analytics, Google Search Console, SEMrush and Screaming Frog&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to make and implement technical changes directly on websites (experience with Content Management Systems)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in either Dutch, German or French is required, next to fluency in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with the ability to interpret complex data, identify trends, and apply them to SEO strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and teamwork skills to collaborate effectively with cross-functional teams, including developers, designers, and content creators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated with a keen eye for detail and a passion for improving website performance and user experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Picnic Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🥗Fresh Lunch, coffee, and snacks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our offices are equipped with fully-fledged coffee bars and a kitchen and chefs. They prepare delicious fresh and warm lunches every day so you can keep your energy up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚴🏼‍♂️Health insurance discount &amp;amp; bike plan&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a partnership with CZ (a health insurance provider). Picnic employees get a discount on CZ insurance packages between 5% and 15%. Furthermore, through our partnership with Lease a Bike, you can rent-to-own a new (e)bike at a discounted rate&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🏠 Relocation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re moving from another country to join Picnic we make it as smooth as possible for you. We’ll cover your flight costs for you and your partner and kids, your first month&#39;s rent and moving costs (up to €2000), and help you with the 30% tax ruling setup and application.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✍🏼 Learning &amp;amp; development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll get ample opportunity to work on yourself at Picnic. We offer personal development through Lepaya courses, Academy trainings, and more. Interested in improving your mental wellbeing? Through OpenUp you get free access to trained psychologists and many courses.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;All the rest&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Picnic you get 25 holidays, we cover your travel expenses and offer a pension plan. And your phone and laptop are on us, as well.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;In a nutshell&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Machine Learning Engineer at Picnic, you will design and deploy intelligent systems to solve our company’s biggest challenges. Beyond building models, you will productionize them with strong monitoring and seamless integration into operational systems. You will collaborate closely with stakeholders to ensure the right problems are solved and that solutions deliver real-world impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;All using high quality data. Our data is registered, logged, and consistent, enabling you to focus on building and improving models rather than cleaning data. This role combines the skills of a consultant, software engineer, and applied mathematician.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will definitely:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identify and execute &lt;/strong&gt;improvement possibilities together with other ML Engineers and (product) analysts&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate&lt;/strong&gt; on your project from inception to production, to continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop&lt;/strong&gt; tools and enhancements for our cloud-based Machine Learning platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You could work on various projects and fields, such as:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Demand forecasting:&lt;/strong&gt; delivery, article, trip volumes, used Picnic-wide&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fraud detection:&lt;/strong&gt; helping us keep troublemakers out of our store&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recommendation systems:&lt;/strong&gt; generating useful in-app grocery suggestions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Search and ranking:&lt;/strong&gt; helping our customers find exactly what they need&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Predicting delivery drop-off times&lt;/strong&gt;: making sure we’re on-time at every customer’s door&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vision:&lt;/strong&gt; ensuring quality control and smooth operations within our warehouses&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check out some of our previous machine learning projects here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://blog.picnic.nl/tagged/machine-learning&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;https://blog.picnic.nl/tagged/machine-learning&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;We’re looking for&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master’s degree or higher in AI, Computer Science, Mathematics, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in data science or applied machine learning&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, you can clearly explain complex ideas in non-technical terms and enjoy working closely with business stakeholders to solve problems together&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in designing, deploying, and maintaining production ML systems, with solid software engineering and ML principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Python and SQL skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to define the long-term vision and technical architecture for ML solutions within your domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Docker, Kubernetes, and CI is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Picnic Perks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🫱🏼‍🫲🏾 Teamwork makes the dream work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With more than 80 nationalities across 3 countries, you’ll be part of a diverse company with plenty of cool stuff to get involved with, from board game evenings to after-work drinks to our company ski trip and more!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💡 Make a difference&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work in an awesome startup environment with the freedom to drive your own projects and create a visible impact. Our fully electric vehicles and sustainable business model mean you’ll also be contributing to making the world a better place!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
