&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;For CA residents, Job Applicant Privacy Policy&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2185/2813/files/CCPA_Workforce_Member_Privacy_Policy_-_Alo_Alo_INTL_IP_Inc._-_July_2025_-_CA_ONLY_1.pdf?v=1762796781&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2185/2813/files/CCPA_Workforce_Member_Privacy_Policy_-_Alo_and_Bella_Canvas_-_June_2023_-_CA_ONLY.pdf?v=1687812344&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;HERE&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
