&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;WorldStrides, a global organization, is committed to&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;educate and serve communities worldwide. Our commitment is fueled by the passion of our team members and partners to make experiential learning accessible, while also being socially, environmentally, and ethically responsible. Together, we accomplish this by investing in initiatives to promote inclusion, diversity, and sustainability.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As an Equal Opportunity Employer, WorldStrides is committed to building a diverse workforce, supported by an environment that promotes inclusion and belonging. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;WorldStrides will only employ those who are legally authorized to work in the United States. This is not a position for which sponsorship will be provided. Individuals with temporary visas such as E, F-1, J-1, H-1, H-2, L, B, J or TN, or who need sponsorship for work authorization now or in the future, are not eligible for hire. Select seasonal roles may consider students on J-1 or F-1 visas.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us ...&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cecconi’s Amsterdam, part of the global Soho House brand, brings classic Italian dining to life in a vibrant, elegant setting. Known for its timeless dishes, buzzing atmosphere, and exceptional service, Cecconi’s offers an inspiring environment for hospitality professionals passionate about great food and genuine guest experiences. Cecconi’s serves hand-made pasta, seafood and dishes from Italy using the finest ingredients. In addition to the original restaurant in Mayfair, London, Cecconi’s has locations in Miami, West Hollywood, Istanbul and Berlin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our aim is to hire skilled and passionate &lt;strong&gt;Waiters&lt;/strong&gt; to join the team at &lt;strong&gt;Cecconi&#39;s Amsterdam&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for people who take genuine pride in their craft. At Cecconi&#39;s, great hospitality goes beyond taking orders and serving food. It&#39;s about anticipating guest needs, building meaningful connections and delivering experiences that keep guests coming back.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work alongside passionate hospitality professionals who hold themselves to high standards and are committed to excellence. As a Waiter, you&#39;ll manage your own section, build relationships with guests and play a key role in delivering the warm, attentive service Cecconi&#39;s is known for.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver warm, personable and professional service throughout the guest journey&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidently guide guests through our food and beverage menus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a busy section while maintaining exceptional attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build genuine relationships with members, regular guests and visitors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work collaboratively with kitchen, bar and floor teams to deliver a seamless experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently uphold Cecconi&#39;s and Soho House service standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support private events and other operational areas when require&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience as a Waiter or in a guest-facing hospitality role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within a busy, fast-paced service environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Naturally warm, engaging and guest-focused&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and a collaborative mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to remain calm and organised during high-volume service periods&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for food, beverage and hospitality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible availability, including evenings, weekends and public holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English required; additional languages are a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for hospitality professionals who love the energy of a full restaurant, take pride in managing a bustling section and enjoy building relationships with guests who return time and time again. At Cecconi&#39;s, you&#39;ll be part of a thriving service environment where outstanding hospitality is appreciated and recognised.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re passionate about hospitality, thrive in a fast-paced environment and want to work alongside some of the industry&#39;s most talented professionals, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cecconi&#39;s offers competitive compensation packages that feature global benefits and perks. Whether you’re seeking entry-level employment or a new opportunity to expand your profession, we offer training to develop the technical and managerial skills necessary to enhance your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compensation: Salary above Horeca CAO. &lt;strong&gt;From 2.511,89 € to 2.718,95 €, based on experience &lt;/strong&gt;(If younger than 20 y/o no youth salary will be applied)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel allowance &amp;gt; 7.5km (75% of travel costs will be reimbursed)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Healthy team meals during your shift&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Soho Friends Membership with discounts on F&amp;amp;B, rooms and Cowshed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnership discounts (Go-Vital, One Fit, Swapfiets and many more)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Friends &amp;amp; Family rate for rooms (discount depends on period &amp;amp; occupancy)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;One paid moving day per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Two paid volunteering days per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Introduce a star and you could be eligible to receive a €300 (gross) bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Waiter / Waitress, Cecconi&#39;s Amsterdam&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Full-time or part-time (2-3 days per week) | €2,511 - €2,711 gross per month, excluding tips&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cecconi&#39;s is Amsterdam&#39;s go-to for Italian dining: great food, great wine, great energy. We&#39;re looking for professional waiters who take pride in the details and love making guests feel like the most important person in the room.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver polished, warm and confident service on the floor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide guests through the menu and wine list with real knowledge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the kitchen, bar and your team to keep every service running smoothly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create the kind of evening guests talk about and come back for&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your schedule&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full-time or part-time, 2-3 days per week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mostly evening shifts, with some day shifts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekends are part of the job&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a professional restaurant, or serious ambition to learn at this level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent guest-facing skills and a polished appearance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English; Dutch or Italian is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team player who stays calm and sharp when it&#39;s busy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Right to work in the Netherlands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;€2,511 - €2,711 gross per month for a full-time contract (part-time pro rata), plus tips&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Staff meals / uniform / holiday pay / pension / travel allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training in Italian wine, menu and service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team that&#39;s serious about the craft and still has fun&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How to apply&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Apply with a few quick details; a CV is optional. We&#39;ll get back to you within [48 hours] and invite you for a conversation and a trial shift.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us ...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soho House Amsterdam&lt;/strong&gt; is part of a global community for creative people, offering a welcoming space to work, relax, and connect. Recently awarded a Michelin Key, our House is recognized for its exceptional comfort and design. Join our team and help deliver thoughtful, high-quality experiences for our members and guests.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role ...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced and technically capable &lt;strong&gt;Maintenance Technician&lt;/strong&gt; to join the Maintenance team at Soho House Amsterdam.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on role for someone with strong practical maintenance experience within a hotel or hospitality environment. The successful candidate will be confident working independently, diagnosing faults, carrying out repairs and taking ownership of maintenance tasks through to completion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work closely with the &lt;strong&gt;Maintenance Manager and wider maintenance team&lt;/strong&gt;, providing technical and operational support across the day-to-day running of the building.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role requires someone who understands the demands of a busy hotel and members&#39; club environment and who is comfortable working across guest rooms, restaurants, kitchens, bars, offices, public areas and technical spaces.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Main responsibilities&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry out planned and reactive maintenance throughout the building.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diagnose technical faults and carry out appropriate first-line repairs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry out general repairs across plumbing, carpentry, basic electrical work and general building maintenance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the maintenance of mechanical equipment, pumps, ventilation and heating/cooling systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry out regular inspections of plant rooms, guest areas and back-of-house spaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify developing or recurring faults and report recommended solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of assigned maintenance tasks from initial report through to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Maintenance Manager with planned preventative maintenance and follow-up actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with the coordination of specialist contractors and service providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure contractor works are completed correctly and identify any outstanding issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support with technical information, quotations and preparation for maintenance works and small projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate records of maintenance work, service reports and outstanding actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with room preventative maintenance programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support maintenance relating to fire safety systems, water systems, access control and other building services where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor maintenance materials, spare parts and consumables and report when stock needs replenishment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond professionally and efficiently to urgent technical issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Housekeeping, Operations, F&amp;amp;B, Security and other departments to resolve maintenance issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain high standards of workmanship, cleanliness and safety at all times.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow all relevant health and safety, fire safety and emergency procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Previous maintenance experience within a hotel or hospitality environment is essential.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong practical experience in general building maintenance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with plumbing, carpentry and basic electrical fault-finding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge or practical experience of HVAC, ventilation and heating/cooling systems would be a strong advantage.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to troubleshoot technical issues and determine the appropriate next steps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable recognising when specialist contractor support is required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to read technical manuals, service reports and basic technical drawings where required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with external contractors and service companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of planned preventative maintenance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in a busy, guest-facing operational environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to manage multiple maintenance priorities and work independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reliable, organised and able to follow tasks through to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong spoken English and good communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional when dealing with guests, colleagues, contractors and suppliers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible to work evenings and weekends when equired.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📍 Amsterdam | 🛠️ Hands-on work, varied tasks, and a collaborative environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re practical, reliable, and take pride in keeping things running smoothly behind the scenes, we’d love to hear from you!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Soho House offers competitive compensation packages that feature global benefits and perks. Whether you’re seeking entry-level employment or a new opportunity to expand your profession, we offer training to develop the technical and managerial skills necessary to enhance your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel allowance &amp;gt; 7.5km&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Soho Friends Membership with discounts on F&amp;amp;B (50%), rooms and Cowshed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnership discounts (Go-Vital, One Fit, Swapfiets and many more)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team Events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;One paid moving day per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Two paid volunteering days per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Introduce a star and you could be eligible to receive a € 300,- (gross) bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Hudl, we build great teams. We hire the best of the best to ensure you’re working with people you can constantly learn from. You’re trusted to get your work done your way while testing the limits of what’s possible and what’s next. We work hard to provide a culture where everyone feels supported, and our employees feel it—their votes helped us become one of the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hudl.com/blog/hudl-2026-top-100-inspiring-workplaces?utm_medium=internal&amp;amp;utm_source=job-ad&amp;amp;utm_campaign=26_NA_talent_job-ad&amp;amp;utm_content=1org_learn-more_blog-link_learn-more_2blog_organic_3ctw&quot;&gt;Top 100 Inspiring Workplaces&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We think of ourselves as the team behind the team, supporting the lifelong impact sports can have: the lessons in teamwork and dedication; the influence of inspiring coaches; and the opportunities to reach new heights. That’s why we help teams from all over the world see their game differently. Our products make it easier for coaches and athletes at any level to capture video, analyze data, share highlights and more.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ready to join us?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;padding: 56.25% 0 0 0; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;iframe style=&quot;position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://player.vimeo.com/video/1095624224?h=9e8cdc9dbe&amp;amp;badge=0&amp;amp;autopause=0&amp;amp;player_id=0&amp;amp;app_id=58479&quot; width=&quot;&quot; height=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Your Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Firmware Engineer&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;to work on one of Hudl’s most innovative new products: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hudl.com/en_gb/products/focus&quot;&gt;next generation, fully-automated sports cameras&lt;/a&gt;. These autonomous cameras use edge AI to automatically track the action and upload to the cloud, giving our customers seamless access to vital, real-time video and insights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Firmware Engineer, you’ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ll work closely with Hardware, Firmware and Application Software Engineers, as well as our System Architect, to build a reliable, scalable and easily updateable firmware system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead technically.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ll set an example for others in planning, designing and delivering complex projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the problem.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ll work in an autonomous squad that has the freedom and expertise to deliver the best solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Power our next generation of devices.&lt;/strong&gt; Your team is responsible for turning early prototypes into fully functioning devices, working on the low-level components powering the full stack of the device.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Time spent collaborating with your teammates in-office will be a regular part of how you work. We’re currently considering applicants within commuting distance of Den Bosch. You’ll be expected to work more days in-office than remote, but will have the freedom to coordinate your specific in-office schedule with your team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Must-Haves&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep embedded Linux experience.&lt;/strong&gt; You have extensive experience in, supporting and extending board support packages for hardware powered by embedded Linux, including hands-on experience with Yocto, and you’re comfortable working across the full stack from kernel to user space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Development expertise.&lt;/strong&gt; You have a strong background in user-space and BSP-level development, integration and debugging using C/C++.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Linux Kernel knowledge.&lt;/strong&gt; You understand device-tree configuration and kernel driver development, and can patch and debug drivers in vendor-supplied kernel trees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hardware interface knowledge.&lt;/strong&gt; You’re familiar with serial communication protocols such as UART, I2C and SPI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-Haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Microcontroller programming.&lt;/strong&gt; You have a background in programming microcontrollers, preferably with FreeRTOS or similar RTOS environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-assisted development&lt;/strong&gt;. You work fluently with AI coding tools and can evaluate their output critically&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rust experience.&lt;/strong&gt; Exposure to Rust is a plus since a large portion of our codebase is written in Rust and we plan to extend it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wired and wireless communication protocol knowledge.&lt;/strong&gt; You’re familiar with areas such as PCIe, I2C, UART, MIPI, Bluetooth, Wi-Fi and 4G/5G.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Camera experience.&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with cameras gives you a head start in this role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion work-life harmony&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. We’ll give you the flexibility you need in your work life (e.g., flexible vacation time, company-wide holidays and timeout (meeting-free) days, remote work options and more) so you can enjoy your personal life too.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guarantee autonomy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. We have an open, honest culture and we trust our people from day one. Your team will support you, but you’ll own your work and have the agency to try new ideas.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Encourage career growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. We’re lifelong learners who encourage professional development. We’ll give you tons of resources and opportunities to keep growing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Provide an environment to help you succeed&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. We&#39;ve invested in our offices, designing incredible spaces with our employees in mind. But whether you’re at the office or working remotely, we’ll provide you the tech stack and hardware to do your best work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support your wellbeing. &lt;/strong&gt;Depending on location, we offer medical and retirement benefits for employees—but no matter where you’re located, we have resources like our Employee Assistance Program and employee resource groups to support your mental health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Compensation&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The base salary range for this role is displayed below—&lt;strong&gt;starting salaries will typically fall near the middle of this range.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make compensation decisions based on an individual&#39;s experience, skills and education in line with our internal pay equity practices.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will also be eligible for a long-term incentive (LTI) award. Any bonuses awarded are based on individual and company performance paid at Hudl&#39;s discretion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€60.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€101.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hudl.com/jobs/hudl-applicant-and-candidate-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Hudl Applicant and Candidate Privacy Policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Enterprise Solutions designs, builds, and operates the growth systems that competitive businesses rely on. In a world where Al is reshaping how companies drive growth, we lead clients in business transformation and marketing modernization, connecting strategy directly to execution. Our 12,000 experts in engineering and platforms, commerce, consulting, content transformation, CRM, and CX work within a unified global operating unit across 40+ markets. WPP Enterprise Solutions works alongside best-in-class partners including Adobe, AWS, Braze, Google, Microsoft, Salesforce, and Shopify, as well as innovators in AI, to deliver growth solutions tailored to the needs of our clients’ businesses. VML, part of WPP, supports WPP Enterprise Solutions by helping brands activate transformation through creativity and experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;What&#39;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt; happening&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:299,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:299}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Over 50% of Google searches now end without a click. ChatGPT has 2.5 billion daily users. The brands that LLMs learn to recommend early are becoming the default choices. This isn&#39;t a future scenario. It&#39;s now.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At WPP ES, our Discoverability team works at the intersection of traditional search and generative AI. We help enterprise clients end to end: from visibility audits and competitive benchmarking, through priority page optimization and entity architecture, to fully embedded GEO operating models with governance, training, and real-time performance dashboards.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We run these for enterprise clients across FMCG, consumer electronics, healthcare, sports nutrition, and financial services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We need a senior consultant who can lead the SEO side of this with authority, act as a strategic sparring partner for our clients, and grow into GEO with curiosity and pace.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;What &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;you&#39;ll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt; do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:299,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:299}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This is a senior consultant role. You don&#39;t just execute SEO - you steer clients toward the right strategy, challenge their assumptions when needed, and help them get there.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Own the client relationship on discoverability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; You&#39;re the strategic sparring partner for marketing leads and digital directors. You advise, align, and drive decisions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Lead end-to-end SEO and GEO strategies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; for enterprise clients: from audit and roadmap through implementation, content optimization, technical fixes, and ongoing performance management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Drive measurable results.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; You don&#39;t stop at the recommendation. You own the path from insight to implementation to impact, whether that&#39;s restructuring priority pages, improving entity coverage, or building a GEO dashboard.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Turn data into direction.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; GA4, GSC, Ahrefs, Semrush, Screaming Frog are your daily tools. But the value is in the recommendation, not the report.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Coach and develop&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; medior and junior specialists. On craft, on client skills, on quality standards.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Shape our GEO proposition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; This discipline is young. You&#39;ll help define how we audit, optimize, and measure brand visibility in AI search.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Collaborate internationally&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; across WPP ES’ 55+ market network.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;Who you are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:299,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:299}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A senior consultant, not just a specialist.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; You&#39;ve led complex SEO engagements and advised stakeholders at director level. You understand technical SEO, content strategy, and how both connect to commercial outcomes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Someone clients trust to steer them.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; You communicate with confidence, ground your advice in evidence, and don&#39;t shy away from a difficult recommendation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Curious about what comes next.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; GEO is new. You&#39;re energized by that. You read, experiment, and form your own opinions on how AI is reshaping discoverability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A multiplier.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; You make the people around you better at their work, not just better at following yours.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;What &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;you&#39;ll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt; need&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:299,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:299}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;7+ years of hands-on SEO experience&lt;/strong&gt;, both technical and strategic, on complex multi-market websites&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Tooling fluency: Screaming Frog, Ahrefs, Semrush, Google Search Console, GA4&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Proven consultancy skills. You&#39;ve advised clients at senior level and steered strategic direction, not just delivered reports&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Mentoring experience. You&#39;ve helped others grow, formally or informally&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Fluent in English. Dutch is highly desirable&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Currently &lt;strong&gt;residing in the Netherlands and with a current right to work &lt;/strong&gt;if applicable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;GEO experience is a plus, not a prerequisite. Deeply curious and ready to pioneer counts&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;The team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:299,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:299}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll be part of the SEO/GEO team of 10 specialists within WPP ES&#39; Commerce Performance practice. The team shapes how brands get found in traditional search and in AI-generated answers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;What we offer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:299,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:299}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our compensation:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A salary of 4,800.- to 5,400.- gross/month, based on experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;An additional gross annual 8% holiday allowance pay.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A mobility package to suit your commuting needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Competitive pension benefits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A choice of a Mac or Windows laptop.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our culture:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A flexible hybrid schedule that puts your work-life balance first.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A culture of trust, with a feel-at-home vibe and an international environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Mental health: Complimentary membership EAP (Employee Assistant Programme) counseling services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Wellness pack: access to in-building yoga/ pilates classes (when available), our own in-house chair masseuse, bootcamp initiatives, etc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Working with a renowned international customer base, B2B and B2C customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;End of the week drinks, team events and parties.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The real draw:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; you&#39;ll work on a discipline that is defining the next decade of digital marketing. Real clients, real complexity, and the space to shape something new.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;About &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;WPP ES&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:299,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:299}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Part of WPP, 26,000 people, 55+ markets. Clients include AstraZeneca, Colgate-Palmolive, Dell, Ford, Microsoft, Nestle, The Coca-Cola Company, and Wendy&#39;s. Recognized by Forrester as a Leader across marketing, commerce, and digital experience services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence and world-class partnerships – all united by our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://wpp.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;WPP (VML/WPP Enterprise Solutions) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click &quot;Submit Application&quot;, this will send any information you add below to WPP (VML/WPP Enterprise Solutions). Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is a global creative company that combines brand experience, customer experience, and commerce to create connected brands&amp;nbsp;that drive growth. Guided by a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Human First&lt;/strong&gt; philosophy, VML is known for its innovative work for brands and consistently ranks among the world’s leading creative companies, including the WARC Creative 100.&amp;nbsp;VML’s global network spans 55+ markets with principal offices in Buenos Aires, Kansas City, London, New York, São Paulo, Shanghai and Singapore.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is part of WPP, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.vml.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;d4b7d1c3-8ad6-4b6d-ab45-d3cb5a3aebe1&quot;&gt;www.vml.com &lt;/a&gt;and follow along on  &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__urldefense.com_v3_-5F-5Fhttps-3A_www.linkedin.com_company_vml_-5F-5F-3B-21-21JboVxjCXSME-21OhlpCfbkl1UcWPwns1-2DGtvHOzFh0QwHV49fsPgGw-2DVCCU1bCg8aQFI9vN-2Dy-2DVwaQcITH2j2XKzGKBIFRLYf2AUWVYY1dFGK6-24&amp;amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;amp;r=zouFnm4jZMgDFaYF1uVcRY3rbgHWPca_luUrBUkT6Yc&amp;amp;m=QzcCgXCAOjzj5hiU48_CKOdHRSJ4_YpuqfviT9yjlzH5VrkzySTZ-WaQXlYAnj4W&amp;amp;s=jJ7q5V70u9oUx7ONPm5jC3IK8y6vxDilX6BGTlqlWlA&amp;amp;e=&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;a3ef68bf-16fb-4ebc-9ca9-406007d6cefc&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;#WeAreVML.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Enterprise Solutions in Amsterdam is the central hub for SEO and GEO expertise across the WPP network. From our team, we work with major national and international organisations on complex challenges across search, websites, digital platforms and AI-driven discovery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team currently consists of ten SEO and GEO specialists and is growing rapidly. We are therefore looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Technical SEO Specialist&lt;/strong&gt; to strengthen our technical capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is explicitly not a traditional SEO role with some technical SEO added on top. We are looking for someone who approaches SEO from a technical perspective. Someone who understands how websites, platforms, JavaScript frameworks, crawlers, rendering, APIs and search engines interact, and who can independently investigate and solve complex technical problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are comfortable working with SEO specialists, developers, solution architects, product teams and other technical stakeholders. You are able to go deep into the technology when needed, while also translating complex findings into clear priorities, recommendations and implementations for enterprise clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Technical SEO Specialist, you will be responsible for the technical quality and scalability of our SEO solutions. You will work on complex websites and digital ecosystems where standard SEO checklists are simply not enough.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conducting advanced technical SEO audits for large and complex websites, platforms and international domain structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analysing crawling, indexing and rendering to identify the root causes of technical SEO and indexation issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with modern JavaScript frameworks and rendering architectures, including SSR, CSR, SSG and hybrid rendering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analysing HTML, JavaScript, HTTP requests, response headers, status codes, redirects, canonicalisation and robots directives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigating and optimising crawl architecture, internal linking and information architecture for websites with hundreds of thousands or millions of URLs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advising on complex technical challenges involving migrations, replatforming, URL structures, faceted navigation, pagination, internationalisation and hreflang.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performing log file analysis to understand how Googlebot and other crawlers interact with websites and to improve crawl efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing scripts, tooling and automation that make recurring analyses faster, more reliable and more scalable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reviewing technical solutions, specifications and implementations from an SEO perspective before they go live.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working closely with developers and engineering teams to translate SEO recommendations into clear technical requirements and tickets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The technical expertise we are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For this role, we are looking for someone whose technical capabilities go well beyond using standard SEO tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have a strong understanding of:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;HTML, CSS and JavaScript, and can independently analyse source code and identify technical issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;HTTP and web architecture, including requests and responses, status codes, caching, redirects, headers and CDN behaviour.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;JavaScript SEO and the implications of client-side and server-side rendering for crawling, rendering and indexing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical concepts such as SSR, CSR, SSG, hydration and dynamic rendering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Crawling and indexing, and how search engines technically process websites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;txt, XML sitemaps, canonical tags, meta robots, X-Robots-Tag and other crawling and indexing directives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured data and Schema.org.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core Web Vitals and web performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International websites, hreflang and complex multi-market architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Website and platform migrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Crawl budget and scalable website architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You do not need to be a software engineer in every area. However, we do expect you to be comfortable reading code, manipulating data, working with APIs and building scripts or technical solutions when needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What seniority means to us&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Being senior means more than being able to independently deliver a technical SEO audit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We expect you to be able to break down complex technical problems where there is no obvious answer. You combine experience, data and technical knowledge to define your own investigative approach and develop solutions that can realistically scale within enterprise organisations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;You will also:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively improve the way we work, using tooling and AI to increase efficiency, quality and impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make significant improvements to our SEO guidelines, workflows and processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop innovative solutions to complex SEO challenges, including algorithm changes, large-scale site architecture, crawling and automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build frameworks, templates, scripts and automations that can be adopted across multiple clients and projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently develop new approaches for challenges where no standard solution exists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Think beyond what needs to change and consider how solutions can be technically and organisationally implemented at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help other SEO specialists grow their technical capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Act as a senior technical sparring partner for our clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&amp;nbsp;you&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in Technical SEO, with a strong track record of solving complex technical SEO challenges for large-scale, international and/or enterprise websites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently based in the Netherlands and able to work from our WPP office in Amsterdam.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep technical knowledge of how modern websites are built, crawled, rendered and indexed, including strong expertise in HTML, JavaScript, HTTP, web architecture and rendering technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience working with &lt;strong&gt;l&lt;/strong&gt;arge and complex website architectures, including crawling and indexation, faceted navigation, internationalisation, migrations, internal linking and crawl budget optimisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Python and/or JavaScript for scripting and automation is highly desirable, as is experience with SQL, BigQuery or comparable data environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven ability to turn complex technical findings into clear, actionable recommendations for developers, product teams, architects and senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing scalable frameworks, tooling, templates or automations that can be applied across multiple clients or projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An eager and proactive mindset, with a strong interest in exploring how AI, automation, emerging search technologies and GEO can improve both our work and our clients&#39; performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English. Dutch is highly desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer a competitive salary, a vibrant and collaborative&amp;nbsp;culture&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;ample opportunities&amp;nbsp;for professional growth.&amp;nbsp;You&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;be part of a global network of talent, working on projects that truly make an impact.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our compensation:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A gross annual salary range of 80,000€ - 95,000€, based on experience level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid working flexibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to learning platforms .&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellbeing initiatives including mental health support programs and wellness activities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee discounts and access to WPP/VML global benefits ecosystem.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participation in team events, agency&amp;nbsp;gatherings&amp;nbsp;and cross-discipline workshops.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At WPP ES, we believe in investing in people who build long-term value for our clients and their customers. Your growth is part of our growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office an average of four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;WPP (VML) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click &quot;Submit Application&quot;, this will send any information you add below to VML. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We work with the world&#39;s most valuable brands and have global reach across 100+ markets, with deep local expertise.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our people are the key to our success. We&#39;re committed to fostering a culture of creativity, belonging and continuous learning, attracting and developing the brightest talent, and providing exciting career opportunities that help our people grow.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://eur02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwpp.com%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7CErica.Durr%40wpp.com%7C9bf4566a65bc46a48ac008de749116ea%7C150b5e663d884dee83f6ed149b727a00%7C0%7C0%7C639076363668176216%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=Q9juosud56XGLThSFZ1NpPZd6FXpJPxV74OeRZWoh%2B4%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;WPP.com.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why we&#39;re hiring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is embarking on a major 3-year transformation to simplify, modernise, and unify its technology platforms across the group. This change is critical to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable cost-effective transformation and operational efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accelerate adoption of AI, data, and digital platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure consistent delivery of value and benefits across all agencies and markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimise disruption and maximise engagement during large-scale change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Workday is a cornerstone of this transformation, providing a single, modern system of record for people data and for driving efficiency through our operations and finance functions. By standardising core processes, improving data quality and enabling better insights, Workday supports consistent ways of working, stronger governance and future‑ready capabilities, while creating the foundation for scalable change, automation and AI‑enabled decision making across WPP.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Workday HCM Global Data Lead is a key leadership role responsible for orchestrating and executing the data strategy to support the successful implementation of Workday. This position requires collaboration with teams across Enterprise Technology, the People Teams, and third-party partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership of the Program&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take full accountability for the successful execution of the Workday HCM program data activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and maintain governance structures to ensure alignment with organizational objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Enterprise Data team to define and enforce data ownership and stewardship.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement and own extraction and data quality for the People Technology programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive, design and agree with respective teams on a delivery and maintenance model to ensure tools and processes can be re-used for other projects. Once agreed, document and implement the model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supervise and mentor the team who are focused on Workday HCM data transformation, ensuring proficiency on data conversion processes and associated high risk areas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide hands-on leadership, coaching, and guidance to the team on program priorities and strategy implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Process Design&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with stakeholders to design and optimize business processes related to People Data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and address root cause issues in data management and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology Implementation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Enterprise Technology teams to deliver data solutions to meet business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure technology aligns with the program&#39;s goals and supports data integrity and security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively participate on the Data Migration RFP and other RFPs where required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alignment with Job Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the Job Architecture Lead to ensure alignment between People Data and job-related data attributes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhance reporting capabilities related to critical data attributes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-develop end-user change and adoption strategies to ensure agencies understand process and interdependencies of HR processes related to JA (Payroll, CareerPathways, etc)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Significant proven relevant work experience in influencing and leading HR Transformation – specifically:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading complex data solutions in a large-scale, tech-enabled global programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent understanding of data conversion processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work with end users and to explain design decisions effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate both as manager and strategic thinker, with a hands on approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build effective relationships within the Operating Companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellence with technology solutions for data management and reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creativity to deliver from a complex &amp;amp; fragmented set of legacy systems and data sets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preference for Workday HCM experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of data governance principles and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in business process design and improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High degree of cultural awareness and appreciation for our diversity which makes WPP a truly special and unique company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience and knowledge of transformation management principles, methodologies, and tools; PROSCI or other certifications preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adept in communication and able to synthesize and frame information for different audiences in actionable ways&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active listening skills with the ability to articulate stakeholder positioning in actionable ways&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated mastery of leading and influencing others to move toward a common vision and ambitions goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re open&lt;em&gt;:&lt;/em&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;We are inclusive and collaborative; we encourage the free exchange of ideas; we respect and celebrate diverse views. We are open-minded: to new ideas, new partnerships, new ways of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re optimistic&lt;em&gt;:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span id=&quot;628d56ad5d8a35dab853e65d9daa237c&quot; class=&quot;editor-module-hl-green-solid&quot;&gt;We believe&lt;/span&gt; in the power of creativity, technology and talent to create brighter futures or our people, our clients and our communities. We approach all that we do with conviction: to try the new and to seek the unexpected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re extraordinary:&lt;/strong&gt; we are stronger together: through collaboration we achieve the amazing. We are creative leaders and pioneers of our industry; we provide extraordinary every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;ll give you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passionate, inspired people&lt;/strong&gt; – We aim to create a culture in which people can do extraordinary work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale and opportunity&lt;/strong&gt; – We offer the opportunity to create, influence and complete projects at a scale that is unparalleled in the industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Challenging and stimulating work&lt;/strong&gt; – Unique work and the opportunity to join a group of creative problem solvers. Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(236, 240, 241);&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid #LI-DNP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WPP is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wpp.com/en/careers/wpp-privacy-policy-for-recruitment&quot;&gt;https://www.wpp.com/en/careers/wpp-privacy-policy-for-recruitment&lt;/a&gt;) for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We work with the world&#39;s most valuable brands and have global reach across 100+ markets, with deep local expertise.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our people are the key to our success. We&#39;re committed to fostering a culture of creativity, belonging and continuous learning, attracting and developing the brightest talent, and providing exciting career opportunities that help our people grow.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://eur02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwpp.com%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7CErica.Durr%40wpp.com%7C9bf4566a65bc46a48ac008de749116ea%7C150b5e663d884dee83f6ed149b727a00%7C0%7C0%7C639076363668176216%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=Q9juosud56XGLThSFZ1NpPZd6FXpJPxV74OeRZWoh%2B4%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;WPP.com.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Why&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;hiring:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;WPP Enterprise Technology provides Technology services for WPP, the world’s largest communications services group. As a creative transformation company, WPP is helping its clients transform the future through extraordinary work. WPP ET is an integral part of that journey, and we are proud to provide technology for some of the world’s most creative brands.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Lead M365 architecture and senior engineering, owning the platform design and the most complex change. Combines retained architecture and senior-engineering capability for Microsoft 365.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What&amp;nbsp;you&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;be doing:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Own the M365 architecture, standards and engineering roadmap&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Lead and manage the M365 architects and senior engineers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Design and assure complex M365 change and migrations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Assure third party support provider delivered designs and change to WPP standards.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Embed security, resilience and compliance by design.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Provide senior technical escalation above the run layer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Set the architecture, patterns and guardrails that Kyndryl implements and operates within.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Assure that partner-delivered designs and changes meet WPP security, resilience and standards.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Act as design authority and approval gate for partner architecture decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What&amp;nbsp;you&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;need:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;·&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;·&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Expert M365 architecture and engineering&amp;nbsp;( Exchange, Teams, SharePoint,&amp;nbsp;Copilot, Copilot Studio, Power&amp;nbsp;App/Automate, Power BI/Fabric,&amp;nbsp;Defender&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;Purview)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;·&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;·&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Working knowledge of enterprise identity platforms, specifically Okta, and how M365 workloads integrate with them; ability to provide architectural guidance on conditional access, authentication flows, hybrid connectivity and Zero Trust principles without directly owning the identity platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;·&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;·&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Large-scale tenant migration and integration design at 100,000+ seat scale, with hands-on experience of tools such as ShareGate or Microsoft’s native migration tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;·&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;·&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Microsoft Graph API, PowerShell scripting (Exchange Online Management Shell, PnP PowerShell, Microsoft.Graph module) and automation at enterprise scale for M365 administration and deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;·&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;·&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Proven ability to produce and own architecture documentation, HLD (High-Level Design) and LLD (Low-Level Design), architecture decision records (ADRs) and reference architectures as the recognised design authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;·&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;·&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Proven vendor governance experience, including oversight of large managed service providers and holding partners accountable to contractual SLAs and agreed design standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;·&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;·&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Microsoft 365 certifications: Microsoft 365 Certified: Enterprise Administrator Expert (MS-102, or legacy MS-100/MS-101) is essential. Microsoft 365 Certified: Security Administrator Associate, Microsoft Certified: Azure Solutions Architect Expert, or Microsoft Certified: Cybersecurity Architect Expert are highly desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;·&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;·&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Architecture framework qualification such as TOGAF 9/10 or equivalent is advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;·&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;·&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Technical leadership and design authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;·&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;·&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Recognised architecture experience in the relevant domain at enterprise scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;·&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;·&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Relevant architecture or platform certifications (e.g. TOGAF or vendor architect tracks).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;·&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;·&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Degree in a relevant discipline or equivalent experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;·&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;·&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Sets the target architecture,standardsand design patterns for the domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;·&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;·&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Designs for security, scale, resilience and total cost of ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;·&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;·&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Influences engineering and vendor teams without direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;·&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;·&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Balances strategic ambition with pragmatic, deliverable decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;·&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;·&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Stays current with platform direction and emerging capability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Who you are:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You&#39;re&amp;nbsp;open&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are inclusive and collaborative; we encourage the free exchange of ideas; we respect and celebrate diverse views. We are open-minded: to&amp;nbsp;new ideas, new partnerships, new ways of working.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You&#39;re&amp;nbsp;optimistic&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;We believe in the power of creativity,&amp;nbsp;technology&amp;nbsp;and talent to create brighter futures or our people, our&amp;nbsp;clients&amp;nbsp;and our communities. We approach all that we do with conviction: to try the new and to&amp;nbsp;seek&amp;nbsp;the unexpected.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You&#39;re&amp;nbsp;extraordinary:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;we are stronger together: through collaboration we achieve the amazing. We are creative leaders and pioneers of our industry; we provide extraordinary every day.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What&amp;nbsp;we&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;give you:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Passionate, inspired people&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;– We aim to create a culture in which people can do extraordinary work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Scale and opportunity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;– We offer the opportunity to create, influence and complete projects at a scale that is unparalleled in the industry.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Challenging and stimulating work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;– Unique work and the opportunity to join a group of creative problem solvers. Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(236, 240, 241);&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WPP is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wpp.com/en/careers/wpp-privacy-policy-for-recruitment&quot;&gt;https://www.wpp.com/en/careers/wpp-privacy-policy-for-recruitment&lt;/a&gt;) for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced &lt;strong&gt;Senior Payroll Analyst&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Global Payroll team and play a key role in the delivery and continuous improvement of payroll across our international markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior operational role with responsibility for overseeing payroll activity across multiple countries. You will bring strong payroll expertise, sound judgement and a proactive approach to ensure employees are paid accurately, on time and in compliance with local legislation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with the Payroll Team, internal HR and People teams, Finance, Tax and external payroll providers, you will take ownership of complex payroll activities, provide subject-matter expertise and act as a key escalation point for payroll issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role will also provide opportunities to support &lt;strong&gt;international payroll projects, process improvements, system implementations and automation&lt;/strong&gt;, helping Deliveroo build a scalable and efficient global payroll operation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of the &lt;strong&gt;end-to-end payroll delivery&lt;/strong&gt; for assigned international entities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with local HR, People Operations, Finance and Tax teams to ensure payroll inputs are complete, accurate and delivered within agreed timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review, validate and approve payroll inputs and outputs, identifying discrepancies, trends and potential risks before payroll is finalised.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply a strong understanding of &lt;strong&gt;legislation across multiple jurisdictions, statutory requirements and payroll practices&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring processes remain compliant and appropriately controlled.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with external payroll providers, holding them accountable for &lt;strong&gt;accuracy, timeliness, compliance and service delivery&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a senior escalation point for complex employee and stakeholder payroll queries, providing clear guidance and appropriate resolutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform and oversee payroll reconciliations, payment validation and statutory submissions, ensuring appropriate controls are completed and documented.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse payroll data and reporting to identify anomalies, control weaknesses, recurring issues and opportunities for improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain strong payroll governance and documentation, ensuring processes, controls and procedures are consistently followed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify opportunities to &lt;strong&gt;simplify, standardise and automate payroll processes&lt;/strong&gt;, reducing manual intervention and operational risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and lead payroll-related projects, including &lt;strong&gt;system implementations, payroll migrations, integrations, process changes and new entity onboarding&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Technology and payroll vendors to troubleshoot system and integration issues and support effective resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the development of payroll policies, procedures, controls and best practices across international markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share knowledge and provide guidance to Payroll Analysts and other team members, helping to build capability and consistency across the wider team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay up to date with changes to payroll legislation and communicate relevant impacts to internal stakeholders and payroll providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Payroll Lead with wider global payroll initiatives and deputise where required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience working in a &lt;strong&gt;payroll analyst or senior payroll position&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally within a complex, international organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on experience of &lt;strong&gt;international payroll&lt;/strong&gt;, with experience of &lt;strong&gt;Italy and/or France payroll highly desirable&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good working knowledge of Italian and/or French payroll legislation, statutory requirements and payroll processes is preferable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing payroll across multiple countries and working with &lt;strong&gt;third-party payroll providers&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of payroll controls, reconciliations, payments, statutory reporting and compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills, with the ability to interrogate payroll data, identify discrepancies and understand the root cause of issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent attention to detail and a strong focus on payroll accuracy and risk management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of identifying and implementing &lt;strong&gt;process improvements, automation and operational efficiencies&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting or leading payroll projects, system implementations or payroll migrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Excel skills and confidence working with payroll data and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;Workday/Cloudpay&lt;/strong&gt; or other HR/payroll technology is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management skills, with the confidence to challenge, influence and provide a clear point of view.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to explain complex payroll matters clearly to both payroll and non-payroll stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, solutions-focused approach and the confidence to question &lt;strong&gt;the why and the how&lt;/strong&gt; behind existing processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Deliveroo?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo’s mission is to build the definitive food company by making food more convenient and accessible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a technology-driven business in one of the world’s fastest-growing industries, Deliveroo offers the opportunity to make a real impact while working in a fast-paced and innovative environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo also offers a wide range of competitive benefits across health, family, finance, community, convenience, growth, time away and relocation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workplace and diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo is committed to building a workplace that reflects the diversity of the world around us and where everyone can belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There is no judgement when it comes to the things that make people who they are — whether that is gender, race, sexuality, religion or even a secret aversion to coriander.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are passionate about food and excited to help shape one of the fastest-growing companies in an exciting space, Deliveroo would love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo connects millions of consumers with the restaurants and brands they love. Our Integrated Marketing team sits at the heart of how we bring those relationships to life — combining customer insight, commercial opportunity and creativity to drive growth for Deliveroo and our partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Within Central Integrated Marketing, the Merchant &amp;amp; Ads team sets the global strategy for how we partner with merchants to help them grow on our marketplace and create compelling reasons for consumers to choose Deliveroo. This is an opportunity to shape Deliveroo’s global approach to merchant partnerships, building high-impact collaborations with some of the world’s most recognised and loved brands. This will be a hybrid role - working 3 days a week from our London HQ.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Owns the New Verticals merchant and ads marketing strategy end to end, reporting into the Merchant &amp;amp; Ads Integrated Marketing Director.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Responsible for the creation and deployment of New Verticals merchant marketing playbooks across co marketing, promotions, and ads.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Responsible for the creation and deployment of the New Verticals sell in strategy and associated sell in materials for adoption by local teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Supports local marketing teams with key enterprise merchant relationships at the global level, and supports local New Verticals marketing initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Ads &amp;amp; Monetization Strategy&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the New Verticals specific ads and monetization strategy across owned and external surfaces, feeding into the global monetization strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead pricing, packaging, and investment decisions for merchant advertising in your category, in partnership with Commercial and Finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Category Playbook: New Verticals&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own and evolve the New Verticals merchant marketing playbook, setting how co marketing, promotions, and advertising work for grocery and retail merchants globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead change initiatives that improve how New Verticals merchant marketing works, bringing Local Integrated Marketing and Functional Marketing along with you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Key Merchant Relationship Management&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support local marketing teams with key enterprise merchant relationships at the global level, and support delivery of priority New Verticals marketing initiatives with those merchants.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Act as the senior escalation point for merchant issues that cross multiple markets or functions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Cross Functional Stakeholder Management&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Serve as the primary marketing partner to Merchant S&amp;amp;O and Commercial for New Verticals, translating category priorities into marketing and ads strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Represent New Verticals in cross functional forums, shaping the roadmap for merchant facing and ads facing surfaces.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Sell In Strategy &amp;amp; Sales Enablement&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the sell-in strategy for New Verticals merchant and ads programmes, defining how Commercial and Local teams pitch these programmes to merchants.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oversee the sell in materials, case studies, and proof points for New Verticals, using performance data to continuously refine them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Central Strategy &amp;amp; Market Coordination&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own delivery of the New Verticals merchant marketing goals, coordinating a consistent strategy across all Deliveroo markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Report on New Verticals merchant and ads marketing performance to senior stakeholders, own specific business metrics, and lead course correction when needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;7+ years of marketing experience, ideally including merchant marketing, retail media, ads, or category marketing in a consumer or marketplace business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Track record of owning the marketing strategy for an entire team or category, and resolving complex delivery challenges that span multiple teams or functions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience managing people, and comfortable managing other people managers as your team grows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong commercial acumen, seen as a go to expert for merchant or ads marketing, using business and financial data to make sound decisions in ambiguous situations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Confident communicator, able to present complex ideas to large groups and flex your style for directors and department leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Skilled at establishing and owning cross functional partnerships, using relationships and creative thinking to work through conflict.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven ability to lead change initiatives that improve how a team or category works, bringing others along with you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to synthesise complex, cross functional inputs into a clear plan and narrative.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving. We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Make a visible impact every day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your work directly improves experiences for customers, partners and riders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;Learn fast in an entrepreneurial environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work close to the market with autonomy, pace and real responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠 &lt;strong&gt;Build a career, not just a role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stretch yourself, develop new skills and grow as the business evolves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;Deliver together in an inclusive culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborative, values-driven teams that support how you work best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Find more about how we hire here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
