&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;Sounds like a plan?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;We’d&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt; love to explore further with you.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Everyone we work with and consider working with has a right to equal treatment. The hiring and appraisal process at Schuberg Philis is designed to be thorough and equitable, implementing fair payment, benefits, and opportunities across all demographics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;It is our desire to be a company that brings together multiple nationalities, cultures, religions, genders, abilities, and talents within and across our teams. We welcome colleagues from diverse backgrounds to join Schuberg Philis and actively support diversity and inclusion in the tech industry.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bij Schuberg Philis draait alles om eigenaarschap. Onze missie kritische dienstverlening vraagt om leiders die niet alleen visie brengen, maar deze ook vertalen naar concreet, voorspelbaar en schaalbaar resultaat.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als &lt;strong&gt;Software&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Proposition Director&lt;/strong&gt; ben jij zo’n leider. Jij bent verantwoordelijk voor de volledige lifecycle van onze software‑gedreven marktproposities: van plan en build tot run en continue verbetering. Je zorgt dat klantteams kunnen leveren wat wij gezamenlijk beloven: de hoogste kwaliteit, zonder compromissen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dit is een rol voor een hands‑on deliveryleider die zich thuis voelt op het snijvlak van strategie, techniek en operatie.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat jij brengt:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bent voelt je thuis binnen complexe IT-landschappen. Je kent het domein Software van binnen en van buiten en snapt als geen ander hoe onze klanten hier waarde uithalen Je bent analytisch scherp, een snelle denker en je maakt makkelijk verbinding tussen technische en organisatorische zaken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je denkt in oplossingen en hebt inhoudelijke scherpte. Je weet wat nodig is om de kwaliteit van Schuberg Philis te leveren: je kijkt vooral naar hoe iets wel kan. Het resultaat is net zo belangrijk als de weg er naartoe. Je creëert waarde&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je voelt je thuis op alle niveaus: van engineer tot C-level. Je brengt rust door je overzicht en voorspellend inzicht. Je stelt de vragen die anderen niet durven te stellen. Je schakelt moeiteloos tussen de behoefte van de klant vandaag en van morgen door te luisteren, te duiden en samen te ontwerpen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bent ondernemend en handelt resultaatgericht. Je haalt energie uit samenwerken en bouwen, met de juiste kwaliteit. Je kijkt verder dan de vraag van vandaag en bouwt aan oplossingen die passen bij de langere termijn ambitie van de Schuberg Philis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Jij bent ervan. Je weet dat elk project begint met écht begrijpen wat er speelt. Dat betekent dat je de spin in het web bent waar alles samen komt: het leveren van de dienstverlening die onze teams sneller en efficiënter maakt, kwaliteit, innovatie, team well-being. Je bent met jouw team verantwoordelijk voor de P&amp;amp;L van de Software propositie. Je bent de hoeder van ons DNA en onze manier van werken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bent een natuurlijke verbinder. Je bouwt snel een netwerk op binnen Schuberg Philis en weet teams en collega’s bij elkaar te brengen om de juiste Services te creëren en te adopteren.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat je gaat doen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Operationeel Leiderschap &amp;amp; Delivery Excellence; Je bent eindverantwoordelijk voor de levering en doorontwikkeling van onze Services. Dat betekent:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regie voeren over de plan, build en run en doorlopende verbetering van onze diensten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structuur aanbrengen met duidelijke roadmaps, mijlpalen en transparante interne communicatie.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Processen standaardiseren, documenteren en best practices laten landen, zodat onze dienstverlening schaalbaar en audit‑proof is.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Servicebeschrijvingen, contracten en pricing actueel houden ter ondersteuning van sales en klantteams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Customer Enablement &amp;amp; Service Ownership; Je ondersteunt klantteams zodat zij duurzaam kunnen leveren:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Door een stabiele, hoogwaardige basis aan diensten neer te zetten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Door teams te verbinden en communities te creëren die kennisdeling en inner‑source stimuleren.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Door operationele knelpunten te herkennen en structurele verbeteringen organisatiebreed te realiseren.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Commercieel &amp;amp; Financieel Eigenaarschap; Je bent verantwoordelijk voor de commerciële gezondheid van jouw domein:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managen van de P&amp;amp;L van de propositie en zorgen dat investeringen maximaal renderen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bijdragen aan cross‑ en up‑sell door proposities te laten aansluiten op klantbehoefte en marktontwikkelingen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Samenwerken met proposition ambassadors en sales om klantfeedback te vertalen naar onze service roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Innovatie‑Enablement &amp;amp; Stewardship;&amp;nbsp;Je borgt dat innovatie ook echt landt in onze dienstverlening:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Door nauw samen te werken met labs, tech leads en klantteams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Door nieuwe trends, technieken en werkwijzen op een duurzame manier in dienstverlening te integreren.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Door hergebruik van servicecomponenten te stimuleren en onze schaalbaarheid te maximaliseren.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat je meeneemt &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Je bent een gedreven, gestructureerde en zeer betrouwbare deliveryleider. Je combineert strategisch inzicht met pragmatische uitvoering en weet complexe dienstverlening voorspelbaar te maken.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Je bent:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimaal 10 jaar delivery van complexe IT- of technologieomgevingen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ervaring met product management in een IT dienstenomgeving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vergaande affiniteit met IT en technologie&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands‑on, met een sterk gevoel voor mission‑critical verantwoordelijkheid.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organized &amp;amp; detail‑driven, met een natuurlijke focus op kwaliteit en structuur.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercieel scherp, met begrip van klantwaarde en technische mogelijkheden.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Een verbinder, die communities bouwt en stakeholders meeneemt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Een steward van excellentie, die continu betere manieren van werken introduceert.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat je krijgt&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Een rol die groter is dan delivery alleen. Bij Schuberg Philis werk je niet in een silo’s, maar in een multidisciplinair team van engineers, architecten en strategen. Samen bouwen jullie aan verandering die ertoe doet voor klanten, voor Nederland, en voor de continuïteit van systemen die nooit stil mogen vallen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Je krijgt ruimte om je eigen koers te varen, met de support van een sterk merk, bewezen proposities en cases die gewicht hebben. Je werkt autonoom, maar nooit alleen. En ja, de lat ligt hoog. Maar dat is precies waarom jij hier wilt zijn.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Everyone we work with and consider working with has a right to equal treatment. The hiring and appraisal process at Schuberg Philis is designed to be thorough and equitable, implementing fair payment, benefits, and opportunities across all demographics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;It is our desire to be a company that brings together multiple nationalities, cultures, religions, genders, abilities, and talents within and across our teams. We welcome colleagues from diverse backgrounds to join Schuberg Philis and actively support diversity and inclusion in the tech industry.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot; data-ccp-charstyle-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;961a4c69-80b3-4106-8b97-6626409b2a4b|52&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[201342446,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342447,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;,201342448,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342449,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469777841,&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,201341986,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Calibri,Arial&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;22&amp;quot;,469775450,&amp;quot;normaltextrun&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;normaltextrun&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Default Paragraph Font&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt;Take ownership of our DMS platform for managing data protection needs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot; data-ccp-charstyle-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;961a4c69-80b3-4106-8b97-6626409b2a4b|52&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[201342446,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342447,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;,201342448,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342449,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469777841,&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,201341986,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Calibri,Arial&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;22&amp;quot;,469775450,&amp;quot;normaltextrun&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;normaltextrun&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Default Paragraph Font&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note: At this point we are only considering applications from candidates currently based in the Netherlands.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Subtle Emphasis&quot;&gt;Are you passionate about data protection and security in a rapidly evolving digital landscape? At Schuberg Philis, we recognize that the world is shifting from traditional backup to data security and resilience. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Subtle Emphasis&quot;&gt;We’re&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Subtle Emphasis&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;looking for a Platform Engineer – Backup &amp;amp; Recovery to strengthen our Data Management-as-a-Service (DMS) team and help us&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Subtle Emphasis&quot;&gt;accelerate through this&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Subtle Emphasis&quot;&gt;transformation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Subtitle Char&quot;&gt;About the Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The DMS team&amp;nbsp;is responsible for&amp;nbsp;ensuring business continuity and peace of mind for&amp;nbsp;more than 20 of our&amp;nbsp;customers by delivering&amp;nbsp;highly available, secure, and robust data recovery platforms. Our shared platform is fully segregated and consumed by customer teams via a self-service model, securing critical data and guaranteeing recoverability across both private and public cloud environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;join&amp;nbsp;a dedicated,&amp;nbsp;group of&amp;nbsp;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot; data-ccp-charstyle-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;ac0262f4-8a9e-5820-b908-2d943c5f7113|1&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[201342446,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342447,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;,201342448,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342449,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469777841,&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,201341986,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;22&amp;quot;,469775450,&amp;quot;normaltextrun&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;normaltextrun&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Default Paragraph Font&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt;passioned&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;data security experts&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;working within our larger Services Team.&amp;nbsp;You’ll&amp;nbsp;also&amp;nbsp;work closely&amp;nbsp;with our&amp;nbsp;sbp.cloud&amp;nbsp;team, who&amp;nbsp;operate&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;self-built sovereign cloud solutions. Here, you will dive into complex customer environments&amp;nbsp;and support customer teams by&amp;nbsp;providing&amp;nbsp;strategic advice for&amp;nbsp;optimal&amp;nbsp;solutions, collaborate in RFIs/RFPs,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;conduct&amp;nbsp;in-depth&amp;nbsp;data management assessments.&amp;nbsp;With our plan-build-run approach, you take end-to-end ownership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Subtitle Char&quot;&gt;Your Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a Platform Engineer - Backup &amp;amp; Recovery, you will take full responsibility for the lifecycle of both existing and future environments, platforms, and solutions. Your focus: continuously improving platform features, driving innovation, and enhancing user experience. Working closely with technology vendors and our customer teams,&amp;nbsp;you’ll&amp;nbsp;ensure all data protection and resiliency standards are not only met, but exceeded, all while applying standardized guardrails, driving automation&amp;nbsp;and best-in-class practices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our DMS platform is run on a segregated, dedicated private cloud infrastructure managed in-house for maximum resilience, spanning multiple availability zones. We integrate a wide array of storage targets, including public cloud services and S3-compatible platforms built on Pure&amp;nbsp;FlashBlade//S and NetApp&amp;nbsp;StorageGRID&amp;nbsp;in our own datacenters, plus a long-term archiving tier.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Serving over&amp;nbsp;4,000&amp;nbsp;data protection&amp;nbsp;endpoints&amp;nbsp;ranging&amp;nbsp;from Oracle, MS-SQL, SAP, Sybase, PaaS, and container platforms to VMs on various public/private clouds,&amp;nbsp;our environments generate more than 25,000 recovery points daily, maximizing data integrity and uptime for critical applications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;Your passion for data protection and automation should simplify day-2 operations and drive cost-effectiveness, leaving room for implementing new security features and streamlining (new) customer deployments and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;facilitating&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;new projects. This allows you to guide our customers in understanding their data protection needs and implementing solutions. Your&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;expertise&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;will help offer strategic insights into RFP’s and RFI’s, making informed decisions rooted in customer requirements and your technical proficiency&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Emphasis&quot;&gt;What&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Emphasis&quot;&gt;You’ll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Emphasis&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Do:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Emphasis&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;8&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Own and manage complex data recovery platforms (primarily leveraging Commvault), aligning with our plan-build-run&amp;nbsp;methodology.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
