&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;More information?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;Do not hesitate to call Maggie: 06 23 75 70 86.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Everyone we work with and consider working with has a right to equal treatment. The hiring and appraisal process at Schuberg Philis is designed to be thorough and equitable, implementing fair payment, benefits, and opportunities across all demographics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;It is our desire to be a company that brings together multiple nationalities, cultures, religions, genders, abilities, and talents within and across our teams. We welcome colleagues from diverse backgrounds to join Schuberg Philis and actively support diversity and inclusion in the tech industry.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;blockquote&gt;Work on mission-critical network solutions.&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Schuberg Philis, we design, build, and maintain environments for our customers’ mission-critical applications, leveraging a blend of public cloud and on-premises infrastructures. Our dedicated customer teams are driven by ownership and have the ambition to always deliver the best results, regardless of complexity or constraints.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you as passionate about networking and automation as we are? We are looking for a Network Automation Engineer who thrives on designing, implementing and running advanced network solutions. Take ownership of critical network layers, integrate physical and virtual components and ensure seamless operation for our customers’ environment, both on-premises and in the cloud.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Automation is your default mindset. You will be focusing on designing and building a mission critical environment for our customers, engineered for high availability and stability. You and your team get to take full ownership of building as well as running and improving customer environments. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will you be doing?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Network Automation Engineer, these activities will be part of your responsibility:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect, design, build and maintain highly available, secure, and scalable networks across on-premises and public cloud environments (e.g. Azure);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate and template network configurations (Infrastructure as Code) using tools such as Terraform, Chef, and Ansible;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot and remediate performance or security challenges across multifaceted network landscapes;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and optimize logical and virtual networking solutions, including SDN and VMware NSX;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate and manage IPAM (preferably Nautobot or Netbox) and IAM solutions, supporting an efficient and secure network environment;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in Kubernetes networking, CI/CD automation, GitLab/GitOps workflows;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and support change planning, security incidents, audits and continuous network improvement;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on greenfield projects, with responsibility ranging from architecture to hands-on building and continuous development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What do you need to be successful?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ideal candidate looks like this:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record as a Network Engineer in high-availability environments;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong troubleshooting skills and the ability to remediate complex network and security issues;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Cisco, Arista, and/or Extreme Networks;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise with F5, Cisco ASA and Palo Alto;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with automation and Infra as Code, like Terraform, Ansible, Chef;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with public cloud networking (Azure) and integrating with on-premises environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to work on large, complex projects designing and developing mission-critical infrastructures whilst also working on focus on existing network environments, this is the role for you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Everyone we work with and consider working with has a right to equal treatment. The hiring and appraisal process at Schuberg Philis is designed to be thorough and equitable, implementing fair payment, benefits, and opportunities across all demographics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;It is our desire to be a company that brings together multiple nationalities, cultures, religions, genders, abilities, and talents within and across our teams. We welcome colleagues from diverse backgrounds to join Schuberg Philis and actively support diversity and inclusion in the tech industry.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Build Mission-Critical GenAI &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Schuberg Philis, we go beyond delivering IT solutions. We design, build, and operate mission-critical systems that our customers depend on every day. From infrastructure to cloud-native platforms, every layer is engineered for maximum reliability and quality. We work closely with our customers to ensure their most vital operations run seamlessly, regardless of complexity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced &lt;strong&gt;GenAI Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join a small, close-knit, self-managing team. Our mission is to develop advanced AI platforms, AI-driven solutions, and applications that transform how our customers operate across a wide range of industries. These platforms serve as the backbone for innovation, reliability, and scalability, supporting critical operations in high-security environments. The solutions built on top of them redefine the way our customers run their business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our ideal colleague has&amp;nbsp;experience with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing,&amp;nbsp;building,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;maintaining&amp;nbsp;GenAI&amp;nbsp;applications&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;bringing&amp;nbsp;them&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;production&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on&amp;nbsp;experience&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;GenAI&amp;nbsp;frameworks,&amp;nbsp;libraries,&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;platforms&amp;nbsp;(e.g.,&amp;nbsp;LangChain,&amp;nbsp;TensorFlow,&amp;nbsp;PyTorch,&amp;nbsp;FastAPI).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on&amp;nbsp;experience&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;using&amp;nbsp;GenAI&amp;nbsp;models&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;production&amp;nbsp;applications,&amp;nbsp;both&amp;nbsp;open&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;closed&amp;nbsp;source&amp;nbsp;(e.g.,&amp;nbsp;GPT,&amp;nbsp;Llama,&amp;nbsp;Claude).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on&amp;nbsp;experience&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;other&amp;nbsp;GenAI&amp;nbsp;application&amp;nbsp;components&amp;nbsp;like&amp;nbsp;models,&amp;nbsp;vector&amp;nbsp;databases,&amp;nbsp;embeddings,&amp;nbsp;chunking&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;evaluation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving&amp;nbsp;architectural&amp;nbsp;decisions&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;contributing&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;long-term&amp;nbsp;technical&amp;nbsp;vision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;applying&amp;nbsp;change&amp;nbsp;management&amp;nbsp;practices&amp;nbsp;when&amp;nbsp;delivering&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge&amp;nbsp;technology&amp;nbsp;solutions&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;platforms&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;ensure&amp;nbsp;value&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;delivered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluency in Dutch&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Everyone we work with and consider working with has a right to equal treatment. The hiring and appraisal process at Schuberg Philis is designed to be thorough and equitable, implementing fair payment, benefits, and opportunities across all demographics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;It is our desire to be a company that brings together multiple nationalities, cultures, religions, genders, abilities, and talents within and across our teams. We welcome colleagues from diverse backgrounds to join Schuberg Philis and actively support diversity and inclusion in the tech industry.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;blockquote&gt;Design, deliver and operate the AI platforms that power our customers&#39; most critical systems&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Schuberg Philis, we do more than deliver IT solutions. We design, build and operate business-critical systems that our customers rely on every day. From infrastructure to cloud-native platforms, every layer is engineered for maximum reliability and quality. Working closely with our customers, we ensure their most important processes continue to run smoothly, no matter how complex the environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced GenAI Python Engineer to join a small, close-knit and self-managing team. Our mission is to design and develop advanced AI platforms, AI-powered solutions and applications that transform the way our customers operate across a variety of industries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;These platforms provide the foundation for innovation, reliability and scalability, supporting critical business processes in high-security environments. The solutions built on top of these platforms fundamentally change how our customers run their businesses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Ideal Colleague Has Experience With oR Knowledge Of:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 4-6 years of proven commercial experience in a professional software engineering environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A good command of the Dutch language.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing, building and maintaining Generative AI applications, including deploying and operating them in production using Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with GenAI frameworks, libraries or platforms such as LangChain, TensorFlow, PyTorch or FastAPI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with Generative AI models in production environments, both open-source and proprietary, including models such as GPT, Llama and Claude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implementing and optimizing core GenAI components, including vector databases, embeddings, chunking strategies and evaluation frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving architectural decisions and contributing to the long-term technical vision of a platform or product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading technology adoption and change management initiatives to ensure cutting-edge solutions deliver measurable business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Everyone we work with and consider working with has a right to equal treatment. The hiring and appraisal process at Schuberg Philis is designed to be thorough and equitable, implementing fair payment, benefits, and opportunities across all demographics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;It is our desire to be a company that brings together multiple nationalities, cultures, religions, genders, abilities, and talents within and across our teams. We welcome colleagues from diverse backgrounds to join Schuberg Philis and actively support diversity and inclusion in the tech industry.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;blockquote&gt;Combine your Linux and Kubernetes skills in a mission-critical environment&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Please note: We are only considering candidates who are currently living and working in the Netherlands. We do not provide relocation sponsorship.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;About Schuberg Philis&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Schuberg Philis, we specialize in mission-critical IT. We partner closely with our customers to ensure their most vital systems run smoothly, securely, and reliably.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our engineers are T-shaped professionals: they combine deep technical expertise with a broad, collaborative mindset and a strong focus on customer satisfaction. Working in dedicated, cross-functional, self-steering Customer Teams, we take ownership of complex challenges and co-create solutions that align with our customers’ goals.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our work ranges from designing and building robust systems to managing secure, business-critical platforms. We automate wherever possible, support customer teams and developers with their applications, and ensure platforms remain secure, up to date, and available.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our ideal candidate&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are looking for a T-shaped engineer with a proven track record in operating and improving complex, mission-critical environments.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Core technical skills&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with Linux environments, including Debian and Red Hat administration, scripting, and security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with cloud-native infrastructure, Infrastructure as Code (Terraform), CI/CD (GitLab CI), and certificate management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with automation products like Ansible or Chef&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience scripting and interacting with APIs using Bash or Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with technical application management and troubleshooting of Python-based applications, including APIs and automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and maintaining on-premises and cloud-based Kubernetes environments, including multi-tenant clusters, containers and helm charts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with database performance tuning and troubleshooting, for example MySQL and MongoDB.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in monitoring and observability tooling, such as Cilium, Hubble, and Datadog.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Kubernetes and security&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with Linux environments, including Debian and Red Hat administration, scripting, and security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of Kubernetes networking and security.
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cluster and workload hardening.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Cilium, or another CNI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with NGINX Ingress Controller.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with storage solutions such as Portworx.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience securing containerized environments and Kubernetes clusters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong troubleshooting skills, with the ability to diagnose and resolve performance bottlenecks and security issues across a complex landscape.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Networking&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid L2/L3 networking fundamentals outside of Kubernetes: switching, routing, BGP, BFD, and SNMP, distributed and edge firewalling (for example Palo Alto), and connectivity such as leased lines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Architecture, leadership, and collaboration&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to create high- and low-level designs, both pre- and post-sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience facilitating technical workshops and writing clear technical documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong presentation and collaboration skills across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive attitude towards team building and knowledge sharing.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are passionate about working in a mission-critical environment where automation, security, and reliability are top priorities, we would love to hear from you.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Equal opportunity and inclusion&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Everyone we work with — and consider working with — has a right to equal treatment. The hiring and appraisal process at Schuberg Philis is designed to be thorough and equitable, with fair pay, benefits, and opportunities across all demographics. We strive to bring together different nationalities, cultures, religions, genders, abilities, and talents within and across our teams. We welcome colleagues from diverse backgrounds and actively support diversity and inclusion in the tech industry.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Everyone we work with and consider working with has a right to equal treatment. The hiring and appraisal process at Schuberg Philis is designed to be thorough and equitable, implementing fair payment, benefits, and opportunities across all demographics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;It is our desire to be a company that brings together multiple nationalities, cultures, religions, genders, abilities, and talents within and across our teams. We welcome colleagues from diverse backgrounds to join Schuberg Philis and actively support diversity and inclusion in the tech industry.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note: We are not able to consider candidates who are not living and working in the Netherlands. At this moment we are not providing relocation sponsorships.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
