&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;Zero Trust Security:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;Solid understanding of Zero Trust models with hands-on experience deploying and managing Zero Trust tools and practices to secure applications, users, and data.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
