&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;If you bring &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;additional&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt; experience with Kubernetes (AKS or &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;ArgoCD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;), this will broaden the type of customer teams you will potentially land in.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Everyone we work with and consider working with has a right to equal treatment. The hiring and appraisal process at Schuberg Philis is designed to be thorough and equitable, implementing fair payment, benefits, and opportunities across all demographics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;It is our desire to be a company that brings together multiple nationalities, cultures, religions, genders, abilities, and talents within and across our teams. We welcome colleagues from diverse backgrounds to join Schuberg Philis and actively support diversity and inclusion in the tech industry.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;blockquote&gt;Enable teams and customers with secure, reliable cloud foundations&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;At Schuberg Philis, we believe in purposeful responsibility. Every customer has a dedicated team of engineers who take end-to-end responsibility for their mission-critical platforms and applications. For one of our dedicated customer teams, we are looking for a Cloud Engineer AWS to design, build, and maintain the backbone of our services: the AWS landing zone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;As a Cloud Engineer AWS, you are responsible for the cloud infrastructure that powers the tools and services for our clients. You will manage the entire lifecycle of one or more landing zones—both our in-house platforms and client-specific environments—ensuring they are secure, scalable, and highly available. Your focus will be on modern cloud-native technologies, using Infrastructure as Code (IaC) and automation to drive efficiency and reliability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;You will be a key enabler for your team members, providing them with a stable and advanced platform so they can focus on delivering value to the client. This is a hands-on role where you will not only maintain the current environment but also actively shape its future by implementing new services and adopting the latest AWS innovations.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you add value&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Design, build, and manage AWS landing zones using modern Infrastructure as Code (IaC) principles, with a strong focus on AWS CDK and CloudFormation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Manage and operate containerized applications and services using AWS Fargate and other AWS container services (e.g., EKS), ensuring robust and scalable deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Automate operational tasks, CI/CD pipelines, and infrastructure management using scripting languages such as Python, Bash, or PowerShell.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Ensure the stability and performance of the platform through proactive monitoring, logging, and incident management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Manage the full lifecycle of the Linux-based environments, from provisioning and configuration to maintenance and decommissioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Act as a technical advisor within the team, guiding colleagues on cloud best practices, security, and architectural decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Collaborate in a Git-driven workflow, using tools like GitLab and GitHub.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you make the difference&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;You are passionate about automation and automation and building resilient, mission-critical systems. You are not simply following best practices—you set them. Taking ownership, you make the platform invisible, so your team can be visible in their impact&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Proven track record as a System Engineer, Cloud Engineer, or DevOps Engineer&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;in a complex, mission-critical AWS environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Strong, hands-on experience with Infrastructure as Code, particularly with AWS CDK and/or CloudFormation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Proven experience with AWS container services, with a strong focus on AWS Fargate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Deep knowledge of Linux system administration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Proficiency in one or more scripting languages: Python, Bash, or PowerShell.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Solid understanding of CI/CD principles, configuration management, and monitoring concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Familiarity with tools like Datadog, Splunk, Okta, GitLab or GitHub is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Legacy tool experience such as Chef or Octopus is appreciated, but not a must.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Ready to take 100% responsibility, together? We look forward to hearing from you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Everyone we work with and consider working with has a right to equal treatment. The hiring and appraisal process at Schuberg Philis is designed to be thorough and equitable, implementing fair payment, benefits, and opportunities across all demographics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;It is our desire to be a company that brings together multiple nationalities, cultures, religions, genders, abilities, and talents within and across our teams. We welcome colleagues from diverse backgrounds to join Schuberg Philis and actively support diversity and inclusion in the tech industry.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note: We are not able to consider candidates who are not living and working in the Netherlands. At this moment we are not providing relocation sponsorships.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;Build the fundament for our Azure Services&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Schuberg Philis, we specialize in&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://schubergphilis.com/en/stories/jan-jacob-bos-on-being-a-mission-critical-engineer-and-an-ingredient-critical-hobby-chef&quot;&gt;mission-critical IT&lt;/a&gt;, partnering closely with our customers to ensure their most vital systems run smoothly and securely. Our engineers are T-shaped professionals who thrive at the intersection of depth and breadth, combining deep&amp;nbsp;expertise&amp;nbsp;in their fields with a collaborative mindset to ensure 100% customer satisfaction.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In our central Services&amp;nbsp;we&amp;nbsp;design,&amp;nbsp;build,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;maintain&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;reusable digital platforms&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;digitals assets&amp;nbsp;that empower our customer teams. One of&amp;nbsp;them is&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;Cloud&amp;nbsp;Enablement&amp;nbsp;Platform: a set of standardized, secure, and opinionated&amp;nbsp;building blocks and services needed to&amp;nbsp;successfully service a cloud environment&amp;nbsp;used&amp;nbsp;by&amp;nbsp;many customers and environments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Azure Platform Engineer, you work in this Services team and help shape and evolve the codebase for these platforms, services, and assets. You engage actively with our engineering community to&amp;nbsp;shape&amp;nbsp;the roadmap and collaborate with customer teams to ensure platform improvements are adopted and proven in real-world, production environments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will you do&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Azure Platform Engineer, you work on the foundations that power mission-critical&amp;nbsp;workloads&amp;nbsp;at scale. You&amp;nbsp;don’t&amp;nbsp;just build&amp;nbsp;infrastructure,&amp;nbsp;you design scalable, reusable platforms&amp;nbsp;and building blocks&amp;nbsp;that work reliably across large, complex environments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your responsibilities may include:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing and building Azure-based platform capabilities that support both cloud-native and hybrid workloads&amp;nbsp;tailored for mission-critical use cases.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creating reusable building blocks (infrastructure, patterns, and tooling) that can be adopted by many teams across different customers, each with their own requirements and constraints.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing and improving CI/CD pipelines and automation that make platform usage safe, predictable, and fast for engineering teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engineer secure-by-design governance models, including identity, permissions, networking, and policy enforcement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to observability, monitoring, and operational standards at platform scale (e.g. Azure Monitor, Datadog).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with customer teams and internal communities to ensure platform features are adopted and effective in real-world production environments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively participate in roadmap discussions, technical decision-making, and continuous platform improvement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&amp;nbsp;you’ll&amp;nbsp;bring&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience with Azure services.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A platform engineering mindset: you think in terms of reusable systems, guardrails, and enablement rather than one-off implementations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing, building, and deploying infrastructure using Infrastructure as Code principles (e.g. Terraform or OpenTofu).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong focus on code quality, including peer reviews, automated testing, and maintainable design.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with CI/CD pipelines (e.g. Azure DevOps, GitLab CI, Github Actions, etc).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in a self-steering environment, taking full ownership of tasks and projects.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eagerness to identify and taking initiative on opportunities for improvement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to collaborate with development and operations teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with engaging internal engineering communities (innersource) to contribute.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with cloud-native and/or hybrid architectures (Azure + on-prem).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with container technologies such as Kubernetes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with general-purpose programming languages such as Python or Go.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AWS.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is centered on Azure platform engineering, with opportunities to broaden into adjacent technologies over time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What can you expect?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;At Schuberg Philis, you’ll join a community of engineers with an awesome combination of exceptionally high security standards, an infatuation with automation, and the power to make a positive, sustainable impact on customers’ business. Due to the nature of our customer engagements, there is no pressure on (billable) hours, but we focus on quality and impact – or how we like to call it “freedom &amp;amp; responsibility”. You know best how to deliver the most value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You’ll also be embedded in a company committed to helping colleagues grow as people and professionals through training, opportunities for knowledge-sharing, and good old-fashioned fun.   &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our offices are high quality workspaces, and we go way beyond what is expected. We have productive equipment, good food and drinks, team outings, family days, labs to experiment with innovative technologies, etc. We’re very active in the AWS community, attending and organizing meetups and conferences, and organizing internal knowledge sharing events.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Everyone we work with and consider working with has a right to equal treatment. The hiring and appraisal process at Schuberg Philis is designed to be thorough and equitable, implementing fair payment, benefits, and opportunities across all demographics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;It is our desire to be a company that brings together multiple nationalities, cultures, religions, genders, abilities, and talents within and across our teams. We welcome colleagues from diverse backgrounds to join Schuberg Philis and actively support diversity and inclusion in the tech industry.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;Build platforms that empower development teams.&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note: We are not able to consider candidates who are not living and working in the Netherlands. At this moment we are not providing relocation sponsorships.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;At Schuberg Philis, we specialize in&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://schubergphilis.com/en/stories/jan-jacob-bos-on-being-a-mission-critical-engineer-and-an-ingredient-critical-hobby-chef&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;mission-critical IT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, partnering closely with our customers to ensure their most vital systems run smoothly and securely. Our engineers are T-shaped professionals who thrive at the intersection of depth and breadth, combining deep expertise in their fields with a collaborative mindset to ensure 100% customer satisfaction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;We are looking for an AWS Platform Engineer who enjoys building and improving platform capabilities, enabling development teams, and taking responsibility for the systems they create and operate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will you do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Enable and support development teams on the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Contribute to building platform capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Work with reusable components such as monitoring, backup, and observability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Contribute during the assessment phase and transition into implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;We are looking for engineers who combine deep technical expertise with a strong service-oriented mindset.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Ideally, you have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;A strong engineering background in AWS cloud environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;A T-shaped skill profile: deep expertise in your core domain combined with broad knowledge across infrastructure, platforms, and operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with Terraform and Infrastructure as Code practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Familiarity with Kubernetes and container platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;A strong DevOps mindset focused on empowering and enabling development teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What can you expect?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;At Schuberg Philis, you’ll join a community of engineers with an awesome combination of exceptionally high security standards, an infatuation with automation, and the power to make a positive, sustainable impact on customers’ business. Due to the nature of our customer engagements, there is no pressure on (billable) hours, but we focus on quality and impact – or how we like to call it “freedom &amp;amp; responsibility”. You know best how to deliver the most value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;You’ll also be embedded in a company committed to helping colleagues grow as people and professionals through training, opportunities for knowledge-sharing, and good old-fashioned fun.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Our offices are high quality workspaces, and we go way beyond what is expected. We have productive equipment, good food and drinks, team outings, family days, labs to experiment with innovative technologies, etc. We’re very active in the AWS community, attending and organizing meetups and conferences, and organizing internal knowledge sharing events.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Everyone we work with and consider working with has a right to equal treatment. The hiring and appraisal process at Schuberg Philis is designed to be thorough and equitable, implementing fair payment, benefits, and opportunities across all demographics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;It is our desire to be a company that brings together multiple nationalities, cultures, religions, genders, abilities, and talents within and across our teams. We welcome colleagues from diverse backgrounds to join Schuberg Philis and actively support diversity and inclusion in the tech industry.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bouw automatisering voor systemen die er écht toe doen&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bij Schuberg Philis werken we aan mission-critical IT: systemen die essentieel zijn voor onze klanten en simpelweg moeten blijven draaien. Dat vraagt om engineers die technisch sterk zijn, graag automatiseren, nieuwsgierig blijven en verantwoordelijkheid nemen over de volledige keten, van applicatie tot onderliggende infrastructuur.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We zoeken engineers die energie krijgen van complexe, bedrijfskritische omgevingen en willen meebouwen aan platformen waar klanten dagelijks op vertrouwen. In een zelfsturend klantteam ontwerp, bouw, run en verbeter je systemen over de volle breedte van de stack. Je automatiseert waar mogelijk, verbetert pipelines en lost problemen op over meerdere lagen, zodat platformen stabiel, veilig en betrouwbaar blijven. Geen silo&#39;s of overdrachten, maar één team dat samen verantwoordelijkheid neemt voor het resultaat.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;/ Wat je gaat doen&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als Mission-Critical Automation Engineer ontwerp, bouw, run en verbeter je platformen die essentieel zijn voor de dagelijkse operatie van onze klanten. Je automatiseert alles wat geautomatiseerd kan worden, lost complexe problemen op over de volledige stack en werkt nauw samen met klantteams. End-to-end verantwoordelijkheid voor stabiliteit, security en betrouwbaarheid hoort daar vanzelfsprekend bij.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In de praktijk betekent dat onder andere:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automatisering bouwen met scripting en configuration management tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Verantwoordelijkheid nemen over de volledige Plan-Build-Run lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complexe problemen oplossen over OS, netwerk, databases, security en applicaties heen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Controlled releases ontwerpen en uitvoeren met Git en pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Platformen veiliger, robuuster en beter onderhoudbaar maken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;/ Wat je meebrengt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Met ervaring in scripting en configuration management tooling zoals PowerShell, Ansible, DSC, Puppet of Chef denk je vanzelf in automatisering. Je gebruikt code om terugkerend werk te elimineren, processen te vereenvoudigen en platformen op een consistente en schaalbare manier te beheren. Je voelt je thuis in een omgeving waar code de voorkeur heeft boven handmatig beheer en hebt ervaring met Git, CI/CD en Infrastructure-as-Code tooling zoals Terraform, Bicep of ARM. Daarbij neem je verantwoordelijkheid voor wat je bouwt en blijf je nieuwsgierig naar hoe systemen zich gedragen in productie.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tegelijk kijk je verder dan je eigen specialisme. Je wilt begrijpen hoe infrastructuur, networking, databases, security, deployments en applicaties samenkomen, en waar ruimte is om systemen verder te verbeteren. Ervaring met containerplatformen zoals Docker en Kubernetes, cloudomgevingen zoals Azure, AWS, of VMWare en security in mission-critical omgevingen is daarbij een mooie aanvulling. In omgevingen waar betrouwbaarheid, veiligheid en continuïteit essentieel zijn, voel jij je op je best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;/ Wie ben jij?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Je bent een engineer die eigenaarschap neemt over wat je bouwt en beheert. Je duikt graag de technische diepte in, maar begrijpt ook hoe applicaties, infrastructuur en bedrijfsprocessen samenkomen. Je kiest liever voor automatisering dan voor handwerk, werkt graag samen met collega&#39;s en klanten, en blijft continu zoeken naar manieren om systemen slimmer, stabieler en beter te maken. Impact maken op bedrijfskritische platformen geeft je energie.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;/&amp;nbsp;What can you expect?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Je komt terecht in een omgeving waar vakmanschap, eigenaarschap en samenwerking centraal staan. Samen met ervaren engineers werk je aan bedrijfskritische systemen, krijg je veel vrijheid om je werk vorm te geven en blijf je jezelf ontwikkelen door dagelijks samen te werken met collega&#39;s die graag kennis delen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Voel jij je thuis in een mission-critical omgeving, waarin stabiliteit, voorspelbaarheid en kwaliteit essentieel zijn? Dan komen we graag met je in contact!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Everyone we work with and consider working with has a right to equal treatment. The hiring and appraisal process at Schuberg Philis is designed to be thorough and equitable, implementing fair payment, benefits, and opportunities across all demographics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;It is our desire to be a company that brings together multiple nationalities, cultures, religions, genders, abilities, and talents within and across our teams. We welcome colleagues from diverse backgrounds to join Schuberg Philis and actively support diversity and inclusion in the tech industry.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;AtriCure, Inc. provides innovative technologies for the treatment of Afib and related conditions. Afib affects more than 33 million people worldwide. Electrophysiologists and cardiothoracic surgeons around the globe use AtriCure technologies for the treatment of Afib and reduction of Afib related complications. AtriCure’s Isolator® Synergy™ Ablation System is the first medical device to receive FDA approval for the treatment of persistent Afib. AtriCure’s AtriClip® Left Atrial Appendage Exclusion System products are the most widely sold LAA management devices worldwide. AtriCure’s Hybrid AF™ Therapy is a minimally invasive procedure that provides a lasting solution for long-standing persistent Afib patients. AtriCure’s cryoICE cryoSPHERE® probe is cleared for temporary ablation of peripheral nerves to block pain, providing pain relief in cardiac and thoracic procedures. For more information, visit AtriCure.com or follow us on Twitter -----
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We foster a culture of inclusion by embracing diverse experiences and individuals where everyone’s authentic self is welcome. We offer supporting programs and resources that provide enriching and equitable opportunities for each person to contribute professionally and personally.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;POSITION SUMMARY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Supply Chain Coordinator will be responsible for the inbound process, coordinating logistics and inventory activities and interacting with internal and external customers. The successful candidate will work full time in AtriCure&#39;s Service Center in Den Bosch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ESSENTIAL FUNCTIONS OF THE POSITION:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Supervise warehouse/customer service activities outsourced to the 3PL&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coordinate Rework and Quarantine disposition activities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coordinate item master data activities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Marketing &amp;amp; Professional Education Outbounds&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Weekly Stock Reconciliation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work closely with Warehouse operator&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Assist/Back up Logistics/Operations/Sales Operations activities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ADDITIONAL ESSENTIAL FUNCTIONS OF THE POSITION:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work under fast-paced conditions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to make decisions and use good judgment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to prioritize various duties and multitask as required Ability to successfully work with internal and external customers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BASIC QUALIFICATIONS SKILLS &amp;amp; REQUIREMENTS&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MBO degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Minimum 3-5 years&#39; experience in supply chain, customer service or sales support Strong written/verbal communication in English&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to work in a variety of systems (ERP systems, CRM, Service Management Systems, WMS/TMS)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Basic import and export knowledge&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to commute to primary place of work at AtriCure Service Center in Den Bosch, The&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Strong MS Excel skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Netherlands Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€40.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€48.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;AtriCure has a variety of benefits available for US based employees and their families. Examples include Medical &amp;amp; Dental beginning day 1 of employment, 401K plus match, 30 days of paid Parental Leave, in addition to maternity leave, for new moms and dads, Volunteer Time off, Pet Insurance, and more. Corporate-based employees also have full access to our on-site fitness center and cafeteria. To see a complete list of our benefits, please visit our careers website:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.atricure.com/careers-atricure/benefits&quot;&gt;https://www.atricure.com/careers-atricure/benefits&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;AtriCure participates in the federal E-Verify program to confirm the identity of and employment authorization of all newly hired employees. For further information about the E-Verify program, please click here https://www.e-verify.gov AtriCure is an Equal Employment Opportunity/Affirmative Action employer and provides Drug Free Workplaces. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, national or ethnic origin, age, protected veteran status, status as an individual with disability, sexual orientation, gender identity or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local law(s).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You may access our global privacy policy here:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.atricure.com/privacy&quot;&gt;https://www.atricure.com/privacy&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;AtriCure, Inc. provides innovative technologies for the treatment of Afib and related conditions. Afib affects more than 33 million people worldwide. Electrophysiologists and cardiothoracic surgeons around the globe use AtriCure technologies for the treatment of Afib and reduction of Afib related complications. AtriCure’s Isolator® Synergy™ Ablation System is the first medical device to receive FDA approval for the treatment of persistent Afib. AtriCure’s AtriClip® Left Atrial Appendage Exclusion System products are the most widely sold LAA management devices worldwide. AtriCure’s Hybrid AF™ Therapy is a minimally invasive procedure that provides a lasting solution for long-standing persistent Afib patients. AtriCure’s cryoICE cryoSPHERE® probe is cleared for temporary ablation of peripheral nerves to block pain, providing pain relief in cardiac and thoracic procedures. For more information, visit AtriCure.com or follow us on Twitter -----
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We foster a culture of inclusion by embracing diverse experiences and individuals where everyone’s authentic self is welcome. We offer supporting programs and resources that provide enriching and equitable opportunities for each person to contribute professionally and personally.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;POSITION SUMMARY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The AtriCure Legal Affairs Team provides responsive, practical, solution-oriented legal support to all departments and entities within this global, US-headquartered company. The team manages a broad range of matters, including transactional work, employment, corporate governance, litigation, and strategic initiatives. Under the supervision of the Deputy General Counsel, the Associate General Counsel advises and supports internal, international clients; drafts and negotiates a broad range of agreements; handles and helps manage complex legal matters; leads cross-functional projects; develops policies and procedures; and monitors emerging legislation and legal developments applicable to the company. The ideal candidate must be agile, responsive, solution-oriented and able to work effectively with a wide range of departments and personnel, both within and outside the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ESSENTIAL FUNCTIONS OF THE POSITION:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for contracting for AtriCure’s international subsidiaries, including, but not limited to, drafting and negotiating commercial agreements, agreements related to HCP engagement, and clinical trial agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advises the international Human Resources team on employment law matters throughout the EMEA and Asia Pacific regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assists with managing employment-related claims and litigation, as assigned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manages legal support for day-to-day contracting needs, including template preparation and maintenance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Counsels internal clients throughout the contract lifecycle, including negotiation, contract management, and compliance; directly negotiates and drafts contracts on behalf of business units, including, but not limited to, commercial, clinical, regulatory, scientific, and medical affairs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develops policies and procedures related to the Legal Affairs Team’s scope of work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Counsels senior managers and executives on legal matters, including employment and regulatory issues, changes in law affecting their areas of responsibility, and the intersection of legal developments with company policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stays current on laws and regulations applicable to AtriCure and assigned business groups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manages outside counsel assigned to internal projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;May manage departmental personnel, including attorneys and support staff.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;May provide broad legal support to a specific business organization or group.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ADDITIONAL ESSENTIAL FUNCTIONS OF THE POSITION:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintains regular and predictable work performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Works effectively in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uses sound judgment to make decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritizes duties and manages multiple responsibilities as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Works collaboratively and effectively with others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BASIC QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Juris Doctor (or equivalent) from an accredited institution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;License to practice law.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ten years of progressively responsible experience in a law firm or comparable corporate legal department.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience negotiating complex contracts related to healthcare, research, or grant work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in a fast-paced environment while exercising sound judgment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to prioritize and reprioritize duties, manage multiple tasks, and clearly communicate changes to affected stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident, goal-oriented, self-motivated team player with a service-and-solution focused mindset and the ability to lead or follow as the situation requires.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Microsoft programs, including Outlook, Word, Excel, and PowerPoint.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong verbal and written communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently, learn quickly, and take on new challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel up to 30%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PREFERRED QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the medical device, pharmaceutical, clinical research, or related industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience advising on employment matters and managing employment-related litigation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience advising on international expansion projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role can be based in the UK, Germany or The Netherlands, close to international airports to facilitate travel.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Netherlands Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€160.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€175.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;AtriCure has a variety of benefits available for US based employees and their families. Examples include Medical &amp;amp; Dental beginning day 1 of employment, 401K plus match, 30 days of paid Parental Leave, in addition to maternity leave, for new moms and dads, Volunteer Time off, Pet Insurance, and more. Corporate-based employees also have full access to our on-site fitness center and cafeteria. To see a complete list of our benefits, please visit our careers website:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.atricure.com/careers-atricure/benefits&quot;&gt;https://www.atricure.com/careers-atricure/benefits&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
