&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,9,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;10,9,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-2827&quot;&gt;Practical experience in DevSecOps and proficiency in at least one scripting language like JavaScript or Go&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
