&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you a Character Designer with a passion for making games? Here at Escape Velocity, we are looking for someone to join the team, who will get to design characters that play a big part in the experience of gameplay that sit at the heart of our project.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we will do together:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Find opportunities to bring exciting new gameplay hooks to characters within the game.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and oversee the player&#39;s combat mechanics, weapons, and abilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with animators, gameplay programmers, and other teams to prototype and implement combat features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take character designs through a full development cycle from concept to release.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use metrics, player feedback, and a multitude of diverse analytics to improve and refine the design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience as a Character Designer on multiple titles for at least 2 years, with a proven history of taking characters from ideation to shipped.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a passion for third-person combat mechanics and have thoroughly played a wide variety of different titles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of bringing uniquely thematic characters to life in video games.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A thorough understanding of creating strengths, weaknesses and counterplay within the character experience.&lt;/li&gt;
