&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building a culture of play and seeking an imaginative, skilful, and versatile Senior AI Designer to join our remote team. If you share a passion for developing ground-breaking worlds and player experiences, then this may be for you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Will Do Together:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create exciting new enemies for a unique, high-mobility action game.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create design specs and technical documents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work alongside other designers and engineers on NPC creation, scripting, and behaviour trees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with our producers to plan future work and identify dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze user data, feedback, and heatmaps to understand how the game’s AI is functioning and what changes need to be made.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pitch detailed new AI designs to leads and directors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for competitive and/or strategic multiplayer games.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional game design or AI game development experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical expertise in Unreal and/or equivalent AAA game engines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior-level proficiency in blueprint scripting and AI behaviour trees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong oral and written communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A professional understanding of competitive multiplayer games and their use of NPCs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background or education in game design or programming.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
