&lt;h6&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;At Suitsupply, we combine radical style with radical technology.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt; We don’t just follow trends; we find our own perfect fit. We are looking for a Tech Lead who is a proactive, hands-on expert ready to own their domain. Whether you are a Backend or a Fullstack specialist with a deep .NET foundation, you will bridge the gap between technical strategy and business value to help us on our journey to becoming the global leader in tailored experiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you will do:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Ownership:&amp;nbsp;You take end-to-end responsibility for the technical health of your domain, ensuring solutions are robust, scalable, and aligned with business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architecture &amp;amp; Engineering Excellence: You lead architectural and design decisions, with a strong focus on event-driven patterns, scalability, security, and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on Leadership: You actively build and operate our systems, solve complex challenges, and proactively identify and reduce technical risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quality &amp;amp; Best Practices: You champion high engineering standards: clean code, CI/CD, automated testing, documentation, and pragmatic DevOps practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-Enabled Delivery: You lead by example in adopting AI-powered development tools (e.g. Cursor, Copilot, Antigravity) to improve developer productivity and code quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentorship &amp;amp; Collaboration: You coach engineers, contribute to chapters, and work closely with Engineering Managers and Architects to keep teams aligned and moving fast.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operational Excellence: You ensure systems are observable and reliable, with strong monitoring, alerting, logging, and incident response practices.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Security: You apply cloud-native security best practices, including OAuth, identity-centric access control, and secure secrets management, to build systems that scale safely and remain maintainable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Devops:&amp;nbsp;You apply pragmatic DevOps practices, including infrastructure as code, cost-conscious scaling, and high-availability design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Who you are:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced Tech Lead with 5+ years in software engineering and 2+ years in a comparable leadership role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong in our stack: .NET, Azure (Functions, Service Bus, Cosmos DB), event-driven architectures, and SaaS integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architecture-minded, able to simplify complex problems into clear, actionable solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fullstack experience (React, Next.js, TypeScript) is a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communicator who explains technical decisions in a way that resonates with product and business stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will get:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autonomy: We empower you to take ownership, make meaningful decisions, and drive impact without layers of sign-off.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth: We see your potential as a key asset. At Suitsupply, you’ll have abundant opportunities to learn, grow, and excel in a supportive environment that encourages development at every step.&lt;/li&gt;
