&lt;h6&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;If you’re a proactive, problem-solving team player who likes to take ownership of your work, this could be the job for you. As a senior member, you not only bring an abundance of expertise to your team, but you also know how to inspire, uplift and bring out the best in your colleagues. Always striving for continuous improvement, you adapt to change easily and are always eager to learn. In a flat organization like Suitsupply, there are ample opportunities to broaden your horizons by moving between different teams, and strengthen your skill set within the wider organization. Suitsupply is growing in every aspect IT-wise, and therefore, we&#39;re looking for Senior Software Engineers to join us on the journey of becoming the global tailoring expert.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;
