&lt;h6&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As Senior Paid Media Manager, reporting to the Director of Customer Acquisition, you will own the strategy and execution of Suitsupply&#39;s paid social and paid search channels across EMEA and US markets, taking end-to-end ownership of how campaigns are planned, launched, and optimized. In this senior individual contributor role, you will direct the AI agents and agentic tooling that increasingly run execution on Meta and Google, setting the guardrails, validating decisions, and stepping in manually when needed. You will manage budgets with full accountability for ROAS and CPA, lead creative testing, and build the incrementality and attribution frameworks that show where growth truly comes from. Working closely with brand, content, and design teams, your work will directly shape how customers discover Suitsupply around the world. This is a rare opportunity to bring your experience in-house and help define the future of AI-driven performance marketing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;
