&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Own the paid media strategy and roadmap across Meta and Google (Search and Performance Max) for EMEA and US markets, increasingly executed through AI agents rather than direct platform work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:25}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Direct campaign execution through AI agents and agentic tooling: set the goals, budgets, and guardrails they operate within, review their decisions, and take manual control when needed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:25}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
