&lt;h6&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Junior Product Manager – Custom Made to strengthen and evolve our Custom-Made digital experience across stores and e-commerce. In this role, you will work closely with Style Advisors, retail teams, and engineering to improve the end-to-end Custom-Made journey - from &lt;/span&gt;product configuration to order execution. You will translate deep customer and brand understanding into digital improvements that elevate both the in-store experience and operational excellence.&amp;nbsp;This role is a strong fit for Style Advisors or Trainers ready to transition into Product Management.&amp;nbsp;The ideal candidate has a strong affinity for Custom Made and the Suitsupply brand, understands tailoring and clienteling dynamics, and proactively leverages AI in their way of working.&lt;/h6&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Style Advisors and store ops teams to identify friction points and optimize workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support discovery and new product initiatives, and define, track, and monitor product KPI with guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with stakeholders to ensure digital solutions reflect and elevate the Suitsupply brand and in-store experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate retail and customer needs into clear user stories for engineers and AI agents, addressing UI/UX, configuration logic, and system integrations - you will be supported in learning how to structure this.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run sprint reviews, manage the backlog, work with engineering teams in Agile sprints, and navigate cross-team dependencies to release frequent, high-quality product improvements - you will learn how to work in this way as part of your onboarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI natively in your workflow (e.g., for ticket creation, structuring requirements, and analysis) to increase speed and clarity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2–4 years of experience in a regional role or digital projects, retail, or a strong affinity with digital tools and workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starter mindset with a proactive and hands-on approach; comfortable collaborating and communicating with a wide range of stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of Custom Made processes, tailoring, and the Suitsupply brand. Thinks from user perspective. Experience as a Style Advisor or in-store role is a strong pre.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI- and technically curious with a strong learning mindset — you won’t write code, but you are eager to understand how systems connect and feel comfortable working closely with engineers during refinements and sprint planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;No prior Product Management experience is required - we will support you in learning how to work with engineers, Agile processes, and product tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Business, Technology, or a related field, or equivalent experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autonomy:&amp;nbsp;We empower you to take ownership, make meaningful decisions, and drive impact close to our stores and customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth:&amp;nbsp;You will develop within a high-performance digital product environment, increasing your business impact and decision scope over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Corporate Social Responsibility:&amp;nbsp;Our commitment to sustainability and ethical business is unwavering. We work exclusively with suppliers who uphold the highest standards, in alignment with the International Labour Organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Style:&amp;nbsp;Immerse yourself in a world of beautifully crafted, high-quality products, and enjoy a 40% discount on Suitsupply products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Compensation: We offer a competitive salary of &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;based on relevant skills and experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
