&lt;h6&gt;This is not a traditional Controller position. You will play a key role in building and improving our&amp;nbsp;FP&amp;amp;A data and systems landscape, turning complex transactional data into scalable reporting and actionable insights.&amp;nbsp;Your focus is on&amp;nbsp;data models, system logic, and process automation, not manual reporting.&lt;/h6&gt;
