&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Catawiki, every day brings the extraordinary! Whether it’s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/583-sports-memorabilia&quot;&gt;Daniel Ricciardo’s Formula 1 Car&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/579-fossils&quot;&gt;Woolly Mammoth’s Skeleton&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/l/10035805&quot;&gt;Lady Gaga&#39;s Jumpsuit&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/583-sports-memorabilia&quot;&gt;Usain Bolt’s running shoe&lt;/a&gt;, we encounter exceptional objects every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a one-of-a-kind marketplace for buying and selling special objects. Each week, more than 100,000 unique items are auctioned, all carefully curated by our passionate in-house experts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Having sold over 25 million unique objects, our mission is to become the world’s most popular destination for special objects. As a growing, diverse and sustainable scale-up, we proudly live by three core values. If these values resonate with you, we’d love to explore how you can join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking ownership and driving impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being open to change and feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being passionate about our mission and our customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to own the numbers behind extraordinary objects?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Catawiki, every day brings something extraordinary. From rare collectibles to iconic memorabilia, millions of special objects pass through our marketplace. Behind the scenes, our Finance team helps keep everything running smoothly as we continue to grow internationally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a hands-on Senior Financial Accountant to join our Accounting &amp;amp; Reporting team. This role is ideal for someone with strong accounting fundamentals who enjoys bringing structure to processes, takes ownership of their work from end to end and is comfortable keeping both the details and the bigger picture in view in a fast-moving international marketplace environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You won’t just process numbers; you’ll help keep our financial backbone strong while contributing to smarter and more scalable Finance processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you’ll make an impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will become a trusted owner of selected accounting areas and help ensure Catawiki’s financial reporting remains accurate, reliable and scalable as the business continues to grow internationally. Beyond the month-end close, you will help strengthen processes, improve reporting quality and partner with stakeholders across Finance and the wider business to solve accounting and reporting challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your core Accounting &amp;amp; Reporting responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will take ownership of selected accounting areas and contribute to accurate, reliable and scalable financial reporting across Catawiki’s international business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own selected month-end close activities, including journal entries, accruals, reconciliations and balance sheet reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage accounting areas or entities through the close process with a strong focus on accuracy, completeness and timely delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a key Finance partner to Payroll, ensuring accurate payroll processing and payment controls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse financial movements and variances and provide clear insights to stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure accounting activities are performed in line with internal policies and reporting requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support internal and external audits by preparing documentation and coordinating follow-ups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with external accounting partners for foreign entities and support local reporting activities where needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Finance and business stakeholders to resolve accounting and reporting questions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use Workday Financials in your daily work and support process improvements where relevant&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Accounting &amp;amp; Reporting in cross-functional projects and assess the impact on Finance processes and controls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify risks, issues and opportunities for simplification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive improvements in Finance processes, controls and reporting to support scalable and efficient ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will gain broad exposure to accounting and reporting in a growing international marketplace.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What makes this role exciting?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Broad scope:&lt;/strong&gt; Exposure to multiple accounting areas, entities, international reporting topics and business initiatives, giving you a clear view of what’s happening across Finance and the wider business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; High level of responsibility and autonomy across selected accounting areas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; You won’t just prepare journals; you’ll help translate complex financial activity into reliable insights, strong controls and better business decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process improvement:&lt;/strong&gt; Plenty of opportunity to improve, simplify and automate how Finance works&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International environment:&lt;/strong&gt; Work in a growing marketplace with cross-border activities and stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Join a supportive, down-to-earth Finance team that values ownership, openness and continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Catawiki continues to grow internationally, Finance is evolving alongside the business with increasing focus on scalability, automation and stronger operational insight.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone with strong accounting fundamentals who combines ownership, analytical thinking and attention to detail with a pragmatic, hands-on approach.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience &amp;amp; background&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Finance, Accounting, Business Economics or similar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid experience in financial accounting, preferably in an international, marketplace, e-commerce, platform or tech environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with month-end close activities, including journals, accruals and reconciliations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of accounting principles; IFRS knowledge is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting audits and working with internal or external stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Workday Financials is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English, both written and spoken&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail, combined with the ability to keep a clear overview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured, pragmatic and reliable way of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to independently manage accounting areas end to end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and ability to explain financial movements clearly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with different stakeholders across teams and functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive in identifying issues, following up on open items and improving processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in a fast-paced and evolving environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative mindset and willingness to share accounting knowledge with the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong sense of ownership and accountability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in data, automation and AI, and how these can improve financial processes and reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where you’ll work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll join the Accounting &amp;amp; Reporting team within Finance, based in the Netherlands. We work in a hybrid model with fixed office days in Amsterdam.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For this role, we are looking for someone based in the Netherlands who is comfortable working in a hybrid setup and travelling to our Amsterdam office twice a week. Some additional in-office presence may be needed during onboarding and key closing periods.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text text-align-left &quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You&#39;ll Love Working with Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create a visible impact &lt;/strong&gt;by working at scale in a global organisation serving millions of customers across 80+ categories. In our flat structure, every role has a broad scope and directly impacts both our customers and the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn and grow&lt;/strong&gt; through our Learning &amp;amp; Development initiatives, including clear development plans and mentorship programmes to support your career progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A culture of connection defines us&lt;/strong&gt;. We’re a passionate, diverse team of 800+ Catawikians representing 60+ nationalities. We foster an inclusive and queer-friendly environment where everyone is encouraged to bring their full self to work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celebrate life’s moments with us. &lt;/strong&gt;You’ll receive a €100 Catavoucher when you join, a €50 Catavoucher on your birthday, and an extra day off each year to “Pursue Your Passion&lt;strong&gt;”&lt;/strong&gt;. We also offer additional leave for key work anniversaries and important life events. Benefits may vary by location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Offices and Way of Working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Our vibrant offices in Amsterdam and Lisbon are designed to inspire collaboration. Most Catawikians operate in a hybrid setup, combining office-based and remote work, with a minimum of two days per week in the office, unless a role is explicitly stated as fully remote or fully office-based.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interested?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Apply with an English CV and Cover Letter. By applying, you agree to &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/conditions/applicant-privacy-policy.pdf&quot;&gt;Catawiki’s Applicant Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply anyway. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Catawiki, every day brings the extraordinary! Whether it’s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/583-sports-memorabilia&quot;&gt;Daniel Ricciardo’s Formula 1 Car&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/579-fossils&quot;&gt;Woolly Mammoth’s Skeleton&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/l/10035805&quot;&gt;Lady Gaga&#39;s Jumpsuit&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/583-sports-memorabilia&quot;&gt;Usain Bolt’s running shoe&lt;/a&gt;, we encounter exceptional objects every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a one-of-a-kind marketplace for buying and selling special objects. Each week, more than 100,000 unique items are auctioned, all carefully curated by our passionate in-house experts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Having sold over 25 million unique objects, our mission is to become the world’s most popular destination for special objects. As a growing, diverse and sustainable scale-up, we proudly live by three core values. If these values resonate with you, we’d love to explore how you can join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking ownership and driving impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being open to change and feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being passionate about our mission and our customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;As Senior Director, People Operations, you will lead the operational backbone of the People function across Catawiki’s operating countries. You will set the strategic direction for People Operations, Payroll, Reward and Benefits, Compliance, Employee relations &amp;amp; Wellbeing, Facilities and Workplace Experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;You will strengthen scalable and compliant operations while maintaining a consistent employee experience. This includes improving processes through automation, AI and self-service, strengthening governance and controls, and enabling better decisions through people insights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and own the strategic roadmap for People Operations, payroll, well-being and facilities, aligned with the Business and People strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop the People Operations, payroll and facilities teams and well-being expert, establishing clear priorities, ownership, service standards and ways of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthen people operations across the employee lifecycle, including payroll, benefits, compensation operations, documentation and compliance, using automation, AI and self-service to improve scalability and efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with employment legislation, payroll, tax, audit and people-related ESG requirements, partnering with HRIS, Finance, Legal and external providers to maintain strong controls and resolve issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee employee relations, well-being and absence management, providing senior direction on complex cases and using data and insights to identify risks and improve policies and practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the facilities and workplace experience strategy for the Amsterdam and Lisbon offices, ensuring effective operations and appropriate standards for health, safety, security and hybrid working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a senior escalation point for complex people, operational and workplace matters, working closely with the CPO on employee relations and Works Council topics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evolve and implement the reward and benefits strategy with the CPO, including compensation visibility, role and salary benchmarking, and sustainable, data-informed improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring 12+ years of relevant experience in an international, fast-growing organisation, with deep expertise in People Operations and experience in areas such as Reward, Employee Relations, well-being or Facilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate experience leading multi-country People Operations at scale, including payroll, benefits, compensation operations, compliance and process improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply strong knowledge of employment law and employee relations practices in the Netherlands and other European countries, with sound judgement on complex cases and when to involve legal specialists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring experience with reward and benefits programmes inside and outside the Netherlands, including role and salary benchmarking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data, automation and emerging technologies, including AI, to challenge existing processes, improve decision-making and build scalable ways of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate strategy into practical execution while managing priorities effectively in a fast-paced, hybrid and international environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate effectively and build trusted relationships with employees, managers, senior leaders and external partners, with professional fluency in English; Dutch is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our People team of around 40 people, mainly based across Amsterdam and Lisbon, works collaboratively and openly, using data and AI to inform our thinking while staying closely connected to the needs of the business. We also make time to connect socially and enjoy working together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our senior leaders combine strategic direction with hands-on operational execution, with a focus on clear ownership, speed and scalable foundations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our People team use data, insights and employee feedback to identify risks and opportunities and turn them into practical improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In this Sr Director role, you&#39;ll work closely with the CPO, People Leadership Team, People Business Partners, Talent Acquisition, HRIS, IT, Finance, Legal and business leaders across Catawiki.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where You’ll Be&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;This is a hybrid role based in Amsterdam. You will work from our Amsterdam HQ a minimum of 2 days per week.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text text-align-left &quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You&#39;ll Love Working with Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create a visible impact &lt;/strong&gt;by working at scale in a global organisation serving millions of customers across 80+ categories. In our flat structure, every role has a broad scope and directly impacts both our customers and the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn and grow&lt;/strong&gt; through our Learning &amp;amp; Development initiatives, including clear development plans and mentorship programmes to support your career progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A culture of connection defines us&lt;/strong&gt;. We’re a passionate, diverse team of 800+ Catawikians representing 60+ nationalities. We foster an inclusive and queer-friendly environment where everyone is encouraged to bring their full self to work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celebrate life’s moments with us. &lt;/strong&gt;You’ll receive a €100 Catavoucher when you join, a €50 Catavoucher on your birthday, and an extra day off each year to “Pursue Your Passion&lt;strong&gt;”&lt;/strong&gt;. We also offer additional leave for key work anniversaries and important life events. Benefits may vary by location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Offices and Way of Working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Our vibrant offices in Amsterdam and Lisbon are designed to inspire collaboration. Most Catawikians operate in a hybrid setup, combining office-based and remote work, with a minimum of two days per week in the office, unless a role is explicitly stated as fully remote or fully office-based.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interested?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Apply with an English CV and Cover Letter. By applying, you agree to &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/conditions/applicant-privacy-policy.pdf&quot;&gt;Catawiki’s Applicant Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply anyway. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Catawiki, every day brings the extraordinary! Whether it’s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/583-sports-memorabilia&quot;&gt;Daniel Ricciardo’s Formula 1 Car&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/579-fossils&quot;&gt;Woolly Mammoth’s Skeleton&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/l/10035805&quot;&gt;Lady Gaga&#39;s Jumpsuit&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/583-sports-memorabilia&quot;&gt;Usain Bolt’s running shoe&lt;/a&gt;, we encounter exceptional objects every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a one-of-a-kind marketplace for buying and selling special objects. Each week, more than 100,000 unique items are auctioned, all carefully curated by our passionate in-house experts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Having sold over 25 million unique objects, our mission is to become the world’s most popular destination for special objects. As a growing, diverse and sustainable scale-up, we proudly live by three core values. If these values resonate with you, we’d love to explore how you can join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking ownership and driving impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being open to change and feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being passionate about our mission and our customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Data Story&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;With ten-thousands of active items on auction every day, hundred-thousands of bids, millions of users, and billions of events, the Catawiki platform generates vast amounts of data. We collect this data centrally, using it to generate business insights, as well as powering machine learning models that enhance our user experience, optimize our workflows, and keep our platform safe. We believe in creating flexible models that can be applied to a variety of use cases, and in experimentation and iteration to hit the ground running and continually improve the tools we build.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The Data Team, which covers the full data spectrum of Machine Learning, Analysis and Data Engineering, has a clear a mission within Catawiki:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;: We believe that by using data in a smart way, we can build the best Catawiki possible. We want to have impact and see opportunities everywhere.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;: We are builders, thinkers and talkers. We collaborate closely with every department to create value for our customers. We think big and hold ourselves to high standards, because our work really matters for the future of the company.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&lt;/strong&gt;: As a result we create business value by delivering scalable, robust models and actionable insights and predictions. We help the company to find opportunities and understand success, and we empower everyone to use data to be successful.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;So what&#39;s the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;As a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Machine Learning Data Scientist&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; in the Data Team at Catawiki you will focus on delivering scalable and impactful data products. You’ll work closely with our product and development teams while implementing your work. This includes:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Building production-ready models that apply machine learning and advanced data science techniques within our product offering by writing robust and scalable code.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Finding data science opportunities by exploring our extensive mobile and web data, and applying machine learning and advanced statistics to tackle these real-world business problems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Being pragmatic when needed but also able to go deep into a problem, applying your expert knowledge of machine learning techniques&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Working with cross-disciplinary teams involving product owners, developers, UX designers, and business analysts in identifying improvements and new use cases for ML&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Deploy scalable models using Kubernetes on cloud infrastructure, producing real-time, asynchronous, and batch predictions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Who you are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You are an all-around data scientist with 5+ years of experience who is as comfortable diving into the internals of a model implementation as discussing new opportunities for ML with product stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Can use your broad skill set to solve challenging ML problems and have a high throughput.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Are familiar with a range of different ML techniques and use that to select a good solution for their projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Are able to considers the operating/deployment constraints of large models and implement solutions accordingly&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Give guidance and unblock others in your team by supporting them with advice and new techniques.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Have a strong quantitative background (statistics, ML, sciences, etc.)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Are fluent in Python and capable with SQL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Have deployed ML models serving real time responses on a large scale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Have demonstrable experience in building robust data products that created value for the company you worked for.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The following are a plus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Proven ability to extract meaning from very big datasets with little engineering support.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Experience with one or more of the following: PyTorch/Tensorflow, LightFM, Git, Docker, Kubernetes, Google BigQuery, MySQL, Spark, Airflow, Kafka, nginx, CI/CD,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;An entrepreneurial mindset that enables you to get things done, even if that requires actions outside your own area or comfort zone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Where you&#39;ll be&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in Amsterdam&amp;nbsp; but we can offer remote work from the following countries: France, Germany, Belgium, Italy, Spain and The U.K. We also offer an excellent relocation package for people living outside of the Netherlands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Here’s what we can offer you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This is your chance to become part of a fast but sustainable growing tech company! You will have an exciting role in a young, fast-growing, dynamic &amp;amp; international organisation. You&#39;ll be part of an enthusiastic, highly motivated team of 800+ international Catawikians; you&#39;ll have big responsibilities and can really create something. Additionally you can expect:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An attractive Stock Options package &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
