&lt;p&gt;This is a hybrid role based in Amsterdam. You will work from our Amsterdam HQ a minimum of 2 days per week.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text text-align-left &quot;&gt;
