&lt;div class=&quot;css-156koi1&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ak-renderer-document&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d26a9d785c20&quot;&gt;As a Graduate Software Engineer, your work is mission-critical at our firm. You will work on systems that operate in live financial markets, where speed, reliability and precision directly affect trading outcomes. You will collaborate with traders, researchers and engineers to understand problems, challenge assumptions and build solutions that can respond to changing market conditions in real time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;404&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3a49ebf67196&quot;&gt;Optiver is building with cutting edge AI technology in the most competitive, data rich landscapes in the world: financial markets. That means no two days are the same, and every day brings new, exciting technical challenges to solve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;639&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3c2a13e07f02&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;639&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3c2a13e07f02&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;655&quot; data-local-id=&quot;cb84f279a4e2&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Your onboarding&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;672&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d0e3309fbabe&quot;&gt;You will participate in Optiver’s comprehensive &lt;a class=&quot;_2hGPVj98eZ _2i3C1kYbGa _2kH23qT6kp _1ubuxonXvL _34b3D2vc3e _1NDpvb6wH8 _2wtOC9vc3e _3e11vU6wH8 _0hSAgbHZdu _00uqCY98eZ _3xtjKN0Rl6 _0H9qDF6wH8 _24h04i2Njc _1mT5xdRAKS _0WKd3G4z3T _0bjKvDcjp5 _1UtDYzM7Tp _32C2rk98eZ _0i9AWA0Rl6 _0mm6KQ6wH8 _10n1R5M7Tp _0DCa9D98eZ _3932vvYbGa _02cRtH6wH8 _0clgaMM7Tp _3WzCGi98eZ _0NqVRtYbGa _3BKYwu6wH8 _0CMRbkAwSC _2nTuUYWfPD _3ADzdEWfPD _1warJ9WfPD _4scvAwWyeI&quot; href=&quot;https://optiver.com/working-at-optiver/career-hub/kickstart-your-tech-career-with-the-global-optiver-academy-technology/&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Global Academy&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and be equipped with the knowledge needed to make an impact the moment you join your team. The comprehensive training covers trading theory and Optiver’s tech stack to hone your skills for your role. In addition, you will be paired with a dedicated mentor who will empower you to take ownership of your work and make a difference.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1067&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7b8064a71881&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1092&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a94e7df1b973&quot;&gt;Build simple, well-architected solutions alongside traders, researchers, risk analysts and engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1197&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3b6c84fd78f9&quot;&gt;Use frontier agentic tooling, and build your own agents, skills and workflows, to solve problems across the trading stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1323&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c8c50babc01b&quot;&gt;Improve performance, reliability and maintainability as markets and system requirements evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1422&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a75a001c5194&quot;&gt;Contribute tools and capabilities that other engineers and teams can reuse.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1501&quot; data-local-id=&quot;22b4a6e27c7d&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1501&quot; data-local-id=&quot;22b4a6e27c7d&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What you’ll get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1518&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7357cdb018d0&quot;&gt;You’ll join a culture of collaboration and excellence, where you’ll be surrounded by curious thinkers and creative problem solvers. Motivated by a passion for continuous improvement, you’ll thrive in a supportive, high-performing environment alongside talented colleagues, working collectively to tackle the toughest problems in the financial markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1871&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2ddaea6b9132&quot;&gt;In addition, you’ll receive:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1903&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e291021b9ded&quot;&gt;A performance-based bonus structure, enabling all of our employees to benefit from our global profit pool&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2012&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8276fc3553e1&quot;&gt;The opportunity to work alongside best-in-class professionals from over 50 different countries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2110&quot; data-local-id=&quot;433057dc12a6&quot;&gt;25 paid vacation days in your first year, increasing to 30 from your second year onwards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2202&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ca30da314785&quot;&gt;Training opportunities, discounts on health benefits, and fully paid first-class commuting expenses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2305&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5cecda6b77b4&quot;&gt;Extensive office perks, including breakfast, lunch and dinner, world-class barista coffee, sport and leisure activities, bi-weekly massages and Friday afternoon drinks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2476&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fd339ac357a1&quot;&gt;Training and continuous learning opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2526&quot; data-local-id=&quot;100ce462c45a&quot;&gt;International transfer opportunities for global career growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2591&quot; data-local-id=&quot;66189f23de55&quot;&gt;Competitive relocation packages and visa sponsorship where necessary for expats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2674&quot; data-local-id=&quot;56772c7d608a&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2674&quot; data-local-id=&quot;56772c7d608a&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2689&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6c5bb413544a&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s, Master’s or &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;PhD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; degree in Computer Science, Computer Engineering or equivalent, with outstanding academic achievements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2823&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d3400c7ea92c&quot;&gt;Graduating between August 2024 and August 2027, with a maximum of 3 years of work experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2919&quot; data-local-id=&quot;463af9c5ec9a&quot;&gt;Passionate about clean code, simple, well-architected systems, and continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3012&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c45c85f1dfe3&quot;&gt;Proficient in industry-standard coding languages such as C++, Python, or Java, with a strong understanding of underlying computer architecture and system operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3180&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e54babb23106&quot;&gt;A solid grasp of algorithms, memory and concurrency models, CPU-architecture, operating systems and relational databases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3304&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f527d8c162f3&quot;&gt;Have an entrepreneurial attitude and an interest in the financial industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3382&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6d08a72b8aae&quot;&gt;An analytical mindset and strong problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3441&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e38ee8493017&quot;&gt;Able to work closely with other engineers, traders, researchers and business operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3534&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5c68f4d9b1b5&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3536&quot; data-local-id=&quot;90f0345d9dc5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;How to Apply: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Apply directly via the form below for the position of Graduate Software Engineer. Please provide us with a &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;CV&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; in English. Unfortunately we cannot accept applications via email for data protection reasons.&lt;br&gt;If your application is selected to proceed to the next round, you will be required to complete online assessments. By submitting your application you are confirming that you will be able to take the assessment within 7 days.&lt;br&gt;Kindly note that we do not require any assistance from third-parties including agencies in the recruitment of this role. If you have any questions feel free to contact our Recruitment team via the &lt;a class=&quot;_2hGPVj98eZ _2i3C1kYbGa _2kH23qT6kp _1ubuxonXvL _34b3D2vc3e _1NDpvb6wH8 _2wtOC9vc3e _3e11vU6wH8 _0hSAgbHZdu _00uqCY98eZ _3xtjKN0Rl6 _0H9qDF6wH8 _24h04i2Njc _1mT5xdRAKS _0WKd3G4z3T _0bjKvDcjp5 _1UtDYzM7Tp _32C2rk98eZ _0i9AWA0Rl6 _0mm6KQ6wH8 _10n1R5M7Tp _0DCa9D98eZ _3932vvYbGa _02cRtH6wH8 _0clgaMM7Tp _3WzCGi98eZ _0NqVRtYbGa _3BKYwu6wH8 _0CMRbkAwSC _2nTuUYWfPD _3ADzdEWfPD _1warJ9WfPD _4scvAwWyeI&quot; href=&quot;https://optiver.com/contact-eu-recruitment&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;contact form&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4192&quot; data-local-id=&quot;38fe5cf50d59&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4192&quot; data-local-id=&quot;38fe5cf50d59&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Diversity statement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4213&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2a97112be90e&quot;&gt;Optiver is committed to &lt;a class=&quot;_2hGPVj98eZ _2i3C1kYbGa _2kH23qT6kp _1ubuxonXvL _34b3D2vc3e _1NDpvb6wH8 _2wtOC9vc3e _3e11vU6wH8 _0hSAgbHZdu _00uqCY98eZ _3xtjKN0Rl6 _0H9qDF6wH8 _24h04i2Njc _1mT5xdRAKS _0WKd3G4z3T _0bjKvDcjp5 _1UtDYzM7Tp _32C2rk98eZ _0i9AWA0Rl6 _0mm6KQ6wH8 _10n1R5M7Tp _0DCa9D98eZ _3932vvYbGa _02cRtH6wH8 _0clgaMM7Tp _3WzCGi98eZ _0NqVRtYbGa _3BKYwu6wH8 _0CMRbkAwSC _2nTuUYWfPD _3ADzdEWfPD _1warJ9WfPD _4scvAwWyeI&quot; href=&quot;https://optiver.com/diversity-statement/&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;diversity and inclusion&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4263&quot; data-local-id=&quot;20bd7ea4004d&quot;&gt;We encourage applications from candidates from any and all backgrounds, and we welcome requests for reasonable adjustments during the process to ensure that you can best demonstrate your abilities. Please let us know if you would like to request any reasonable adjustments by contacting the Recruitment team &lt;a class=&quot;_2hGPVj98eZ _2i3C1kYbGa _2kH23qT6kp _1ubuxonXvL _34b3D2vc3e _1NDpvb6wH8 _2wtOC9vc3e _3e11vU6wH8 _0hSAgbHZdu _00uqCY98eZ _3xtjKN0Rl6 _0H9qDF6wH8 _24h04i2Njc _1mT5xdRAKS _0WKd3G4z3T _0bjKvDcjp5 _1UtDYzM7Tp _32C2rk98eZ _0i9AWA0Rl6 _0mm6KQ6wH8 _10n1R5M7Tp _0DCa9D98eZ _3932vvYbGa _02cRtH6wH8 _0clgaMM7Tp _3WzCGi98eZ _0NqVRtYbGa _3BKYwu6wH8 _0CMRbkAwSC _2nTuUYWfPD _3ADzdEWfPD _1warJ9WfPD _4scvAwWyeI&quot; href=&quot;https://optiver.com/contact-eu-recruitment/&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;via the contact form&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, selecting &quot;Reasonable Adjustments&quot; as the subject of your inquiry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4661&quot; data-local-id=&quot;76bf40e4b5ea&quot;&gt;For answers to some of our most frequently asked questions, refer to our &lt;a class=&quot;_2hGPVj98eZ _2i3C1kYbGa _2kH23qT6kp _1ubuxonXvL _34b3D2vc3e _1NDpvb6wH8 _2wtOC9vc3e _3e11vU6wH8 _0hSAgbHZdu _00uqCY98eZ _3xtjKN0Rl6 _0H9qDF6wH8 _24h04i2Njc _1mT5xdRAKS _0WKd3G4z3T _0bjKvDcjp5 _1UtDYzM7Tp _32C2rk98eZ _0i9AWA0Rl6 _0mm6KQ6wH8 _10n1R5M7Tp _0DCa9D98eZ _3932vvYbGa _02cRtH6wH8 _0clgaMM7Tp _3WzCGi98eZ _0NqVRtYbGa _3BKYwu6wH8 _0CMRbkAwSC _2nTuUYWfPD _3ADzdEWfPD _1warJ9WfPD _4scvAwWyeI&quot; href=&quot;https://www.optiver.com/join-us/stories/optiver-europe-recruitment-faq/&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;FAQs&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4741&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7a17d1986c8a&quot;&gt;For applicants based in India, our entry route is via the placement office internship hiring season (July/August).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4857&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8e3d5a4f8ece&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Optiver has a global application re-apply policy for our intern and graduate roles. If you have completed an online assessment or interviewed for a technology graduate or internship role at any Optiver location in the past 8 months, please note that you are not yet eligible to reapply. We welcome you to re-apply after the 8-month cool off period.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;comment-container&quot; class=&quot;_1mT5xdWVPG _1pp6NdYbGa _0NUa3rHMkp&quot; data-testid=&quot;comment-container&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;reading-aids-portal-container&quot; class=&quot;_4bt5LAYvD1 _2WAcuGYvD1 _1mT5xdRAKS _42Yu6BsWIj&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;cc-reading-aids-highlight-spotlight&quot; class=&quot;_1YKVNsdnbC _1mT5xdWVPG _1pp6NdYbGa _2IhTonF8yt _3OE6xYOwJF _39xV027Ovj _0jFU0VuEhg&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;If you enjoy using mathematics and code to investigate difficult questions, you could make a direct contribution to Optiver’s success in global markets. As a Graduate Quantitative Researcher, you’ll work across the full research process, from framing the question and choosing the data to building, testing and deploying models. Machine Learning is central to the work, whether you’re extracting signals, forecasting prices or modelling relationships. Our data, compute and production infrastructure let you test ideas quickly, understand where they fail and decide what to investigate next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our researchers believe in academic discourse and invite fellow researchers, traders and engineers to challenge each hypothesis. Different perspectives help improve the question, the model and how it performs in production. Through constant testing, analysis and refinement, you’ll help our quantitative models adapt as markets evolve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your onboarding&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll&amp;nbsp;participate&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ONPObMHh-k8&quot;&gt;Global Optiver Academy&lt;/a&gt;, a structured&amp;nbsp;onboarding programme for graduates. It gives new joiners a shared foundation in how Optiver trades, builds systems, and manages risk before they move into their teams.&amp;nbsp;As part of your onboarding,&amp;nbsp;you&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;gain exposure to the AI tools and technologies that support research and development across the business.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your responsibilities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on the team you join, you&#39;ll own the research end to end. That could include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building models for pricing, forecasting and signal discovery, choosing the statistical, mathematical or Machine Learning methods that best fit the problem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working across petabytes of market, order-flow and unstructured data to find signals that improve strategies as conditions change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitoring models in production and using live behavior to refine your assumptions and decide what to investigate next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Using deep learning and AI-enabled workflows to shorten the loop from hypothesis to evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working directly with researchers, traders and engineers to shape problems and understand how system constraints affect performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO YOU ARE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for aspiring Quantitative Researchers who are versatile and creative in innovating and suggesting new solutions. In return, we&#39;ll give you the freedom to pursue your ideas and implement them right into our production systems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In terms of skills and qualifications, we&#39;re looking for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An academic degree in Engineering, Physics, Maths, Econometrics, Computer science or equivalent, with outstanding academic achievements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programming experience in any language (preferably Python, but C, C++, Basic, JAVA, etc. are also a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to apply concepts of probability, calculus and linear algebra&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive attitude and eagerness to constantly improve&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to learn quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written English language skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL GET&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll join a culture of collaboration and excellence, where you’ll be surrounded by curious thinkers and creative problem solvers. Motivated by a passion for continuous improvement, you’ll thrive in a supportive, high-performing environment alongside talent colleagues, working collaboratively to tackle the toughest problems in the financial markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition, you’ll receive:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A performance-based bonus structure, enabling all of our employees to benefit from our global profit pool&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to work alongside best-in-class professionals from over 50 countries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 paid vacation days in your first year, increasing to 30 from your second year onwards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training opportunities, discounts on health benefits, and fully paid first-class commuting expenses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive office perks, including breakfast, lunch and dinner, world-class barista coffee, bi-weekly chair massages, Friday afternoon drinks, a bicycle to explore Amsterdam and much more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training and continuous learning opportunities, including access to conferences and tech events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive relocation packages and visa sponsorship where necessary for expats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HOW TO APPLY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you interested in furthering your career on one of the most dynamic and exciting trading floors in Europe?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Apply directly via the form below for the position of Graduate Quantitative Researcher. Please provide us with a CV in English.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Unfortunately we cannot accept applications via email for data protection reasons.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If your application is selected to proceed to the next round, you will be required to complete online assessments. By submitting your application you are confirming that you will be able to take the assessment within 7 days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kindly note that we do not require any assistance from third-parties including agencies in the recruitment of this role. If you have any questions feel free to contact our Recruitment team via our &lt;a href=&quot;https://optiver.com/contact-eu-recruitment/&quot;&gt;recruitment inquiry form.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity statement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Optiver is committed to &lt;a href=&quot;https://optiver.com/diversity-statement/&quot;&gt;diversity and inclusion&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We encourage applications from candidates from any and all backgrounds, and we welcome requests for reasonable adjustments during the process to ensure that you can best demonstrate your abilities. Please let us know if you would like to request any reasonable adjustments by contacting the Recruitment team via the &lt;a href=&quot;https://optiver.com/contact-eu-recruitment&quot;&gt;contact form&lt;/a&gt;, selecting &quot;Reasonable Adjustments&quot; as the subject of your inquiry&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For answers to some of our most frequently asked questions, refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.optiver.com/join-us/stories/optiver-europe-recruitment-faq/&quot;&gt;recruitment FAQ&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For applicants based in India, our entry route is via the placement office internship hiring season (July/August).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;*Optiver has a global application re-apply policy for our intern and graduate roles. If you have completed an online assessment or interviewed for a quantitative graduate or internship role at any Optiver location in the past 8 months, please note that you are not yet eligible to reapply. We welcome you to re-apply after the 8-month cool off period.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;6618a4c09482&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f161c5e0e159&quot;&gt;As an &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;FPGA&lt;/span&gt; Engineer, you’ll work side-by-side with teammates to build real-world applications that power a global trading firm. You’ll create solutions with nanosecond response times, highly parallelized algorithms, and customized low-level networking that solve business challenges effectively and efficiently. Collaborating closely with our business, you’ll have in-depth insight into a problem before developing the solution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;431&quot; data-local-id=&quot;adba195f4739&quot;&gt;Optiver is building with cutting edge AI technology in the most competitive, data rich landscapes in the world: financial markets. Our &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;FPGA&lt;/span&gt; engineers use AI to speed up verification, debugging, and technical research, while retaining full ownership of the designs and decisions it supports.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;723&quot; data-local-id=&quot;17a0fe36f211&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;739&quot; data-local-id=&quot;73bf921aff41&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Your onboarding&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;756&quot; data-local-id=&quot;faf72777d0b4&quot;&gt;You will participate in Optiver’s comprehensive &lt;a class=&quot;_2hGPVj98eZ _2i3C1kYbGa _2kH23qT6kp _1ubuxonXvL _34b3D2vc3e _1NDpvb6wH8 _2wtOC9vc3e _3e11vU6wH8 _0hSAgbHZdu _00uqCY98eZ _3xtjKN0Rl6 _0H9qDF6wH8 _24h04i2Njc _1mT5xdRAKS _0WKd3G4z3T _0bjKvDcjp5 _1UtDYzM7Tp _32C2rk98eZ _0i9AWA0Rl6 _0mm6KQ6wH8 _10n1R5M7Tp _0DCa9D98eZ _3932vvYbGa _02cRtH6wH8 _0clgaMM7Tp _3WzCGi98eZ _0NqVRtYbGa _3BKYwu6wH8 _0CMRbkAwSC _2nTuUYWfPD _3ADzdEWfPD _1warJ9WfPD _4scvAwWyeI&quot; href=&quot;https://optiver.com/working-at-optiver/career-hub/kickstart-your-tech-career-with-the-global-optiver-academy-technology/&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Global Academy&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and be equipped with the knowledge needed to make an impact the moment you join your team. The comprehensive training covers trading theory and Optiver’s tech stack to hone your skills for your role. In addition, you will be paired with a dedicated mentor who will empower you to take ownership of your work and make a difference.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1151&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ca6e2c0c77c8&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a0e361e4-6196-4356-8541-d8f002e435bf&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1176&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3eac520c2171&quot;&gt;Accelerate network infrastructure and trading system components with high-speed hardware designs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1277&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a022afb9a9ab&quot;&gt;Research new low-latency techniques and platforms and identify opportunities for integration with our trading system.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1398&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fadf5bffabfd&quot;&gt;Collaborate in a multidisciplinary team of traders, software developers, and infrastructure engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1504&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5addbd5461f6&quot;&gt;Leverage the best hardware available or build in-house versions to ensure our FPGAs can interface with cutting-edge server hardware.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1641&quot; data-local-id=&quot;146a73037404&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What you’ll get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1658&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3eacf938451f&quot;&gt;You’ll join a culture of collaboration and excellence, where you’ll be surrounded by curious thinkers and creative problem solvers. Motivated by a passion for continuous improvement, you’ll thrive in a supportive, high-performing environment alongside talented colleagues, working collectively to tackle the toughest problems in the financial markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2011&quot; data-local-id=&quot;503188307740&quot;&gt;In addition, you’ll receive:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;99ca3959-15c0-45f1-a447-767e53fdf49b&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2043&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1f9c9f8fb4a2&quot;&gt;A performance-based bonus structure, enabling all of our employees to benefit from our global profit pool&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2152&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e3fe9d7a371b&quot;&gt;The opportunity to work alongside best-in-class professionals from over 50 different countries&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2250&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f436e67758ba&quot;&gt;25 paid vacation days in your first year, increasing to 30 from your second year onwards&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2342&quot; data-local-id=&quot;30a31e86a468&quot;&gt;Training opportunities, discounts on health benefits, and fully paid first-class commuting expenses&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2445&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fb0b9c1fb6fb&quot;&gt;Extensive office perks, including breakfast, lunch and dinner, world-class barista coffee, sport and leisure activities, bi-weekly massages and Friday afternoon drinks&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2616&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fa46477f06b3&quot;&gt;Training and continuous learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2666&quot; data-local-id=&quot;044e9d2ff377&quot;&gt;International transfer opportunities for global career growth&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2731&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3c7c84d9e057&quot;&gt;Competitive relocation packages and visa sponsorship where necessary for expats&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2814&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4ffe813798de&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8295f26d0d39&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2829&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9cb4fbc9c504&quot;&gt;University degree in Electrical/Electronic Engineering, Computer Engineering or similar, with outstanding academic achievements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2960&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c29bca845925&quot;&gt;Graduating between August 2024 and August 2027, with a maximum of 3 years of work experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3056&quot; data-local-id=&quot;88b9545187e7&quot;&gt;Academic design experience with FPGAs or ASICs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3106&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f0a544f723de&quot;&gt;Academic experience in &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;VHDL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, Verilog, or SystemVerilog&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3164&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d77564dce5cd&quot;&gt;An open, collaborative, self-critical attitude and willingness to learn from your mistakes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3258&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6bc214fc201c&quot;&gt;A desire to understand how the systems you build fit into our trading activities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3342&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1b4604aa2b53&quot;&gt;Able to work closely with other engineers, traders, and business operations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3421&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3128ca8fb8fd&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3423&quot; data-local-id=&quot;823584a77e0c&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;How to Apply: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Apply directly via the form below for the position of Graduate &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;FPGA&lt;/span&gt; Engineer. Please provide us with a &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;CV&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; in English. Unfortunately we cannot accept applications via email for data protection reasons.&lt;br&gt;If your application is selected to proceed to the next round, you will be required to complete online assessments. By submitting your application you are confirming that you will be able to take the assessment within 7 days.&lt;br&gt;Kindly note that we do not require any assistance from third-parties including agencies in the recruitment of this role. If you have any questions feel free to contact our Recruitment team via the &lt;a class=&quot;_2hGPVj98eZ _2i3C1kYbGa _2kH23qT6kp _1ubuxonXvL _34b3D2vc3e _1NDpvb6wH8 _2wtOC9vc3e _3e11vU6wH8 _0hSAgbHZdu _00uqCY98eZ _3xtjKN0Rl6 _0H9qDF6wH8 _24h04i2Njc _1mT5xdRAKS _0WKd3G4z3T _0bjKvDcjp5 _1UtDYzM7Tp _32C2rk98eZ _0i9AWA0Rl6 _0mm6KQ6wH8 _10n1R5M7Tp _0DCa9D98eZ _3932vvYbGa _02cRtH6wH8 _0clgaMM7Tp _3WzCGi98eZ _0NqVRtYbGa _3BKYwu6wH8 _0CMRbkAwSC _2nTuUYWfPD _3ADzdEWfPD _1warJ9WfPD _4scvAwWyeI&quot; href=&quot;https://optiver.com/contact-eu-recruitment&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;contact form&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4075&quot; data-local-id=&quot;139f367f88ca&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4078&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5abdd7d99e5d&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Diversity statement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4099&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6aff0008585e&quot;&gt;Optiver is committed to &lt;a class=&quot;_2hGPVj98eZ _2i3C1kYbGa _2kH23qT6kp _1ubuxonXvL _34b3D2vc3e _1NDpvb6wH8 _2wtOC9vc3e _3e11vU6wH8 _0hSAgbHZdu _00uqCY98eZ _3xtjKN0Rl6 _0H9qDF6wH8 _24h04i2Njc _1mT5xdRAKS _0WKd3G4z3T _0bjKvDcjp5 _1UtDYzM7Tp _32C2rk98eZ _0i9AWA0Rl6 _0mm6KQ6wH8 _10n1R5M7Tp _0DCa9D98eZ _3932vvYbGa _02cRtH6wH8 _0clgaMM7Tp _3WzCGi98eZ _0NqVRtYbGa _3BKYwu6wH8 _0CMRbkAwSC _2nTuUYWfPD _3ADzdEWfPD _1warJ9WfPD _4scvAwWyeI&quot; href=&quot;https://optiver.com/diversity-statement/&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;diversity and inclusion&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4149&quot; data-local-id=&quot;22b474595d9b&quot;&gt;We encourage applications from candidates from any and all backgrounds, and we welcome requests for reasonable adjustments during the process to ensure that you can best demonstrate your abilities. Please let us know if you would like to request any reasonable adjustments by contacting the Recruitment team &lt;a class=&quot;_2hGPVj98eZ _2i3C1kYbGa _2kH23qT6kp _1ubuxonXvL _34b3D2vc3e _1NDpvb6wH8 _2wtOC9vc3e _3e11vU6wH8 _0hSAgbHZdu _00uqCY98eZ _3xtjKN0Rl6 _0H9qDF6wH8 _24h04i2Njc _1mT5xdRAKS _0WKd3G4z3T _0bjKvDcjp5 _1UtDYzM7Tp _32C2rk98eZ _0i9AWA0Rl6 _0mm6KQ6wH8 _10n1R5M7Tp _0DCa9D98eZ _3932vvYbGa _02cRtH6wH8 _0clgaMM7Tp _3WzCGi98eZ _0NqVRtYbGa _3BKYwu6wH8 _0CMRbkAwSC _2nTuUYWfPD _3ADzdEWfPD _1warJ9WfPD _4scvAwWyeI&quot; href=&quot;https://optiver.com/contact-eu-recruitment/&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;via the contact form&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, selecting &quot;Reasonable Adjustments&quot; as the subject of your inquiry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4547&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5d289fcd7c1a&quot;&gt;For answers to some of our most frequently asked questions, refer to our &lt;a class=&quot;_2hGPVj98eZ _2i3C1kYbGa _2kH23qT6kp _1ubuxonXvL _34b3D2vc3e _1NDpvb6wH8 _2wtOC9vc3e _3e11vU6wH8 _0hSAgbHZdu _00uqCY98eZ _3xtjKN0Rl6 _0H9qDF6wH8 _24h04i2Njc _1mT5xdRAKS _0WKd3G4z3T _0bjKvDcjp5 _1UtDYzM7Tp _32C2rk98eZ _0i9AWA0Rl6 _0mm6KQ6wH8 _10n1R5M7Tp _0DCa9D98eZ _3932vvYbGa _02cRtH6wH8 _0clgaMM7Tp _3WzCGi98eZ _0NqVRtYbGa _3BKYwu6wH8 _0CMRbkAwSC _2nTuUYWfPD _3ADzdEWfPD _1warJ9WfPD _4scvAwWyeI&quot; href=&quot;https://www.optiver.com/join-us/stories/optiver-europe-recruitment-faq/&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;FAQs&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4627&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ddd7edd2cd3e&quot;&gt;For applicants based in India, our entry route is via the placement office internship hiring season (July/August).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4743&quot; data-local-id=&quot;895e3754d5bc&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Optiver has a global application re-apply policy for our intern and graduate roles. If you have completed an online assessment or interviewed for a technology graduate or internship role at any Optiver location in the past 8 months, please note that you are not yet eligible to reapply. We welcome you to re-apply after the 8-month cool off period.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;6618a4c09482&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;18&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a3536f325169&quot;&gt;Optiver’s Equity Options Trading team is looking for Graduate Equity Analysts to help shape our fundamental research-driven trading.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;152&quot; data-local-id=&quot;db0ba8cc7931&quot;&gt;As an Equity Analyst at Optiver you will use current events and fundamental research to influence the team’s trading decisions. You will sit directly on the trading floor and work in close collaboration with Traders, Quantitative Researchers and Developers to creatively solve problems and identify new trading opportunities. You will also put on research-backed trades based on your own analysis, giving you direct ownership of your best ideas and rapid feedback from the market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;634&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ea5b2490807b&quot;&gt;You will begin with structured training through the Optiver Academy for Equity Analysts. As your market knowledge and judgement develop, you will take increasing ownership of company coverage, research ideas and research-backed trading positions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;882&quot; data-local-id=&quot;42b6dfb00cba&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;898&quot; data-local-id=&quot;33cea613784f&quot;&gt;In this role, you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;934&quot; data-local-id=&quot;88f01e76d6cd&quot;&gt;Identify fundamentally driven trading opportunities and work with traders to capture them, focusing on maximising your impact on overall desk PnL.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;934&quot; data-local-id=&quot;88f01e76d6cd&quot;&gt;Think probabilistically and perform scenario analysis for relevant upcoming events and catalysts. Analyse time sensitive headlines for companies within your coverage sectors and assess their potential impact on volatility and/or stock prices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;934&quot; data-local-id=&quot;88f01e76d6cd&quot;&gt;Assist in the growth of our fundamental research team by developing processes, identifying new areas of market inefficiencies and building relevant industry networks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;934&quot; data-local-id=&quot;88f01e76d6cd&quot;&gt;Use AI-enabled tools, supported by training, to organise and analyse news, events and company information, applying your own judgement to validate their output and improve the research tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1696&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9b9380fa8802&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What you’ll get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1713&quot; data-local-id=&quot;cfa6f76e629a&quot;&gt;You’ll join a culture of collaboration and excellence, where you’ll be surrounded by curious thinkers and creative problem solvers. Motivated by a passion for continuous improvement, you’ll thrive in a supportive, high-performing environment alongside talented colleagues, working collectively to tackle the toughest problems in the financial markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2066&quot; data-local-id=&quot;29ae3e14b268&quot;&gt;In addition, you’ll receive:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2098&quot; data-local-id=&quot;684ee4ad0208&quot;&gt;A performance-based bonus structure&amp;nbsp;unmatched&amp;nbsp;anywhere in the industry. We combine our profits across desks, teams and offices into a global profit pool.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2255&quot; data-local-id=&quot;89e030f63059&quot;&gt;The opportunity to work alongside best-in-class professionals from over 50 different countries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2354&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b5addfc78eba&quot;&gt;25 paid vacation days in your first year, increasing to 30 from your second year onwards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2447&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2f059267a6ea&quot;&gt;Training opportunities, discounts on health insurance, and fully paid first-class commuting expenses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2552&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9eb1e2d667ed&quot;&gt;Extensive office perks, including breakfast, lunch and dinner, world-class barista coffee, in-house physio and chair massages, organized sports and leisure activities, and Friday afternoon drinks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2752&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fa2c0a7f0a05&quot;&gt;Training and continuous learning opportunities, including access to conferences and tech events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2852&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2937b484923c&quot;&gt;Competitive relocation packages and visa sponsorship where necessary for expats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2936&quot; data-local-id=&quot;28812707fd7a&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2951&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fa2c3ca0a1cb&quot;&gt;Minimum of Bachelor’s degree in a STEM, Finance, Economics or business related subject&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3041&quot; data-local-id=&quot;79505b3b6b1f&quot;&gt;Available to start full time work in August 2027 (either graduating by 2027, or holding a maximum of 3 years work experience)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3170&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6d4b56ded7b9&quot;&gt;Has a genuine interest in financial markets and demonstrates a willingness to learn new techniques/skills and teach others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3296&quot; data-local-id=&quot;392b72d9a2ae&quot;&gt;Able to work under the guidance of mentors and develop fundamental research-driven ideas independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3402&quot; data-local-id=&quot;56122bed3015&quot;&gt;Possesses strong communication and interpersonal skills, both verbally and in writing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3491&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c67b04615f6c&quot;&gt;Entrepreneurial by nature - you&#39;ve run something of your own, taken risks that didn&#39;t always pay off, or committed to getting genuinely good at something difficult&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3658&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b533c78a1680&quot;&gt;A determined and resilient individual, equipped with strong analytical, quantitative and problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3773&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0c70af11e81c&quot;&gt;Evidenced time management, organizational and multitasking skills with experience in computer programming being preferred, but not required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3916&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6db75bf212a2&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3919&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1de1e11275d3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;How to apply&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3933&quot; data-local-id=&quot;36316e62ecba&quot;&gt;Are you interested in furthering your career on one of the most dynamic and exciting trading floors in Europe?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4045&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1e055d055ff5&quot;&gt;Apply directly via the form below for the position of Graduate Equity Analyst. Please provide us with a CV in English. Unfortunately we cannot accept applications via email for data protection reasons.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4249&quot; data-local-id=&quot;61905360af54&quot;&gt;If your application is selected to proceed to the next round, you will be required to complete online assessments. By submitting your application you are confirming that you will be able to take the assessment within 7 days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4475&quot; data-local-id=&quot;258c451543e9&quot;&gt;Kindly note that we do not require any assistance from third-parties including agencies in the recruitment of this role. If you have any questions feel free to contact our Recruitment team via our &lt;a class=&quot;_2hGPVj98eZ _2i3C1kYbGa _2kH23qT6kp _1ubuxonXvL _34b3D2vc3e _1NDpvb6wH8 _2wtOC9vc3e _3e11vU6wH8 _0hSAgbHZdu _00uqCY98eZ _3xtjKN0Rl6 _0H9qDF6wH8 _24h04i2Njc _1mT5xdRAKS _0WKd3G4z3T _0bjKvDcjp5 _1UtDYzM7Tp _32C2rk98eZ _0i9AWA0Rl6 _0mm6KQ6wH8 _10n1R5M7Tp _0DCa9D98eZ _3932vvYbGa _02cRtH6wH8 _0clgaMM7Tp _3WzCGi98eZ _0NqVRtYbGa _3BKYwu6wH8 _0CMRbkAwSC _2nTuUYWfPD _3ADzdEWfPD _1warJ9WfPD _4scvAwWyeI&quot; href=&quot;https://optiver.com/contact-eu-recruitment/&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;recruitment inquiry form.&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4699&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3b788c694ed7&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4701&quot; data-local-id=&quot;337e72db2832&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Diversity statement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4722&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8c14e58c4445&quot;&gt;Optiver is committed to &lt;a class=&quot;_2hGPVj98eZ _2i3C1kYbGa _2kH23qT6kp _1ubuxonXvL _34b3D2vc3e _1NDpvb6wH8 _2wtOC9vc3e _3e11vU6wH8 _0hSAgbHZdu _00uqCY98eZ _3xtjKN0Rl6 _0H9qDF6wH8 _24h04i2Njc _1mT5xdRAKS _0WKd3G4z3T _0bjKvDcjp5 _1UtDYzM7Tp _32C2rk98eZ _0i9AWA0Rl6 _0mm6KQ6wH8 _10n1R5M7Tp _0DCa9D98eZ _3932vvYbGa _02cRtH6wH8 _0clgaMM7Tp _3WzCGi98eZ _0NqVRtYbGa _3BKYwu6wH8 _0CMRbkAwSC _2nTuUYWfPD _3ADzdEWfPD _1warJ9WfPD _4scvAwWyeI&quot; href=&quot;https://optiver.com/diversity-statement/&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;diversity and inclusion&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4772&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3be1da92aab5&quot;&gt;We encourage applications from candidates from any and all backgrounds, and we welcome requests for reasonable adjustments during the process to ensure that you can best demonstrate your abilities. Please let us know if you would like to request any reasonable adjustments by contacting the Recruitment team via&lt;a class=&quot;_2hGPVj98eZ _2i3C1kYbGa _2kH23qT6kp _1ubuxonXvL _34b3D2vc3e _1NDpvb6wH8 _2wtOC9vc3e _3e11vU6wH8 _0hSAgbHZdu _00uqCY98eZ _3xtjKN0Rl6 _0H9qDF6wH8 _24h04i2Njc _1mT5xdRAKS _0WKd3G4z3T _0bjKvDcjp5 _1UtDYzM7Tp _32C2rk98eZ _0i9AWA0Rl6 _0mm6KQ6wH8 _10n1R5M7Tp _0DCa9D98eZ _3932vvYbGa _02cRtH6wH8 _0clgaMM7Tp _3WzCGi98eZ _0NqVRtYbGa _3BKYwu6wH8 _0CMRbkAwSC _2nTuUYWfPD _3ADzdEWfPD _1warJ9WfPD _4scvAwWyeI&quot; href=&quot;https://optiver.com/contact-eu-recruitment&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt; the contact form&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, selecting &quot;Reasonable Adjustments&quot; as the subject of your inquiry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5170&quot; data-local-id=&quot;07a74f8a3e35&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5173&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a9adbea60b1b&quot;&gt;For answers to some of our most frequently asked questions, refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;_2hGPVj98eZ _2i3C1kYbGa _2kH23qT6kp _1ubuxonXvL _34b3D2vc3e _1NDpvb6wH8 _2wtOC9vc3e _3e11vU6wH8 _0hSAgbHZdu _00uqCY98eZ _3xtjKN0Rl6 _0H9qDF6wH8 _24h04i2Njc _1mT5xdRAKS _0WKd3G4z3T _0bjKvDcjp5 _1UtDYzM7Tp _32C2rk98eZ _0i9AWA0Rl6 _0mm6KQ6wH8 _10n1R5M7Tp _0DCa9D98eZ _3932vvYbGa _02cRtH6wH8 _0clgaMM7Tp _3WzCGi98eZ _0NqVRtYbGa _3BKYwu6wH8 _0CMRbkAwSC _2nTuUYWfPD _3ADzdEWfPD _1warJ9WfPD _4scvAwWyeI&quot; href=&quot;https://www.optiver.com/join-us/stories/optiver-europe-recruitment-faq/&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Recruitment FAQs&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5265&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fbd1209b8799&quot;&gt;For applicants based in India, our entry route is via the placement office internship hiring season (July/August).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5381&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a002ef8b9615&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;*We accept one application per role per year. If you have previously applied to this position during this season and have been unsuccessful, you can reapply once the next recruitment season begins in 2027.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_3iDTPbvLZJ renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-level=&quot;3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;What-you&#39;ll-do&quot; data-local-id=&quot;18bde380becb&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5288&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;heading-anchor-wrapper css-0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5304&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d074e36cff1b&quot;&gt;You will establish Corporate Engineering as a new capability inside Optiver&#39;s Platform Engineering group and become the single point of accountability for our corporate technology stack. Reporting to the Head of Enterprise Platform, you will own the direction, the team, and the operating model.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5601&quot; data-local-id=&quot;40e0e1f3f1fb&quot;&gt;The opportunity is broader than modernizing individual systems or automating existing processes. We believe AI will fundamentally change how our corporate functions contribute to the firm, and realizing that will mean redesigning important workflows from the ground up, establishing stronger foundations in data and technology, and creating new ways for business and engineering teams to work together. This is not about applying AI to inefficient processes and leaving them intact. It is about simplifying the underlying workflows so that people, data, software and agents can work together effectively.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6207&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a9317deb9c30&quot;&gt;The roadmap is set in partnership. Our corporate functions own the prioritization of the business problems worth solving and the transformation they want to lead. Corporate Engineering owns the technical solution, how it is built, and the architecture it fits into, and works alongside each function to shape where engineering effort goes so that it returns the most value. Making that partnership work is at the core of this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6640&quot; data-local-id=&quot;074892d79010&quot;&gt;In this role you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;91a0235f-cd2c-4ae2-8b5b-3e4a1990e16f&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6666&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d1b1a9bc4201&quot;&gt;Define the technology vision and architecture for our corporate functions, and own the trade-offs across scalability, governance, security, cost and architectural consistency that span them and connect them to the wider Platform Engineering ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6921&quot; data-local-id=&quot;226d7b1dc683&quot;&gt;Set the engineering roadmap in partnership with the functions, translating the business priorities they own into a technical plan you own.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7063&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f915b3a8e952&quot;&gt;Bring an engineering view of cost, feasibility and reuse into business prioritization, so each function can weigh what an outcome is worth against what it takes to build and run.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7245&quot; data-local-id=&quot;71e46cbfbcb9&quot;&gt;Build and lead a high-caliber software engineering team, including hiring, performance, career development and delivery, based primarily in Amsterdam with distributed members in the US and APAC.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7443&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0c5559c379bc&quot;&gt;Contribute materially to the software engineering output of the Corporate Engineering team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7538&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8e7a6c8dc922&quot;&gt;Build trusted relationships with senior stakeholders in our business operations and support functions (e.g. finance, people, legal, and compliance).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7690&quot; data-local-id=&quot;063c18a8daeb&quot;&gt;Make deliberate build versus buy decisions, with real engineering capacity behind the build option and a clear view of where a vendor platform is the right answer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7857&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d1cd0fef448c&quot;&gt;Solve common problems once and reuse the solution, from knowledge bases and agent harnesses to integration and automation patterns shared across every corporate function.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;8031&quot; data-local-id=&quot;cfa292353abe&quot;&gt;Partner closely with the Enterprise, Data and AI platform teams so that Corporate Engineering builds on existing Optiver building blocks instead of recreating them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;8199&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c29af357688d&quot;&gt;Success will mean measurably reducing the administrative and operational burden carried by our corporate functions, so that talented people spend their time on judgement, advice and decisions that directly enable the business. It will also mean an engineering organization that is trusted to turn complex corporate technology problems into scalable, well-designed solutions, repeatedly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_3iDTPbvLZJ renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-level=&quot;3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;Who-you-are&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e86a65b58478&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;8587&quot;&gt;Who you are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;heading-anchor-wrapper css-0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1bc0e0f5-871f-4ae2-a95a-11268bd83784&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;8602&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7bc3b076c625&quot;&gt;An experienced engineering leader who has built and grown strong software engineering teams, with a track record of hiring well and setting a high technical bar.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;8767&quot; data-local-id=&quot;aa98171f68d6&quot;&gt;Experienced leading complex transformation programs end to end, from problem definition through architecture, delivery and measurable business outcome.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;8922&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8c3197bfed93&quot;&gt;Credible with senior business leaders, with direct experience delivering technology and change to executive stakeholders in functions such as finance, people, legal or compliance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9105&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fa859494c201&quot;&gt;Strong in enterprise architecture across integration, orchestration, data and identity, with the judgement to know when to standardize and when a purposeful difference is justified.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9164473fcb96&quot;&gt;Deeply knowledgeable about AI, automation, data and process transformation, and specifically on what these mean in a corporate function context rather than in the abstract.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9466&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f2884e31ae2d&quot;&gt;Technically credible and comfortable staying close to production systems, architectural decisions and difficult delivery problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9600&quot; data-local-id=&quot;07aa0660a05a&quot;&gt;Product-minded, able to distinguish the problem worth solving from the request that was made, and willing to say no when merited.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9733&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a05fbbeb0543&quot;&gt;Commercially grounded, able to connect technology decisions to cost, risk, opportunity and the time of the people the work is meant to free up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9880&quot; data-local-id=&quot;98d69d84bbcb&quot;&gt;A strong communicator who can make complex technical matters clear to audiences with very different levels of technical depth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;10010&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9f9e1f5962bf&quot;&gt;Comfortable building something new, including the ambiguity, the stakeholder management and the patience that a first year of a new team requires.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;10160&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5b6c658858ed&quot;&gt;You are likely someone who has spent a significant part of your career close to complex systems rather than moving entirely away from technology as your leadership responsibilities grew. At the same time, you recognize that at this level your impact comes from the quality of the team you build, the decisions you enable others to make, and your ability to create alignment across a global organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_3iDTPbvLZJ renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-level=&quot;3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;Experience-that-helps&quot; data-local-id=&quot;80b155deb062&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;10565&quot;&gt;Experience that helps&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;heading-anchor-wrapper css-0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f97302b0-fe01-4f83-aa63-6e99283aa370&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;10590&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9a0e9bb14149&quot;&gt;Background in a technology company, a SaaS business serving finance, people or legal functions, or a large global enterprise with a mature internally facing engineering organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;10776&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7f51a0e85863&quot;&gt;Prior ownership of a corporate, enterprise, or business engineering function.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;10857&quot; data-local-id=&quot;095a845b4cf5&quot;&gt;Hands-on exposure to platforms such as Workday, NetSuite, Databricks, Workato, and to AI and automation toolsets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;10974&quot; data-local-id=&quot;150f71e560f3&quot;&gt;Experience building and operating agentic systems in production, including the knowledge, evaluation and governance foundations underneath them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;11122&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f328752dd6f8&quot;&gt;Experience in financial services or another environment with a low tolerance for operational error&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;No prior trading or financial experience is needed – our onboarding program will kick-start your career at Optiver and support you in gaining all the relevant knowledge about our business.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Optiver, our mission is to constantly improve the market by injecting liquidity, providing accurate pricing, increasing transparency and acting as a stabilizing force no matter the market conditions. With a focus on continuous improvement, we participate in the safeguarding of healthy and efficient markets for everyone who participates. As one of the largest market making institutions, we are a trusted partner of 70+ exchanges across the globe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You’ll join a culture of collaboration and excellence, where you’ll be surrounded by curious thinkers and creative problem solvers. Motivated by a passion for continuous improvement, you’ll thrive in a supportive, high-performing environment alongside talented colleagues, working collectively to tackle the toughest problems in the financial markets.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In addition, you’ll receive:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A performance-based bonus structure, enabling all of our employees to benefit from our global profit pool.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to work alongside best-in-class professionals from over 50 different countries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 paid vacation days in your first year, increasing to 30 from your second year onwards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training opportunities, discounts on health insurance, and fully paid first-class commuting expenses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive office perks, including breakfast, lunch and dinner, world-class barista coffee, in-house physio and chair massages, organized sports and leisure activities, and Friday afternoon drinks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training and continuous learning opportunities, including access to conferences and tech events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How to apply&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Apply directly via the form below. If you have any questions feel free to contact our Recruitment team via our &lt;a href=&quot;https://optiver.com/contact-eu-recruitment/&quot;&gt;recruitment inquiry form&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Please note:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We do not require any assistance from third-parties including agencies in the recruitment of this role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We cannot accept applications via email&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity statement&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Optiver is committed to &lt;a href=&quot;https://optiver.com/diversity-statement/?_gl=1*bh82o8*_up*MQ..&amp;amp;gclid=EAIaIQobChMItNH9v-THiQMVyJZQBh1Kbw3YEAAYASABEgI0z_D_BwE&quot;&gt;diversity and inclusion.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Optiver is seeking a seasoned Data Engineer to support and advance the data capabilities of our local research team and contribute to our broader Lakehouse architecture vision. In this role, you&#39;ll work with cutting-edge tools like Databricks, Apache Spark, and Delta Lake, translating experimental research workflows into scalable, production-grade systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a critical engineering presence in Amsterdam, you&#39;ll directly influence local data strategy while collaborating with our Global Research and Data Platform teams. Your work will drive real-time insights, enable predictive analytics, and power decision-making across the trading lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role combines hands-on data engineering, cross-regional collaboration, and platform innovation—all within a high-performance, data-driven environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Lead Data Engineer, your responsibilities include:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and maintain reliable ETL/ELT pipelines using Spark, Structured Streaming, Databricks, and our in-house high-performance tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize and productionize research workflows with a strong focus on scalability, resilience, and performance tuning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with power users to develop and share reusable patterns, templates, and onboarding pathways&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, document, and enforce data engineering best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor junior engineers and drive a culture of continuous learning and DataOps excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL GET&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1603&quot;&gt;At Optiver, data is central to everything we do. You’ll join a small, high-impact team with a mandate to build &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;best-in-class data capabilities&lt;/strong&gt; from the ground up. Here, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1785&quot;&gt;Work with a &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;modern Lakehouse + dbt stack&lt;/strong&gt;, setting the standards others will follow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1872&quot;&gt;See your models and pipelines directly shape decision-making across the firm.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1953&quot;&gt;Grow alongside experienced data leaders in a culture of &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;excellence, innovation, and continuous improvement&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;197&quot;&gt;You’ll join a culture of collaboration and excellence, where you’ll be surrounded by curious thinkers and creative problem solvers. Motivated by a passion for continuous improvement, you’ll thrive in a supportive, high-performing environment alongside talented colleagues, working collectively to tackle the toughest problems in the financial markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;550&quot;&gt;In addition, you’ll receive:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;582&quot;&gt;A performance-based bonus structure, enabling all of our employees to benefit from our global profit pool.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;582&quot;&gt;The opportunity to work alongside best-in-class professionals from over 50 different countries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;791&quot;&gt;25 paid vacation days in your first year, increasing to 30 from your second year onwards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;884&quot;&gt;Training opportunities, discounts on health insurance, and fully paid first-class commuting expenses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;989&quot;&gt;Extensive office perks, including breakfast, lunch and dinner, world-class barista coffee, in-house physio and chair massages, organized sports and leisure activities, and Friday afternoon drinks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1189&quot;&gt;Training and continuous learning opportunities, including access to conferences and tech events.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1289&quot;&gt;Competitive relocation packages and visa sponsorship where necessary for expats.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
